m/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/b82eecbdac266fcee8e04812c34736bec671be05"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/a00e6c09cc08d41fb501537535802cb5ed99ab75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:18:33Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:18:33Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"message":"fix: NaN en Tiempo Total de turnos sin pausa (Reporte Maestro)\n\nhmsToMs('''') dejaba minutos/segundos en undefined y el chequeo con\nNumber.isNaN no lo detectaba, así que el total salía NaN:NaN:NaN en todo\nturno sin tiempo pausado. Ahora se parsea con regex y cae a 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9389a9c4f4f89ac45fd110da995e32dd5aabc628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/trees/9389a9c4f4f89ac45fd110da995e32dd5aabc628"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/commits/a00e6c09cc08d41fb501537535802cb5ed99ab75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/a00e6c09cc08d41fb501537535802cb5ed99ab75","node_id":"C_kwDOTUuRz9oAKGEwMGU2YzA5Y2MwOGQ0MWZiNTAxNTM3NTM1ODAyY2I1ZWQ5OWFiNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95","sha":"6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95"}],"sha":"a00e6c09cc08d41fb501537535802cb5ed99ab75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/a00e6c09cc08d41fb501537535802cb5ed99ab75"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:08:46Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:08:46Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"message":"fix: Tiempo Total en filas de Tienda y Cliente pasa del Reporte Maestro\n\nTienda no llenaba la columna (salía N/A). Ahora: Tienda = llegada ->\nentrega menos el tiempo pausado; Cliente pasa = captura del foráneo ->\nentrega en tienda menos el tiempo pausado. Vacío si no se ha entregado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa941a1e520201851c62318960235cf4b7209850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/trees/fa941a1e520201851c62318960235cf4b7209850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/commits/6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95","node_id":"C_kwDOTUuRz9oAKDY1ODRhOTJkZmM3OGI3Zjc4ZGJmYzc4MTkyM2JjZThkYzhkZDNjOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707","sha":"a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707"}],"sha":"6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/6584a92dfc78b7f78dbfc781923bce8dc8dd3c95"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:50:12Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:50:12Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"message":"fix: unificar pedidos \"cliente pasa\" en una sola fila del Reporte Maestro\n\nLos foráneos con paquetería CLIENTE / cliente_pasa (o PASA_TIENDA) nacen\nen remote_orders y terminan como checkin, por lo que salían dos veces con\nla trazabilidad partida. Ahora se cruzan por número de pedido (sin\ndistinguir mayúsculas, incluyendo agregados): la fila de tienda conserva\nsu trazabilidad y el foráneo completa lo que falta (asesor, paquetería,\nfactura, facturado por...). La fila resultante queda en el área nueva\n\"Cliente pasa\"; si no se encuentra el turno, el foráneo sigue saliendo solo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bedf27061c4531d74d6b00bf2bb542d5bd774d41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/trees/bedf27061c4531d74d6b00bf2bb542d5bd774d41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/commits/a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707","node_id":"C_kwDOTUuRz9oAKGE3YjQ0YjkyYTgxZTU2ZjgyZjViMGU4Njg5YmFiNTkwOGQ2ZmY3MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14","sha":"7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14"}],"sha":"a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/a7b44b92a81e56f82f5b0e8689bab5908d6ff707"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:43:58Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:43:58Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"message":"feat: registrar incidencia de surtido desde el tablero de foráneos\n\nBotón \"Registrar incidencia\" en AlmacenView (oculto para gerencia) que\nabre IncidentModal: mismo flujo que el panel de checkin en point-of-sale\ny mismos endpoints del back de Node (/node-api/surtido-incident y\n/node-api/surtido_incident_type). El pedido se busca entre los foráneos\ncargados; si no está en el tablero se registra igual por número de pedido.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa854bbe7e365daad5ff3efb45872873dd8d6bdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/trees/aa854bbe7e365daad5ff3efb45872873dd8d6bdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/git/commits/7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14","node_id":"C_kwDOTUuRz9oAKDdhNjIzZDQyZTU2NjE2NmFkYzAwNTg3NzkwMmQ4NDQ5ZGQzN2NhMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commit/7c08ae39870aa6113a3b7d8eab94eddb1f1409a6","sha":"7c08ae39870aa6113a3b7d8eab94eddb1f1409a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/7c08ae39870aa6113a3b7d8eab94eddb1f1409a6"}],"sha":"7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/7a623d42e566166adc005877902d8449dd37ca14"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jareth1251/reportes-foraneos/commits/7c08ae39870aa6113a3b7d8eab94eddb1f1409a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:23:17Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaerth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:23:17Z","email":"jarethyelos96@gmail.com","name":"jaert