r app that listens for submitted tasks and processes them.\n- Introduced attestation signing functionality to create signed attestations for verification outcomes.\n- Implemented attestation submission to submit the signed attestations on-chain.\n- Created multiple verification runners (CodeRunner, ImageChecker, SemanticChecker) to handle different verification types.\n- Enhanced the task listener to poll for submitted tasks and manage verification locks using Redis.\n- Updated package.json with necessary dependencies and scripts for building and running the verifier.\n- Added TypeScript configurations to support the new features and ensure type safety.\n- Introduced new database interactions for persisting verification results and managing task states.","tree":{"sha":"44a63f2821c407ab22ca65f2a820dc4cefd5aeaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekubhai/a2a/git/trees/44a63f2821c407ab22ca65f2a820dc4cefd5aeaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekubhai/a2a/git/commits/ebd95bc572dba2337db21cefc3ad59200be80858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165387243?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kekubhai","id":165387243,"login":"kekubhai","node_id":"U_kgDOCdub6w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekubhai/subscriptions","type":"User",