r":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:41:53Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:41:53Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"docs: add state contract pattern for mono and non-mono repos\n\nThe broker is generic — the README now documents the recommended pattern\nfor giving it a typed shape in both setups:\n\nMonorepo: create a local Angular library (@app/mfe-state-model) with\n  AppState interface, APP_STATE_KEYS, APP_INITIAL_STATE, injectAppState().\n  Only the shell calls provideNgxMfeBroker(); remote MFEs just inject.\n\nNon-monorepo: publish the state contract as its own npm package\n  (@your-org/app-state-model) with a peer dep on this library.\n  All separate repos install both packages. A minor version bump on the\n  contract surfaces compile errors across all repos immediately.\n\nAlso includes architecture diagram showing broker ← contract ← MFEs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b47add82d893563ba4d1e293385f89a54e007a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/trees/b47add82d893563ba4d1e293385f89a54e007a52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/commits/71c16e3f49fa915364295e042ef0db677fcfbad5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commit/71c16e3f49fa915364295e042ef0db677fcfbad5","node_id":"C_kwDOTUzMcNoAKDcxYzE2ZTNmNDlmYTkxNTM2NDI5NWUwNDJlZjBkYjY3N2ZjZmJhZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commit/03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7","sha":"03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7"}],"sha":"71c16e3f49fa915364295e042ef0db677fcfbad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/71c16e3f49fa915364295e042ef0db677fcfbad5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:38:55Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:38:55Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"chore: production readiness pass\n\nFixes:\n- build/test scripts: target library explicitly (ng build ngx-mfe-broker)\n- tsconfig: enable strict: true — caught unnecessary type assertion in service\n- mfe-state.service.ts: remove unnecessary cast on s.set(data.value)\n- mfe-state.service.spec.ts: fix unused variable lint error\n\nAdded:\n- LICENSE (MIT)\n- CHANGELOG.md (Keep a Changelog format)\n- eslint.config.js (typescript-eslint + @angular-eslint, strict rules)\n- lint script in package.json\n- CI: add lint step; publish job downloads dist artifact instead of\n  re-running build+tests (single source of truth for what gets published)\n- library package.json: bugs, homepage, engines fields\n\nUpdated:\n- README: remove deleted APIs (MenuRegistryService, openSearch, searchOpen),\n  fix setup advice (provideNgxMfeBroker only in shell), document throw\n  behaviour on unknown keys, add correct build/test/lint commands\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"395650a05b7591adc0f6eac512060cf33e2c2e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/trees/395650a05b7591adc0f6eac512060cf33e2c2e1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/commits/03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commit/03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7","node_id":"C_kwDOTUzMcNoAKDAzZTcxYjJiZDMyN2UzZjEwMzIwNWJjMzA1NTI4OTM3ZDIxMzM5Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commit/58fa646562ae0ef169de47294ffe2128d22dc590","sha":"58fa646562ae0ef169de47294ffe2128d22dc590","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/58fa646562ae0ef169de47294ffe2128d22dc590"}],"sha":"03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/03e71b2bd327e3f103205bc305528937d21339c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/58fa646562ae0ef169de47294ffe2128d22dc590/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:32:37Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:32:37Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"fix: three correctness bugs found in code review\n\n1. ConfigRepositoryService: cross-tab message handler missing localStorage writes\n   - ''set'' message now calls localStorage.setItem()\n   - ''remove'' message now calls localStorage.removeItem()\n   - ''clear'' message now calls localStorage.removeItem() for each known key\n   Without these, a page refresh on the receiving tab would silently resurrect\n   stale values from localStorage.\n\n2. ConfigRepositoryService.clear() used localStorage.clear() — a nuclear op\n   that wiped MfeStateService keys and any third-party library data sharing\n   the same origin. Now tracks owned keys via a Set and removes only those.\n\n3. MfeStateService.get() silently created orphan signals for keys not in\n   initialState — no effect was registered, so writes were never persisted\n   or broadcast. Now throws with a descriptive error to surface misconfiguration\n   at development time.\n\nTests: 30 passing (config 17, state 13)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"34a8359bc58eab52170866e6fe463a433d7c291e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/trees/34a8359bc58eab52170866e6fe463a433d7c291e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/commits/58fa646562ae0ef169de47294ffe2128d22dc590","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/priva