repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/c328dc6ef52641df9e7f751653f1ce25c6990a7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:48:26Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:48:26Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"feat: add MFE_STATE_KEYS, MFE_INITIAL_STATE, injectMfeState()\n\nTyped app-state keys and accessor to prevent magic strings across MFEs.\n- MFE_STATE_KEYS: typed constants for all shared state keys\n- MFE_INITIAL_STATE: default values — used once by the shell in provideNgxMfeBroker()\n- injectMfeState(): typed signal accessor, call in any injection context\n\nRemote MFEs import injectMfeState() — no provideNgxMfeBroker needed in remotes.\nThe shell is the single source of truth for initial state.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e0e251bd9ce382ecbd7d51fb9067825aae89278","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/trees/5e0e251bd9ce382ecbd7d51fb9067825aae89278"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/commits/c328dc6ef52641df9e7f751653f1ce25c6990a7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"logi