y push to main and all PRs\n- Publish job triggers on version tags (v*)\n- Requires NPM_TOKEN secret in repo settings\n- Uses npm provenance for supply chain transparency\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a86f590a40b13befe651cf2306fb6607db8abe3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/trees/a86f590a40b13befe651cf2306fb6607db8abe3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/git/commits/e405ff6400174f4a41f609a3e4db7998da451125","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commit/e405ff6400174f4a41f609a3e4db7998da451125","node_id":"C_kwDOTUzMcNoAKGU0MDVmZjY0MDAxNzRmNGE0MWY2MDlhM2U0ZGI3OTk4ZGE0NTExMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commit/557fd1c85b0058bac9ad2a026529fde8b57512b3","sha":"557fd1c85b0058bac9ad2a026529fde8b57512b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/557fd1c85b0058bac9ad2a026529fde8b57512b3"}],"sha":"e405ff6400174f4a41f609a3e4db7998da451125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/e405ff6400174f4a41f609a3e4db7998da451125"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker/commits/557fd1c85b0058bac9ad2a026529fde8b57512b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:32:06Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:32:06Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"feat: initial release of @dever-labs/ngx-mfe-broker\n\nAngular Signals + BroadcastChannel state broker for micro-frontends.\n\nServices:\n- MfeStateService: generic typed state via injection token (NGX_MFE_INITIAL_STATE)\n  Signals + localStorage + BroadcastChannel cross-tab sync\n- ConfigRepositoryService: generic string KV store with cross-tab sync\n- MenuRegistryService: in-memory Signal-based menu item registry\n- provideNgxMfeBroker(): setup entry point\n\nBoth state channels use inbound-key guards + microtask clear to\nprevent cross-tab echo loops. Br