count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:04:44Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"feat: drop express auto-bid; clipper sets price & terms by default\n\nRemove the one-tap Quick Apply panel that auto-filled the bid at 90% of\nbudget and hid the real fields behind a Customize toggle. The editable\nbid form (price, ETA, pitch, portfolio) is now the default and only view.\nAmount prefills to the posted budget as a neutral starting point.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e72fcd94f0b36e026b583de879e77a7a3a361b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/e72fcd94f0b36e026b583de879e77a7a3a361b85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/82ac6a86e0e60ad031b2ad19dbf41a00a9c507c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/82ac6a86e0e60ad031b2ad19dbf41a00a9c507c6","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKDgyYWM2YTg2ZTBlNjBhZDAzMWIyYWQxOWRiZjQxYTAwYTljNTA3YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95","sha":"f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95"}],"sha":"82ac6a86e0e60ad031b2ad19dbf41a00a9c507c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/82ac6a86e0e60ad031b2ad19dbf41a00a9c507c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T17:16:38Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T17:16:38Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"fix(nginx): media 404 - image regex was stealing /api/media/*.jpg\n\nThe new image-caching regex (~* \\.jpg$ etc.) matched /api/media/....jpg and\nserved it as a static file (404) instead of proxying to the backend, breaking\nall S3 media. Make /api/ and /blog ^~ prefixes so they always win over the\nmedia regex.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c5825cb2a60e79477f35bce2d08d724dc431f5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/3c5825cb2a60e79477f35bce2d08d724dc431f5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKGY3ZmNiNWE5MWE3MjRkNmFmNGU4OTcyMTcwZjA0NmQyMTEwZWZlOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/dbc1f10a6978d9b701f154e8209866956cf6235c","sha":"dbc1f10a6978d9b701f154e8209866956cf6235c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/dbc1f10a6978d9b701f154e8209866956cf6235c"}],"sha":"f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/f7fcb5a91a724d6af4e8972170f046d2110efe95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/dbc1f10a6978d9b701f154e8209866956cf6235c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T17:07:01Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T17:07:01Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"perf: gzip + tiered caching for fast loads\n\n- nginx: enable gzip (JS/CSS/JSON/HTML/SVG); immutable 1y cache for hashed\n  /static assets, 30d for public images/video/fonts, no-cache for HTML so\n  deploys land instantly. gzip off on /api to protect the SSE stream.\n- S3 media: presigned GET carries ResponseCacheControl (max-age 1d) and the\n  /api/media redirect is cached ~50min so repeat views serve images from\n  browser cache instead of re-fetching. Local FileResponse cached too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65b7573af0c48520e7f69d431635570765f283da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/65b7573af0c48520e7f69d431635570765f283da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/dbc1f10a6978d9b701f154e8209866956cf6235c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/dbc1f10a6978d9b701f154e8209866956cf6235c","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKGRiYzFmMTBhNjk3OGQ5YjcwMWYxNTRlODIwOTg2Njk1NmNmNjIzNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/d6cbde70f34f644ea82170cba3b323bc3eb07f58","sha":"d6cbde70f34f644ea82170cba3b323bc3eb07f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclip