: the CREATOR now also gets a branded confirmation email when they\n  accept a bid (\"Your clip is in progress\"). Both emails are fire-and-forget\n  so they don''t delay the accept response.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61f43dfe1c64093889e110b64a9d8a4df55e84ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/61f43dfe1c64093889e110b64a9d8a4df55e84ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/d6cbde70f34f644ea82170cba3b323bc3eb07f58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/d6cbde70f34f644ea82170cba3b323bc3eb07f58","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKGQ2Y2JkZTcwZjM0ZjY0NGVhODIxNzBjYmEzYjMyM2JjM2ViMDdmNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/ac612d83c5c270cc9bc8dc7deef472ae3dcb63d7","sha":"ac612d83c5c270cc9bc8dc7deef472ae3dcb63d7","url