are link, so it reads as\n  \"live and waiting\" not \"broken/loading\".\n- Header shows the live bid count; sort/multi controls hidden until bids exist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c77aed370cb88524c999d181921efc79a16ed44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/9c77aed370cb88524c999d181921efc79a16ed44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/ac612d83c5c270cc9bc8dc7deef472ae3dcb63d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/ac612d83c5c270cc9bc8dc7deef472ae3dcb63d7","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKGFjNjEyZDgzYzVjMjcwY2M5YmM4ZGM3ZGVlZjQ3MmFlM2RjYjYzZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/86b2001a365e60898466bf84d58c97f4cb58b593","sha":"86b2001a365e60898466bf84d58c97f4cb58b593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digita