 HTML source for no-JS crawlers.\n- CreateProject Express: optional thumbnail upload.\n- JobDetails: aesthetic pass - bigger title, prominent budget highlight\n  (bond + deadline), cleaner spec cards, fixed Moment field.\n- AI concierge: rewritten system prompt to run a real discovery chat\n  (footage, goal+audience, format, vibe, budget) with follow-ups before\n  concluding, instead of wrapping up instantly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dac8d8d91f08a24ee9c7b1eb8bf28b2e9143ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/4dac8d8d91f08a24ee9c7b1eb8bf28b2e9143ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/86b2001a365e60898466bf84d58c97f4cb58b593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/86b2001a365e60898466bf84d58c97f4cb58b593","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKDg2YjIwMDFhMzY1