.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/949a68da12854082d1d1b07ddbd7f7d6caae01b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T10:55:01Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T10:55:01Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"feat: free posting mode - creators post jobs live without paying (for now)\n\n- FREE_POSTING env flag (default on). When on, create_project marks the\n  job funded + open immediately (comp deposit, no real money) so it goes\n  straight to the bid room - creators set budget, clippers bid, creator\n  accepts, all without checkout. Flip FREE_POSTING=false to require\n  payment again.\n- GET /config exposes {free_posting}; CreateProject branches on it (skips\n  checkout, adjusts button copy). Refactor admin fund-free to share the\n  _publish_project_free helper.\n\nPayout stays decoupled (approval credits USD balance; withdraw via\nPayPal/USDC), so nothing downstream changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"664ef407ba1afe7ef839b88b2ac569054e26f541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/664ef407ba1afe7ef839b88b2ac569054e26f541"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/949a68da12854082d1d1b07ddbd7f7d6caae01b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":