om/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/20215154818184e5a74f06e90640aa84168e1663/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:48:31Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:48:31Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"feat(blog): self-updating SEO/AEO blog server-rendered at /blog\n\n- BlogPost model (new table, auto-created via create_all).\n- blog.py: branded HTML shell, index/article/sitemap renderers, safe-HTML\n  sanitizer, 3 seed articles, and an OpenAI generation prompt seasoned\n  with real platform stats (clippers, jobs, avg budget, completions).\n- Backend routes (server-rendered, crawlable, no JS): GET /blog,\n  GET /blog/{slug} (Article + Breadcrumb JSON-LD), GET /blog/sitemap.xml,\n  POST /api/admin/blog/generate (admin, manual trigger).\n- Startup seeds posts if empty; a single-worker daily scheduler\n  auto-generates a fresh keyword-targeted post every ~24h (BLOG_AUTOGEN).\n- nginx proxies /blog to the backend; robots.txt lists the blog sitemap;\n  Footer links to the blog.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae9ac0f5b3d1eba0ba7751fe8b0f45d1cb236d55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/ae9ac0f5b3d1eba0ba7751fe8b0f45d1cb236d55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/20215154818184e5a74f06e90640aa84168e1663","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht