e60af1b3c5a5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T04:47:54Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T04:47:54Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"feat(seo): comprehensive SEO + AEO (AI/agent crawlability)\n\n- index.html: full meta, Open Graph, Twitter cards, canonical, and\n  JSON-LD (@graph: Organization, WebSite, Service, WebApplication,\n  FAQPage). Crawlable static content in #root + <noscript> so AI\n  crawlers that don''t run JS still get real content and structured Q&A.\n- robots.txt: welcomes search + AI answer-engine bots (GPTBot, ClaudeBot,\n  PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, OAI-SearchBot, CCBot, etc.), excludes\n  private app areas, links the sitemap.\n- sitemap.xml: all public routes.\n- llms.txt (llmstxt.org): plain-language brief for LLMs/agents.\n- Seo component (React 19 native <title>/<meta>/<link> hoisting) on\n  Landing, Marketplace, Directory, Docs for per-route titles/canonicals.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9bd7a269e14e4a6e3ab6f2f411cb20a08a8a674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/a9bd7a269e14e4a6e3ab6f2f411cb20a08a8a674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/88d92d78e4b51dcd12f153e68e8e60af1b3c5a5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1Nj