ilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"feat: email verification for local signups + cleaner default avatars\n\nEmail verification (compliance):\n- users.email_verified column (DB default true -> grandfathers existing\n  + Google accounts; new local signups inserted false). Additive migration\n  in database.py.\n- auth.py: signed, purpose-scoped 24h verification tokens (carry role hint).\n- Register no longer starts a session: sends a verification email and\n  returns {verification_required}. New /auth/verify-email (logs in on\n  success) + /auth/resend-verification (rate-limited, no account-existence\n  leak). Local login is blocked until verified (403 \"email_not_verified\").\n- Frontend: Register \"check your email\" state, new /verify-email page,\n  Login handles unverified with a resend action.\n\nLogin mobile: brand lockup shown on mobile (right panel is lg-only).\n\nAvatars: default generator switched from dicebear notionists to the\ncleaner ''shapes'' style; backfill migrates existing notionists/initials.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d07f1fc9954251e4d84fd53aca56e3c7d97577d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/6d07f1fc9954251e4d84fd53aca56e3c7d97577d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/170a410e00c9f393247fec329dffd08e66be94d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":