broken on mobile. Use\n  h-14 + w-full on mobile, w-auto on sm+. Same fix for the Checkout\n  fund button (h-13 w-full -> h-14).\n- Remove the \"Vetted clippers bidding live\" pill + pulsing dot from the\n  hero; retighten the entrance stagger.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"737dae1ccf62f1befc8b006ec44eedb938939715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/737dae1ccf62f1befc8b006ec44eedb938939715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/a0e4ce5eefdb6e84abc4995fd2b1d2785344899f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sats100M","id":75629555,"login":"Sats100M","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI5NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/a0e4ce5eefdb6e84abc4995fd2b1d2785344899f","node_id":"C_kwDOTVLfJdoAKGEwZTRjZTVlZWZkYjZlODRhYmM0OTk1ZmQyYjFkMjc4NTM0NDg5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commit/84095ac71439a88b3edd0cb029b3e8cabb62191e",