ubscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sats100M","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/commits/adfb7b529356fbce4477ae87e46c0d2e485dc037/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T06:58:32Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T06:58:32Z","email":"bilalsaeedahmed1@gmail.com","name":"onesignature"},"message":"feat: production hardening - emails, pending-bids fix, legal pages, CI\n\n- Welcome email on signup (role-aware, Brevo SMTP) + redesigned client-safe\n  responsive email templates (shared shell, bulletproof button, preheader)\n- Fix pending-bids bug: new GET /me/bids endpoint + real list on clipper dashboard\n- Admin purge-demo endpoint + button; SEED_NS_SHOWCASE flag for production flip\n- Legal/docs: /docs /privacy /cookies /terms (+ footer links)\n- Remove all em/en dashes platform-wide\n- UI: unified tokens, brand-reskinned shadcn primitives, split-pane auth,\n  empty states, shaped skeletons, live-glow clock, lime CONTRACT LIVE badge,\n  cleaner marketplace filters (dropdowns), remove footer Solana pill\n- Friction: onboarding 6->0-1 Q, one-click bid/accept, auto-redirect after funding\n- Remove dead code (Hero.jsx, ui/sonner.jsx) + fake admin features\n- Add self-hosted GitHub Actions deploy workflow + runner setup script\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24f39339df90685ce8fd3e4d829604ebd5722a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/trees/24f39339df90685ce8fd3e4d829604ebd5722a95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Digitalfrontiersman/24hourclipping/git/commits/adfb7b529356fbce4477ae87e46c0d2e485dc037","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75629555?v=4","events_ur