ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/f5c9c5155fd47a18ec35f635fddfb25030a3f20b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:41:26Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:41:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-460: Hide Automations from the workspace (#239)\n\n* MYAH-460: Hide Automations from the workspace\n\nEvery Campaign creates an \"Outreach Campaign\" workflow, and users saw these\nunder Automations, Automation runs and Automation versions without knowing\nwhat they are. Founder decision (5 Oct): hide them entirely for now.\n\n- Sidebar: the three Automation entries are deferred (hidden).\n- Search and its object filter leave out workflows, runs and versions.\n- The command menu drops \"Go to\" navigation to those objects.\n\nCampaigns still use workflows internally; nothing on the server changes.\n\n* MYAH-460: Hide legacy workflow triggers and stale search selections","tree":{"sha":"4ed518e5ad72b9522b74739a128fc6fe5ec5c04d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/4ed518e5ad72b9522b74739a128fc6fe5ec5c04d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/f5c9c5155fd47a18ec35f635fddfb25030a3f20b","verificat