https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/07fc132eb89088fc2595db280837b81822654976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:27:10Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:27:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-458: Remove a social profile from a creator (#238)\n\n* MYAH-458: Remove a social profile from a creator\n\nRemoving a wrong handle failed everywhere:\n- Delete (record page, command menu) went through the generic deleteMany,\n  which the server rejects for managed social profiles (\"An error\n  occurred\"). Both many-record delete hooks now retire each profile with\n  the managed retireSocialProfile mutation, like restore already does.\n- Unselecting a profile in the creator''s \"Social profiles\" picker detached\n  it, clearing its required creator (\"A required field is missing\"). A\n  profile can''t exist without its creator, so unselecting now removes it.\n- \"Detach\" is no longer offered for social profiles in relation lists.\n\n* MYAH-458: Preserve successful removals on partial failure and honor cancellation","tree":{"sha":"e3d6c749087c97fca9cdf32f79e588044a2bf285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/e3d6c749087c97fca9cdf32f79e588044a2bf285"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/07fc132eb89088fc2595db280837b81822654976","verification":{"payload":"tree e3d6c749087c97fca9cdf32f79e588044a2bf285\nparent 1616aee1c110035b9a34a3df70523d929a70ad9f\n