import the next file''s row N collided with the\n  old row N (\"Creator data operation identity was reused with different\n  input\", Sentry MYAH-BACKEND-1E). The attempt key is now derived from the\n  rows being imported: the same file retries safely, another file gets its\n  own attempt.\n- Creator Lists no longer offer \"Import Creator Lists\" (importing list\n  records, which crashed). A List''s Members section has \"Import creators\":\n  the normal creator import, after which every imported or matched creator\n  is added to that List (in chunks of 500).","tree":{"sha":"b7c065dd0cf6db595e8ec259ef62acf347759c2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/b7c065dd0cf6db595e8ec259ef62acf347759c2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/ab9fd7fc4ccb4ca1151858ee3d4a454826a05b43","verification":{"payload":"tree b7c065dd0cf6db595e8ec259ef62acf347759c2e\nparent d0c91871276b3351ae7a5017ae5f656ec1ef9ed6\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791214589 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791214589 +0700\n\nMYAH-457: Import creators after a failed import and straight into a List (#237)\n\n- The creator import reused one attempt key until an import succeeded, so\n  after a failed or abandoned import the next file''s row N collided with the\n  old row N (\"Creator data operation identity was reused with different\n  input\", Sentry MYAH-BACKEND-1E). The attempt key is now derived from the\n  rows being imported: the same file retries safely, another file gets its\n  own attempt.\n- Creator Lists no longer offer \"Import Creator Lists\" (importing list\n  records, which crashed). A List''s Members section has \"Import creators\":\n  the normal creator import, after which every imported or matched creator\n  is added to that List (in chunks of 500).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw8P9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxlIQAAi4U6MebnDuBXFP8