or":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152369481?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/f4b1e8e7feffb43898e82cbeb738da6a84f8d2ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:29:04Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:29:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-454: Every typed letter reaches Myah text fields (#235)\n\nTwenty''s global \"go to\" shortcuts start with \"g\" and are active in form\nfields unless the focused field registers with the focus stack. Myah''s plain\n<input>/<textarea> fields didn''t, so \"g\" never reached them: the Campaign\nInstagram step sent \"Hey, reply to this messae\" to a creator.\n\nuseTextFieldFocusProps registers a focused field the way Twenty''s TextInput\ndoes (keyboard-conflicting global hotkeys off) and is used by every Myah text\nfield: Campaign Instagram step, sequence delays, Agent page guidance and\nlanguage, Campaign/Influencer/Messages search, and the social profile handle.","tree":{"sha":"cbd3a86d770c366cef2f3d0faac523bcaf7d3425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/cbd3a86d770c366cef2f3d0faac523bcaf7d3425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/f4b1e8e7feffb43898e82cbeb738da6a84f8d2ab","verification":{"payload":"tree cbd3a86d770c366cef2f3d0faac523bcaf7d3425\nparent 692950e8ef991c061fc7b7746c0deaad29ad4da0\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791210544 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791210544 +0700\n\nMYAH-454: Every typed letter reaches Myah text fields (#235)\n\nTwenty''s global \"go to\" shortcuts start with \"g\" and are active in form\nfields unless the focused field registers with the focus stack. Myah''s plain\n<input>/<textarea> fields didn''t, so \"g\" never reached them: the Campaign\nInstagram step sent \"Hey, reply to this messae\" to a creator.\n\nuseTextFieldFocusProps registers a focused field the way Twenty''s TextInput\ndoes (keyboard-conflicting global hotkeys off) and is used by every Myah text\nfield: Campaign Instagram step, sequence delays, Agent page guidance and\nlanguage, Campaign/Influencer/Messages search, and the social profile handle.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw7QwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVwMQAFSTfZiNkXl/yWXCKOkBZ44x\nsV1OALlOS43jfobD+ntL9mglLfsDvTxs33BogmWMojs6t4A+qrzOY5rtzIKD4aHf\ntDnN/bzYHVkKRnSoDRRQ9Nr65f/J3xi23zPe/ZMhlFP1x/58sT34REu1GEmMjTD2\nrpUEiMQZNOkS6lX44kNQt78pO8H5oGgATR/LpvXYQObqHvclJL1hTZ0f3OQiAuy2\nc6IwKpNjCYDp7H0zIaGESpUyfeY89uv/cdSupl5jPZn2qZU08PiB2lQPMTsig9xr\nrfakB3sb+Y4YvI0GIbCVL7VfI8Hhce+453iz6GBLv11jxoc4NxHdA24XJAC9BEGd\ner2WOmHrSnoCiZ9kePSWBxGae4LY8ChrjrdU51/aLjn3x9DhNKKCDdltfHUqFNbl\nQUNI6tiyALOlrsTnuPIgOl0Q55wQEu2DW7aCZVeO+xxSt/XMAIjaCvUv41JLI8H9\n6WbKofSA6JKp2D/sPIILjYVkUp2pYHJbXUvt2D0ybX20dk2GGUu37PS8HnXjyn8S\ntlaczVcJ6E9p20XTelW8cdVSQi/Z2w3VbgQxd2olpMAtOprCazQViAkcahz0ixdG\n6PcEdYP83Px+McFfMPb9ok/rz+CJ0z4aTMdmZTv1J3TCzGbQ98T9tUMvcKdMYT4/\nPB6