er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/692950e8ef991c061fc7b7746c0deaad29ad4da0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:58:11Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:58:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-455: Campaign message details open for every message (#234)\n\n- The details request accepted only v4 ids, but every step after the first\n  has a deterministic v5 occurrence id, so its panel closed straight away\n  (\"occurrenceId must be a UUID\" in production). Accept any UUID version.\n- A failed details request now shows an error with Try again instead of\n  closing the panel.\n- An Instagram step that is being sent right now (or waiting after a rate\n  limit) is Scheduled, not \"Needs attention / Review required\"; only held,\n  failed or unconfirmed steps need attention (list status and view filter).\n- Instagram messages are labelled as Instagram, not \"Campaign email\".\n- \"Needs attention\" explains why in plain language instead of a code.\n- The whole row opens the message, not just the creator name.","tree":{"sha":"ebcb7f9614522b3d68e591e8220897531d01d98b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/ebcb7f9614522b3d68e591e8220897531d01d98b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/692950e8ef991c061fc7b7746c0deaad29ad4da0","verification":{"payload":"tree ebcb7f9614522b3d68e591e8220897531d01d98b\nparent 351ff19e0f71a2988fcc9a0857cbbc506bedd05c\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791208691 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791208691 +0700\n\nMYAH-455: Campaign message details open for every message (#234)\n\n- The details request accepted only v4 ids, but every step after the first\n  has a deterministic v5 occurrence id, so its panel closed straight away\n  (\"occurrenceId must be a UUID\" in production). Accept any UUID version.\n- A failed details request now shows an error with Try again instead of\n  closing the panel.\n- An Instagram step that is being sent right now (or waiting after a rate\n  limit) is Scheduled, not \"Needs attention / Review required\"; only held,\n  failed or unconfirmed steps need attention (list status and view filter).\n- Instagram messages are labelled as Instagram, not \"Campaign email\".\n- \"Needs attention\" explains why in plain language instead of a code.\n- The whole row opens the message, not just the creator name.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw6zzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAt60QADc64K4wQntj3Mz2gDuzjLfg\nvbFIncBo7Pm9puTY+8tx6BU7/Uw5agTAqEYiKH0TZMOAtqOXBkBYTaJkMeMaFtpX\nkHrjKAkBktpbT8HcdHKpt3AuG8qE88f3kjFozLR+keg104QYX3Xu54Kx+NaN8d09\nT6JEZyNiDnpKFoYI/FEt6SULYKagyPj/VJOHFFqcwhbh+mi5m12vI7t8+4v/ZlG9\noDOptdW8YPlm2qhjObKH4xqwCbC3Iy0SzsiFtN+3Y09Ktq9jfXPdt6pHGPBTvaJl\nkeZyX9kjzdmQwRlRxHWEw4qKXCsruiup88kEt/u3UHctr1NfVEavhe3V3qWrRdVM\noCZSudqrHynpj4ohBOuphq9FdzcswbZ+rlxANYx7/DwMLWfPBK9j2CUWuJsNnkND\nMIXCjzSDY4ftGoQiryPrh5BIGOJDp9reyWgXcD3KFIYoVDqwSttcBlrsfdYn4Lzc\n8TRNzzPrAtgR0w6zbaVcq0j3VQqzrvMS0BH3dQ21fLzTUxvtULE9/HSIXaZ+hrSZ\nMv6rZNA1NCchQDQnxArmonfzwUkVIr7Ocs/yRbesIvxXN/U9CCZR7+LXcZ+tHRVS\n61Lvf40uFTiT6Simsz8rGp9yoMOspgDDB6XU47AGwcU3il3V+qoXvmlTJCMHQw4g\npvUP0ZYvREinUExG+wtB\n=Fy/u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T13:58:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commit/692950e8ef991c061fc7b7746c0deaad29ad4da0","node_id":"C_kwDOTVO3DtoAKDY5Mjk1MGU4ZWY5OTFjMDYxZmM3Yjc3NDZjMGRlYWFkMjlhZDRkYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commit/351ff19e0f71a2988fcc9a0857cbbc506bedd05c","sha":"351ff19e0f71a2988fcc9a0857cbbc506bedd05c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/351ff19e0f71a2988fcc9a0857cbbc506bedd05c"}],"sha":"692950e8ef991c061fc7b7746c0deaad29ad4da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/692950e8ef991c061fc7b7746c0deaad29ad4da0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152369481?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/351ff19e0f71a2988fcc9a0857cbbc506bedd05c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:14:33Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:14:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-453: Stop a creator''s sequence at send time when they have replied on any channel (#232)\n\nIn production (5 Oct) a creator replied on Instagram at 10:12 UTC and step 2\nstill went out at 10:15: the reply was stored at 10:15:17 but the job that\nstops the sequence waited 17 minutes behind a 19-minute mailbox import on the\nsingle-concurrency messaging queue.\n\n- Before claiming any Instagram or email step, look for an Instagram DM or an\n  email from the creator after the enrollment''s first accepted step. If one\n  exists, end the enrollment as replied, cancel the step, move the creator to\n  Negotiating and record the timeline events; nothing is sent. Mail from the\n  workspace''s own connected accounts and messages before step 1 don''t count.\n- Instagram webhooks, creator-message handling and the reply agent move to a\n  new myah-creator-message-queue so mailbox imports can''t delay them.","tree":{"sha":"0a2f082493601846fde7f77d835661c1b0ecfd66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/0a2f082493601846fde7f77d835661c1b0ecfd66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/351ff19e0f71a2988fcc9a0857cbbc506bedd05c","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a2f082493601846fde7f77d835661c1b0ecfd66\nparent 1f66576c7094cde19040645eec105d19098e570f\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791206073 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791206073 +0700\n\nMYAH-453: Stop a creator''s sequence at send time when they have replied on any channel (#232)\n\nIn production (5 Oct) a creator replied on Instagram at 10:12 UTC and step 2\nstill went out at 10:15: the reply was stored at 10:15:17 but the job that\nstops the sequence waited 17 minutes behind a 19-minute mailbox import on the\nsingle-concurrency messaging queue.\n\n- Before claiming any Instagram or email step, look for an Instagram DM or an\n  email from the creator after the enrollment''s first accepted step. If one\n  exists, end the enrollment as replied, cancel the step, move the creator to\n  Negotiating and record the timeline events; nothing is sent. Mail from the\n  workspace''s own connected accounts and messages before step 1 don''t count.\n- Instagram webhooks, creator-message handling and the reply agent move to a\n  new myah-creator-message-queue so mailbox imports can''t delay them.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw6K5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARPcQACaMjTZdcyIHMPcHbqIEnFR1\nQp0e+CMbXvzvWkq3d7vARe9rbHqfZCeRZ/ogZGOlh/JMWXBm+30G9VM1GJFz9Mji\n232zPAVapVu67YOzmaDE4GRwlCbipzB0Rs8rk6LYo+2KgA9v6iZKgVpXd/NfxU/f\nV/DMV3t2IZHGE0hAXh5kaXO/KYDxjyzOkIlo4IJuG0rW1rkpZ2IDu0lPyP2YErxC\nfA4ZQBnnQ3rhxSJqlco3Har1PxP5MuCNeLfGCuA7Gz5yIYbd4Fr9D/lFrhVERM59\nYptBukXhhcUXcesL4CqURFB2OFgAYmFBfeILXsU/S6chwhUZKDHqOs3MTDy7QL4T\nukOKXyPfC6vLOeJUnh7rAv8v1P2alFf1w7HSxXx5nj3+TJW+bXAvHKvmQzjp3UNP\n8C/ATpeNTbDmQqUU8V4smXHSXaFRDviqFd/A5bazektUV