152369481?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/1f66576c7094cde19040645eec105d19098e570f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:09:01Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:09:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Start a new workspace after already-completed instance upgrade steps (#233)\n\nEvery server deploy since the \"mvp gap analysis\" workspace was created on\n5 Oct fails its startup upgrade: \"1 workspace(s) have invalid cursors for\nworkspace segment [215..250]: a720af1e… at\n2.20.0_CreateMyahAgentRunFastInstanceCommand_1791038783993 (completed)\".\n\nA new workspace''s upgrade cursor is copied from the most recently attempted\ninstance command. CreateMyahAgentRun (and the other fast commands added after\n15 Sep) ran after the 2.20 slow instance command that follows them in the\nsequence, so the new workspace was placed before that slow step instead of at\nthe end of the workspace segment, and startup validation rejects it.\n\ngetInitialCursorForNewWorkspace now skips forward over later instance steps\nthat have already completed before choosing the cursor; workspace creation\nand the dev seeder pass the completed instance command names.","tree":{"sha":"fa4301381fce6236ecafca54a49e80101b31ac92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/fa4301381fce6236ecafca54a49e80101b31ac92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/1f66576c7094cde19040645eec105d19098e570f","verification":{"payload":"tree fa4301381fce6236ecafca54a49e80101b31ac92\nparent 79bd8ca317fd109ed3cf264f606a1f809f8e57b5\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791205741 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791205741 +0700\n\nStart a new workspace after already-completed instance upgrade steps (#233)\n\nEvery server deploy since the \"mvp gap analysis\" workspace was created on\n5 Oct fails its startup upgrade: \"1 workspace(s) have invalid cursors for\nworkspace segment [215..250]: a720af1e… at\n2.20.0_CreateMyahAgentRunFastInstanceCommand_1791038783993 (completed)\".\n\nA new workspace''s upgrade cursor is copied from the most recently attempted\ninstance command. CreateMyahAgentRun (and the other fast commands added after\n15 Sep) ran after the 2.20 slow instance command that follows them in the\nsequence, so the new workspace was placed before that slow step instead of at\nthe end of the workspace segment, and startup validation rejects it.\n\ngetInitialCursorForNewWorkspace now skips forward over later instance steps\nthat have already completed before choosing the cursor; workspace creation\nand the dev seeder pass the completed instance command names.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw6FtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoC4QABGeJF6jrJeoanVuYABC9tQ+\nmoI3CmhfPFP5cI6LubYVperOsQ4qPxbVeDpAxOczhQdGIhSKT4CeryUHB/qlzGSb\npOHXEgV9wU6jU5KnOrCZKPnhoJn9t2bfsnm98U3XmFbCN6fOLhaNrS7Be8Qyx4A2\nCaJ/TzQoHwo4cP1MzacFx38qRvV9xXn+q6jK26