f0369dc54e08e84bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:58:23Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:58:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-445: Instagram in the send forecast, database tests for the remaining paths (#229)\n\n- Forecast: Instagram steps get an estimated send time from the Campaign''s\n  Instagram account, its sending window and the rolling cold limits (10 per\n  hour, 100 per 24 hours) shared across Campaigns; the Messages page shows it.\n- Fix: a creator without an email who finished the Instagram steps got the\n  email step scheduled (it then held on invalid email) instead of finishing.\n- PostgreSQL specs: one active Campaign per creator (Dropped/Posted elsewhere\n  may join, still-contacted may not); mixed-sequence scheduling (next step,\n  skipping steps a creator cannot receive, finishing, no double scheduling);\n  Instagram reply to agent draft labelled in Influencers and Inbox; Instagram\n  forecast written by the real refresh.\n- The Messages page spec starts from an empty forecast scope.","tree":{"sha":"ed7c9c587be41aaebf69e39f6e05b85ed62377dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/ed7c9c587be41aaebf69e39f6e05b85ed62377dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/292a65bcd6f8b2c81aa63a6f0369dc54e08e84bd","verification":{"payload":"tree ed7c9c587be41aaebf69e39f6e05b85ed62377dc\nparent 2077d21a0db177acc30759d336a32a430ee8b015\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791115103 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791115103 +0700\n\nMYAH-445: Instagram in the send forecast, database tests for the remaining paths (#229)\n\n- Forecast: Instagram steps get an estimated send time from the Campaign''s\n  Instagram account, its sending window and the rolling cold limits (10 per\n  hour, 100 per 24 hours) shared across Campaigns; the Messages page shows it.\n- Fix: a creator without an email who finished the Instagram steps got the\n  email step scheduled (it then held on invalid email) instead of finishing.\n- PostgreSQL specs: one active Campaign per creator (Dropped/Posted elsewhere\n  may join, still-contacted may not); mixed-sequence scheduling (next step,\n  skipping steps a creator cannot receive, finishing, no double scheduling);\n  Instagram reply to agent draft labelled in Influencers and Inbox; Instagram\n  forecast written by the real refresh.\n- The Messages page spec starts from an empty forecast scope.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwj9fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9hwQAHWJI8Iw7FEUPKP1cYApooQZ\n7RZJ4y6kXlAgrhqiLFBegF6dw7njYgh9SVr1qXCyyHwwVwEiB65PfC/wZGj5vw+S\nbODVebLE60bEKBTLIm2zrswom+i7P6qOCyQFK+azxO7ZmX0/YemuwbMwrFPmDVgz\n55MLPb9AKnEfd+sja342wq61WfoZib3+Ff9kmkJBE/48ftct6u0Okkwp2CsSIgOt\n6xLkf/o6MWp89Xgb6qKA5tvQetxOJzkCrujZGibAl/1JvIFZCF6xJ0YAT1MQ098Q\nbKA4mJTVJCZ94PWe5BemrNQde9TnWMMrXmm5WSk4kOLgsjkMa4hueF4A6fvjuhAt\n/rErRUisEKQiWjKAMvJ13pWrMJEiPUvaNTZukth/Ra+yumWo6xaiOEJIYoDpQpb0\nZ5rYWYtGUw/j1BLjUo5HxKpqnJG3qwpVmi21OuL6869kr71N4oyo9aRUgENnPZgf\nmSTKAj7GeCId4sYLkd/oDU3uGezch1HNcIVr2eBwPInIjOhSSvvaIUteeYEgdq2G\nHmqo8P0tuE6uNMv6t9uq0msPvgZ7+f5qOLUsSsXCB+4KkMb7VyJtceJKP39859Xn\n4k9YBhBlVI5RG822oJNquDtqhenem5GhQ9zkn8w/wO4LdE1Uq1JQd95jwDOQCWGD\nHtmE3W7dETPp5u8l/iem\n=XJtE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T11:58:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcj