thub.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/2077d21a0db177acc30759d336a32a430ee8b015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:09:52Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:09:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-445: Show reply-agent failures as Needs you with a plain reason (#228)\n\nA failed agent run (for example, managed AI credit used up) was recorded but\nnot shown anywhere, so a creator''s reply looked ignored. Failed runs now\nappear as Needs you in the Influencers list, the influencer panel and the\nInbox composer label, with the reason (AI credit used up, no AI model, or a\ngeneric retry hint); Regenerate retries once the cause is fixed.","tree":{"sha":"0b0bdfb6a4a4ba462f5c064946b5a7e9f051cd3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/0b0bdfb6a4a4ba462f5c064946b5a7e9f051cd3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/2077d21a0db177acc30759d336a32a430ee8b015","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b0bdfb6a4a4ba462f5c064946b5a7e9f051cd3e\nparent 471aaf6905763eebdf9d231b0a4949b0122c025a\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791108592 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791108592 +0700\n\nMYAH-445: Show reply-agent failures as Needs you with a plain reason (#228)\n\nA failed agent run (for example, managed AI credit used up) was recorded but\nnot shown anywhere, so a creator''s reply looked ignored. Failed runs now\nappear as Needs you in the Influencers list, the influencer panel and the\nInbox composer label, with the reason (AI credit used up, no AI model, or a\ngeneric retry hint); Regenerate retries once the cause is fixed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwiXwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARqIQAIoHW026rH