cers. A new\n  upgrade step recreates it from the current search fields (name + email),\n  exactly as Twenty builds it, wherever it is missing. Production was\n  hot-fixed with the same definition on 2026-10-04.\n- scripts/myah-dev up --from-prod restores a read-only copy of production\n  into Postgres 18 (production''s version), runs the same cache flush +\n  upgrade production runs on startup, matches production''s workspace\n  subdomain routing (app.localhost, <workspace>.localhost), resets local\n  passwords to myah-dev and drops production signing keys. Sends stay off.\n- myah-dev keeps one APP_SECRET per environment, so signing keys stay\n  readable across restarts.","tree":{"sha":"2a47dd8fa1636936d49f47478ea4ead63ba952d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/2a47dd8fa1636936d49f47478ea4ead63ba952d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/471aaf6905763eebdf9d231b0a4949b0122c025a","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a47dd8fa1636936d49f47478ea4ead63ba952d4\nparent bf2115aa178fce5cc44b13f17e839947f51523d8\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791106235 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791106235 +0700\n\nMYAH-445: Repair the Creator search column and add a production-copy dev environment (#227)\n\n- Removing the legacy Creator fields also dropped the Creator searchVector\n  column on pre-MYAH-409 workspaces (it was still generated from the old\n  Instagram columns), breaking Creator search and Add influencers. A new\n  upgrade step recreates it from the current search fields (name + email),\n  exactly as Twenty builds it, wherever it is missing. Production was\n  hot-fixed with the same definition on 2026-10-04.\n- scripts/myah-dev up --from-prod restores a read-only copy of production\n  into Postgres 18 (production''s version), runs the same cache flush +\n  upgrade production runs on startup, matches production''s workspace\n  subdomain routing 