hub.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-445: Remove legacy Creator social fields and fix production test-run follow-ups (#226)\n\n- Upgrade step removes the 58 per-platform Creator fields (handles, URLs,\n  links, follower counts, bios and stats) from workspaces created before\n  MYAH-409; Social profiles and Creator notes replaced them. Relations stay.\n- Social profiles ''Add New'' asks for platform and handle instead of creating\n  an empty row the server rejects.\n- Header Start asks for confirmation and lists who will be skipped and why.\n- The Campaign header badge follows Start/Stop; the Influencers next action\n  and Start audience refresh when memberships or social profiles change.","tree":{"sha":"b3cff0f4c83b260c38beec534e03995d97d87b7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/b3cff0f4c83b260c38beec534e03995d97d87b7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/bf2115aa178fce5cc44b13f17e839947f51523d8","verification":{"payload":"tree b3cff0f4c83b260c38beec534e03995d97d87b7c\nparent 7e547f5c7b61f4f1a138bf38a62a19b532c074c3\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791101739 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791101739 +0700\n\nMYAH-445: Remove legacy Creator social fields and fix production test-run follow-ups (#226)\n\n- Upgrade step removes the 58 per-platform Creator fields (handles, URLs,\n  links, follower counts, bios and stats) from workspaces created before\n  MYAH-409; Social profiles and Creator notes replaced them. Relations stay.\n- Social profiles ''Add New'' asks for platform and handle instead of creating\n  an empty row the server rejects.\n- Header Start asks for confirmation and lists who will be skipped and why.\n- The Campaign header badge follows Start/Stop; the Influencers next action\n  and Start audience refresh when memberships or social profiles change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAAB