pi.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/cb808630c43364215c172ea79a11b1a14d97d416/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:18:17Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:18:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-445: Instagram reply detection and the workspace reply agent (#224)\n\n* MYAH-445: Detect Instagram replies and draft creator replies with the workspace agent\n\n- Creator messages from live Instagram and email ingestion wake a job after commit.\n- Instagram replies link the chat to the creator by handle, stop the creator''s\n  sequence and move them to Negotiating.\n- After a 60 s debounce the agent drafts one reply per creator message into the\n  existing Inbox drafts (never over a person''s text), hands off when unsure, and\n  sends automatically only when turned on, for a creator in an active Campaign,\n  within the 3-consecutive cap and while the enabling admin keeps access.\n- core.myahAgentRun records each run (draft, hand-off reason, automatic sends).\n\n* MYAH-445: Note the bound creator email lookup","tree":{"sha":"2e91744ade2f1ed3cb8375952c8ab2c883f2091c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/2e91744ade2f1ed3cb8375952c8ab2c883f2091c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/cb808630c43364215c172ea79a11b1a14d97d416","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e91744ade2f1ed3cb8375952c8ab2c883f2091c\np