tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/1392a26fc46e5025f2412327bca8f842fa0f89ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:36:13Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:36:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-445: Send Instagram sequence steps; one active Campaign per creator (#222)\n\n* MYAH-445: Send Instagram sequence steps and keep one active Campaign per creator\n\n- Campaign Start, authorization and activation accept Instagram steps; a mailbox is\n  required only with email steps and a connected Instagram account only with\n  Instagram steps.\n- Audience eligibility comes from channels (email, Instagram handle) instead of the\n  selected contact method; creators active in another Campaign are skipped and named.\n- Instagram steps are claimed by the sequence runtime and sent through the existing\n  Instagram composer (reuse or open the chat), linked to the send receipt; unknown\n  outcomes are never re-sent. Next steps skip channels a creator cannot use.\n- Instagram send limits count only cold messages.\n- Sequence editor: Instagram steps are sendable, with byte count and single-DM guidance.\n- Fix: Campaign Start rejected interactive user auth contexts since MYAH-427.\n\n* MYAH-445: Keep email-only progression and minimal schemas working with Instagram channel checks\n\n* MYAH-445: Answer the social-profile table check in the progression spec","tree":{"sha":"bcaeb68f802342fad8197eb26aca5570421c8080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/bcaeb68f802342fad8197eb26aca5570421c8080"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/1392a26fc46e5025f2412327bca8f842fa0f89ea","verification":{"payload":"tree bcaeb68f802342fad8197eb26aca5570421c8080\nparent 2a30d78f9fb305d1355b9329229c9b91b969ad75\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791059773 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791059773 +0700\n\nMYAH-445: Send Instagram sequence steps; one active Campaign per creator (#222)\n\n* MYAH-445: Send Instagram sequence steps and keep one active Campaign per creator\n\n- Campaign Start, authorization and activation accept Instagram steps; a mailbox is\n  required only with email steps and a connected Instagram account only with\n  Instagram steps.\n- Audience eligibility comes from channels (email, Instagram handle) instead of the\n  selected contact method; creators active in another Campaign are skipped and named.\n- Instagram steps are claimed by the sequence runtime and sent through the existing\n  Instagram composer (reuse or open the chat), linked to the send receipt; unknown\n  outcomes are never re-sent. Next steps skip channels a creator cannot use.\n- Instagram send limits count only cold messages.\n- Sequence editor: Instagram steps are sendable, with byte count and single-DM guidance.\n- Fix: Campaign Start rejected interactive user auth contexts since MYAH-427.\n\n* MYAH-445: Keep email-only progression and minimal schemas working with Instagram channel checks\n\n* MYAH-445: Answer the social-profile table check in the progression spec","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwWc9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA59YQALIoEk5AjwfkEen5bSaJPgQ7\nap8Qy0QgYbVvlseR0gaFstftafymVqvIpZ3FcVqjZSJqYduyn3W5ePbSek6lIgT7\n/6VQlrdyfsWBYtT3N57EOvuEU6/620DLnu5S/k3DyyoImrTGH3kW4Vey7ZHoJ232\nW+6RMbhZFgSeAshOzm8Dhb