ted). Reply proposals use the\nworkspace agent guidance instead of per-Campaign guidance fields.\n\n* MYAH-445: Test Campaign Instagram sender selection and sending-mode authority\n\n* MYAH-445: Regenerate GraphQL clients; update briefing and DI tests for workspace agent","tree":{"sha":"77aaec88b846fa9771e5adeab10309d2a698fa41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/77aaec88b846fa9771e5adeab10309d2a698fa41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/2a30d78f9fb305d1355b9329229c9b91b969ad75","verification":{"payload":"tree 77aaec88b846fa9771e5adeab10309d2a698fa41\nparent e0bead2a1f24413d153be1cd18bef1471df2c6e6\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791044685 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791044685 +0700\n\nMYAH-445: Workspace reply agent page and Campaign agent controls (#221)\n\n* MYAH-445: Workspace reply agent page and Campaign agent controls\n\nOne workspace agent (voice, brand info, reply rules, hand-off rules,\nsending mode) on a new Brand Workspace > Agent page. The Campaign Agent\ntab now holds the preferred conversation channel and an ''Always require\napproval'' override; Campaign Settings picks the Instagram sending account\n(auto-selected when only one is connected). Reply proposals use the\nworkspace agent guidance instead of per-Campaign guidance fields.\n\n* MYAH-445: Test Campaign Instagram sender selection and sending-mode authority\n\n* MYAH-445: Regenerate GraphQL clients; update briefing and DI tests for workspace agent","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwSxNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3DIQACu5XLQf1+scAL0D0IXlpRop\nb0EfUJcIt+r85BhbGQilgYqjrWYsDVTKoOejWWF5RD1RdLz04VDxWOQU9Bvsvrj3\nCXwt+CUPhlygGQk/0MNn6qo5+d4wG386Ryu8xOcaX8gJ5YGe4QWi+Rtm5f7MO33O\npRq7zV1XGsmw7CM9UFG4pcSjH7T2QfVXRWz8rTtn79vb76a/cmOid/RXZfW+0EyD\nFFgv74oCNyaugjs9aGZxKp48Wc6U8Qem4/uChnRJUt3pOIp6mNMNAQIb3uxljKxf\nHSqlK+Bv7VnrOCk8kdYobWozO