pos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/2a30d78f9fb305d1355b9329229c9b91b969ad75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152369481?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/e0bead2a1f24413d153be1cd18bef1471df2c6e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:01:04Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:01:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(upgrade): unblock MYAH-409 Creator migration on retired standard restrictions (#220)\n\nProduction deploy of #193 aborted in the T3labs workspace: our standard\nCreator Ops function role (no users) still hid social fields from the old\nschema, so the migration skipped 291 values and refused to continue. The\ncurrent standard role no longer declares those restrictions.\n\nKeep the first pass identical so its 166 existing receipts replay, then\npreserve only the released values under a separate attempt key. Verified\nread-only against production rows: 166/166 digests match, 291 profiles\nfor 150 Creators, 0 conflicts, 0 remaining skipped values.\n\nRefs MYAH-409","tree":{"sha":"567b8ba77240cc197bff5037607b9cd9a68bd650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/567b8ba77240cc197bff5037607b9cd9a68bd650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/e0bead2a1f24413d153be1cd18bef1471df2c6e6","verification":{"payload":"tree 567b8ba77240cc197bff5037607b9cd9a68bd650\nparent 47e0d1551c296bc95c0edb6ae077e82a407fa9a0\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1791007264 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791007264 +0700\n\nfix(upgrade): unblock MYAH-409 Creator migration on retired standard restrictions (#220)\n\nProduction deploy of #193 aborted in the T3labs workspace: our standard\nCreator Ops function role (no users) still hid social fields from the old\nschema, so the migration skipped 291 values and refused to continue. The\ncurrent standard role no longer declares those restrictions.\n\nKeep the first pass identical so its 166 existing receipts replay, then\npreserve only the released values under a separate attempt key. Verified\nread-only against production rows: 166/166 digests match, 291 profiles\nfor 150 Creators, 0 conflicts, 0 remaining skipped values.\n\nRefs MYAH-409","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwJogCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIOEQAIxfe38mGyeQaxho9PRuHs5n\nsaoXpFBY/+/gGf7c32WJ9D7oeZ5tPIaH5wFxcpH4PAZNv7F+myaAcI2TytxZehcV\nYtw2vO34IoatkO4BXLXhTglaeI4OWhk5hlEag4KZ08tQs7DnnXL0TbTqUgV/7E51\nEt16DpDWV4HQl4pvIT/TFjscBiQ7dE3RD86WvmRe6Oyo1nmOR9rgWw+tcxxtg65C\nsKBWXzC0mipXkBsm2T/tRNAtLv1qA6UkTMCTGyAzpuSRHlxS7/wd6M/WRJagvRm7\nGEY78atf+Kwkh0dMyJWuBpi6xd0BHo7jvxyqps4EWe1XfpAllDRC256yA1GE2GQc\nRQ/YPgU1CaO/7FYPduHsze3pW77FdtTsS30IeWkqIvyVN8Pt/CBq0E21Csy3+qgg\nGL222XIsZxrYq4BzLXcJX03nJzgV/oafwxlsxfof5CQbIO+8G98JdqgxKIXYDXy/\neS1wRuF7MlxGQaOzYCxNVbFg0tnl8HNcFoTCEW/F6TOb37TXKKTjfxpwvsy6XY0j\nAf9ayGsfmqDUObNxhopk0UfUqNlag5tkhsYbplhBq24W1Z