stax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deestax","id":152369481,"login":"deestax","node_id":"U_kgDOCRT5SQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deestax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/47e0d1551c296bc95c0edb6ae077e82a407fa9a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:35:14Z","email":"152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Superdao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:35:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-409: Normalize Creator social profiles and Notes (#193)\n\n* feat: normalize creator social profiles\n\n* feat: complete clean Creator profile cutover (MYAH-409)\n\n* Fix MYAH-409 test fixture types found by PR CI\n\n* MYAH-409: Guard schema cutover and paginate Campaign profiles\n\n* MYAH-409: Gate fresh-only CI on current schema\n\n* fix(ci): reconcile reviewed guards and native schema fixtures\n\n* fix(import): expose social profile and note destinations in Creator mapping\n\nShow virtual SocialProfile and supplementary Note destinations in the column\npicker, honor disabled destinations so an occupied Note cannot be silently\ndisplaced, and map a ''notes'' header to the native Note by default.\n\nRefs MYAH-409\n\n* fix(import): refresh the open Creator table after a Creator import\n\nThe Creator commit path evicted Apollo cache but never emitted the\ncreate-many record event the native import path uses, so the table count\nupdated while rows stayed empty until reload.\n\nRefs MYAH-409","tree":{"sha":"e76ee3b509f62c8fc06faa0ca2ef78ab3a4c9b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/e76ee3b509f62c8fc06faa0ca2ef78ab3a4c9b05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/47e0d1551c296bc95c0edb6ae077e82a407fa9a0","verification":{"payload":"tree e76ee3b509f62c8fc06faa0ca2ef78ab3a4c9b05\nparent 442a96d37fbe985e7e743688febb0c4ce941793e\nauthor Superdao <152369481+deestax@users.noreply.github.com> 1790962514 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790962514 +0700\n\nMYAH-409: Normalize Creator social profiles and Notes (#193)\n\n* feat: normalize creator social profiles\n\n* feat: complete clean Creator profile cutover (MYAH-409)\n\n* Fix MYAH-409 test fixture types found by PR CI\n\n* MYAH-409: Guard schema cutover and paginate Campaign profiles\n\n* MYAH-409: Gate fresh-only CI on current schema\n\n* fix(ci): reconcile reviewed guards and native schema fixtures\n\n* fix(import): expose social profile and note destinations in Creator mapping\n\nShow virtual SocialProfile and supplementary Note destinations in the column\npicker, honor disabled destinations so an occupied Note cannot be silently\ndisplaced, and map a ''notes'' header to the native Note by default.\n\nRefs MYAH-409\n\n* fix(import): refresh the open Creator table after a Creator import\n\nThe Creator commit path evicted Apollo cache but never emitted the\ncreate-many record event the native import path uses, so the table count\nupdated while rows stayed empty until reload.\n\nRefs MYAH-409","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv+tSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4b0QAFH8psKd6j1gOmGo/Qr7up/N\nvL+jXgm4Aod9ydQwwpSxwV9KW4Xss07e/k0yhztn0erBSxm6XwWT3wcqRnbuGuD8\n8zb3p7J5VBiTJEPa6W91ZgfqLoHMBd9QcZomJmNdPMV4m13B3RKDP1t2kiDNTrnr\ntbQNfeipCYFKUjLitpKIl5F2CjK2xkJcigAwcEmAyFXJ2ffQwuN2ulL