RL (#195)\n\nAdd https://api26.unipile.com:15641/api/v1/ to the exact Unipile API base URL allowlist so Instagram can be enabled with the production Unipile account. Existing api46/api49 entries are kept; all other URLs remain rejected.","tree":{"sha":"85f7e4b7ee69d82c8bc6d7336915bf85f1604ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/85f7e4b7ee69d82c8bc6d7336915bf85f1604ba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/cd59398628712fde9e372dea6e6ee4675f28a695","verification":{"payload":"tree 85f7e4b7ee69d82c8bc6d7336915bf85f1604ba7\nparent 650d5968b7c4268edd8dbd0c55564a38ee5866d4\nauthor zeno <104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com> 1790577405 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790577405 +0530\n\nMYAH-434: accept the production Unipile API base URL (#195)\n\nAdd https://api26.unipile.com:15641/api/v1/ to the exact Unipile API base URL allowlist so Instagram can be enabled with the production Unipile account. Existing api46/api49 entries are kept; all other URLs remain rejected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqugr9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV4IQAJq/XW0fVub7Oe4xVuC+LOK6\nJYmqFJ173mzggeTH2TucuSYsSIlTsdqOolZxq9Pfzk12coc+V3a3DzEQfjFjucLh\n26W3ETO0KjevCdLIGlCrFPgGTE1NfdWIOZqbKjGvjxmIGskLyvNvoI/Nwa5ZfKSi\nNgAbQMz0XE5QTru03MtA1NT5Uc6ISDvsSkzzK1T7TZBt6rd8ART8DkM0uNE180Op\nOixTWmkO8ZKam8FXZIOIQto5Ckg7ERa1/v85h7BoSH2/DHJ5VVZJy/8PS+aY8DPb\nUKHewRToX5U6xcojRhuJEzQKwBvxzeY3Esnr2S9U2m7wkKuClJ+bnM+3SMmtUxhG\n2jWU8E+udoquR2kKbnaxogm5dztuHKBySI4Y7Zdt6nQQBOCVPHpbA9c5yqQAVISf\nlmMQSXYwzymRsQrxR+xa/6iPVbFjZ4/EO7kvckAktI2uacLREzvQyMzEdiRtp5oq\nRRhYpJZSVc59NQRDAROgvdM2tLAEagB+xrQFmk82N9HMVqgA/SdQ1hW0KW5aQWQC\nyecXBMBDrc/bkFeIUKJFapVlySTk7CxX3n6RKr65oSIZ+SyRKrAQWrIeLiPfU4Wz\nDiZ21vTcBHdrKcW0ECsB+NIOkGqT9bRJCrSF3zb7LoAQYb29F15TKuv/yHK9Mdsq\nuq7Yitm8bHZukrsHcmtZ\n=u/1w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T06:36:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commit/cd59398628712fde9e372dea6e6ee4675f28a695","node_id":"C_kwDOTVO3DtoAKGNkNTkzOTg2Mjg3MTJmZGU5ZTM3MmRlYTZlNmVlNDY3NWYyOGE2OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commit/650d5968b7c4268edd8dbd0c55564a38ee5866d4","sha":"650d5968b7c4268edd8dbd0c55564a38ee5866d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/650d5968b7c4268edd8dbd0c55564a38ee5866d4"}],"sha":"cd59398628712fde9e372dea6e6ee4675f28a695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/cd59398628712fde9e372dea6e6ee4675f28a695"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104142635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zrmnelson","id":104142635,"login":"zrmnelson","node_id":"U_kgDOBjUXKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zrmnelson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/commits/650d5968b7c4268edd8dbd0c55564a38ee5866d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:48:32Z","email":"104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zeno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:48:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MYAH-414: Provision Instagram metadata through source-controlled standard app (#192)\n\n* MYAH-414: provision Instagram metadata through source-controlled standard app\n\nMove the four Instagram objects (account, social conversation, social\nmessage, reply draft), their 93 fields including the two Creator reverse\nrelations, and the five unique indexes out of the Instagram SDK app and\ninto the Twenty standard application, provisioned by normal deployment.\n\n- Add 2.20 workspace command 1790491923604 that adopts historical\n  SDK-installed Instagram metadata: renames the four legacy tables, their\n  enum types and unique indexes to the native contract inside one\n  transaction, transfers ownership, and fails closed on ambiguous state.\n- Switch Unipile, Instagram composer/approval and Inbox triage consumers to\n  the native tables.\n- Remove the Instagram SDK app package, the myah-standard-apps module and\n  the standard-app deploy workflow.\n- Update tests, fixtures and upgrade-sequence assertions accordingly.\n\n* MYAH-414: point triage upgrade spec runtime cases at native Instagram tables\n\nThe historical 2.20 triage baseline still reads the legacy\n_myahSocialConversation/_myahSocialMessage tables, but the runtime triage\nservice and Instagram producer now use the native tables. Create native\nfixture tables alongside the legacy ones and move the five runtime/producer\ncases to them, keeping every assertion (direction, ordered LIVE replay,\nmarker fence, no deadlock, READY/COMPLETE/NEEDS_REPLY).","tree":{"sha":"7711c36be034b0e6f9c50383bcaa566f5df31e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/trees/7711c36be034b0e6f9c50383bcaa566f5df31e3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/T3-Venture-Labs-Limited/myah-v4/git/commits/650d5968b7c4268edd8dbd0c55564a38ee5866d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 7711c36be034b0e6f9c50383bcaa566f5df31e3d\nparent 0eeb67096c7ee9ba902957e520a351aeb4e2585e\nauthor zeno <104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com> 1790520512 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790520512 +0530\n\nMYAH-414: Provision Instagram metadata through source-controlled standard app (#192)\n\n* MYAH-414: provision Instagram metadata through source-controlled standard app\n\nMove the four Instagram objects (account, social conversation, social\nmessage, reply draft), their 93 fields including the two Creator reverse\nrelations, and the five unique indexes out of the Instagram SDK app and\ninto the Twenty standard application, provisioned by normal deployment.\n\n- Add 2.20 workspace command 1790491923604 that adopts historical\n  SDK-installed Instagram metadata: renames the four legacy tables, their\n  enum types and unique indexes to the native contract inside one\n  transaction, transfers ownership, and fails closed on ambiguous state.\n- Switch Unipile, Instagram composer/approval and Inbox triage consumers to\n  the native tables.\n- Remove the Instagram SDK app package, the myah-standard-apps module and\n  the standard-app deploy workflow.\n- Update tests, fixtures and upgrade-sequence assertions accordingly.\n\n* MYAH-414: point triage upgrade spec runtime cases at native Instagram tables\n\nThe historical 2.20 triage baseline still reads the legacy\n_myahSocialConversation/_myahSocialMessage tables, but the runtime triage\nservice and Instagram producer now use the native tables. Create native\nfixture tables alongside the legacy ones and move the five runtime/producer\ncases to them, keeping every assertion (direction, ordered LIVE replay,\nmarker fence, no deadlock, READY/COMPLETE/NEEDS_REPLY).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquSzACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoMsQABS6CHLeBVEfW0XS4FINw0tf\npMLzYX6Bzne2y/ug5vcAwlMeEPOY5grGxEBRAvs4lL3w3NeWgyCQh3p4D/ND55wt\nicT8wRdKPGh45XuzOl5fjB8RwufPRaKBcld5cJSXibU93AGVtxaI4BgJkogFv1B7\nJtbyhgaxTFb+MxiLjayO7UB5xDXaZrNOUrGlsBDcHNglkOxWxNZkS8KziJzOtfZz\nrzZrVb+YayQC4KWa22VUBD2CqTaWjMyzQ56V4vGeW1Z3/YaRwtpKR3wDULibRORN\nvewSKZ6JPmqgQtmvJoURNcE5FErLgikNS+Iao7R2OxDt9Y6wfAVhziNJBvPHhDQB\nNIGHGGvcrsGnvEih4MDfUxED8Bf/gfg7TE9PSQwI+6y9y9JpjPNV/PSvpPIiu+xN\nPxUksMzBklftx1qgTg3o0GMY03ETIe/FE4N2DC35p42jjNjk35wjpbH/pOvXE18M\nsUr6e2htJP+8ljvPSBjVeIHBudICmVWeXcGQz5iWSgNR777v5ENbVkE5+ToTXoNV\nMHLh8v0MYV0veRVXm6MBZml8QfKbHvsemHLvgZrJgyPClq6un7xadfqaNIq1D/WA\nf7blO++vunZqCoTIBKx7iWc5Ip506sp+s0KYDuLtJAKJCi2Bb0XMCq9zhzulH5L9\n+cEjfXcS2P9B37kZRNQm\n=qToC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T14:48:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events