i.github.com/users/sadrazkh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/commits/5115b96e1c640bcb20e22b13dacc68688f5e684b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T07:36:06Z","email":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T07:36:06Z","email":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"message":"@\nPrepare for CapRover deployment\n\n- captain-definition (root) → builds docker/Dockerfile\n- Dockerfile: set DATA_DIR=/data so Data Protection keys + uploads + exports land on the\n  persistent volume (fixes secrets being lost on redeploy)\n- UseForwardedHeaders: trust X-Forwarded-Proto/For behind CapRover/Caddy/nginx\n- docs/DEPLOY-CAPROVER.md: full step-by-step (Postgres app, env vars, port 8080,\n  persistent /data, HTTPS, Telegram)\n- Verified the published artifact boots in Production mode: fresh DB auto-migrates,\n  bootstrap admin created, SPA + API served on one port\n- Drop unused logger param; make one Telegram test wait for the async send (no flake)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n@","tree":{"sha":"ff72e82415932d5fefb16125c3e8545f4ca6a431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/trees/ff72e82415932d5fefb16125c3e8545f4ca6a431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/commits/5115b96e1c640bcb20e22b13dacc68688f5e684b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45653648?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/events{/privacy}","follo