r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/commits/95ab95952908e9dfc423edee0cc0e2e50764feec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:52:53Z","email":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:52:53Z","email":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"message":"@\nTelegram bot, Mini App, PWA & demo seed (M6) implemented\n\n- Telegram bot: webhook + polling modes, /start /tasks /next /help commands\n- Account linking: hashed one-time codes, takeover prevention, self-unlink + admin revoke\n- Notifications: assignment, reprocess-ready, run-finished (best-effort, proxy-aware)\n- Mini App: /tg entry with initData HMAC auth -> JWT, theme mapping, deep links\n- Installable PWA: app-shell precache + update prompt (disabled inside Telegram)\n- Admin Settings: bot token (encrypted), mode, set-webhook, test-bot\n- Self-contained demo seed (SEED_DEMO): users, project, 60 processed records, assignments, approvals\n- docs/SETUP.md; 15 new tests (159 total green)\n\nMVP complete: all six milestones shipped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n@","tree":{"sha":"b17aac8b77d1a6eb7ce0b484f803909f7b34a45b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/trees/b17aac8b77d1a6eb7ce0b484f803909f7b34a45b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/commits/95ab95952908e9dfc423edee0cc0e2e50764feec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45653648?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/gists{/gist_id}","gr