gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"message":"AI processing engine: structured extraction runs (M3)\n\nImplements a robust AI-powered processing engine for structured data extraction from records. Adds a ProcessingWorker background service with per-project concurrency, crash recovery, and cooperative cancellation. Introduces ExtractionPipeline for prompt building, provider calls (with structured-output JSON Schema and fallback), output parsing/repair, and strict schema validation/normalization.\n\nExposes new `/api/projects/{projectId}/runs` endpoints for creating, listing, viewing, cancelling, and retrying processing runs. Frontend gains a \"Runs\" tab with live progress, run details, and failed record handling. Records page supports bulk processing. Includes comprehensive integration and unit tests for the full extraction flow. Updates project wiring, SignalR proxy, and documentation.","tree":{"sha":"2f2a1df26e76dd1df01486093793624204f075d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/trees/2f2a1df26e76dd1df01486093793624204f075d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/commits/e7d14212f3583eea1422ab4ee83660d1a2a877f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45653648?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sadrazkh","id":45653648,"login":"sadrazkh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjUzNjQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sadrazkh/Structura/commit/e7d14212f3583eea1422ab4ee83660d1a2a877f7","node_id":"C_kwDOTVQQF9oAKGU3ZDE0MjEyZjM1ODNlZWExNDIyYWI0ZWU4MzY2MGQxYTJhODc3Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sadrazkh/Structura/commit/44d08190b2f7e616077aa453198b8ea9bf61f7d6","sha":"44d08190b2f7e616077aa453198b8ea9bf61f7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/commits/44d08190b2f7e616077aa453198b8ea9bf61f7d6"}],"sha":"e7d14212f3583eea1422ab4ee83660d1a2a877f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/commits/e7d14212f3583eea1422ab4ee83660d1a2a877f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45653648?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sadrazkh","id":45653648,"login":"sadrazkh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjUzNjQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/commits/44d08190b2f7e616077aa453198b8ea9bf61f7d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:51:05Z","email":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:51:05Z","email":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com","name":"sadra.z.kh@gmail.com"},"message":"Project records, schema builder, AI config & import (M2)\n\nImplements Milestone 2: project record ingestion, dynamic schema builder, AI provider/config management, and import flows.\n\n- Backend: Adds models/migrations for records, imports, processing runs, and extraction results. Implements endpoints for schema (versioned, validated), AI settings (provider, encrypted key, test), import (Excel/CSV upload, mapping, chunked/streamed, dedup, error/cancel/resume), manual/API input, and record browser (filters, pagination, detail, bulk delete). Adds SSRF-hardened outbound HTTP, SignalR hub for live progress, and data protection for secrets.\n- Frontend: New project-level navigation with tabs (Records, Schema, AI Settings, Import, Settings). Dynamic schema builder UI, AI config UI, import UI (file/manual/API), records browser, and SignalR client for live updates. Refactored routing and settings.\n- Testing: Integration tests for schema, AI config, import, API input, and records. Unit tests for schema validation and SSRF.\n- Other: Adds MiniExcel, CsvHelper, SignalR, WireMock.Net. Updates docs and milestone status.","tree":{"sha":"0fd10720001d46189ca988396cdc09434727c4c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/trees/0fd10720001d46189ca988396cdc09434727c4c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadrazkh/Structura/git/commits/44d08190b2f7e616077aa453198b8ea9bf61f7d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45653648?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadrazkh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadr