1","id":137675660,"login":"Kholia-1","node_id":"U_kgDOCDTDjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/7c4ada1b4e2547249e0f16fbbedfdc7e7a0d7d5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:14:16Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:14:16Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"message":"feat(diaspora-ocr): modèle de reconnaissance latin (PP-OCRv3) + prétraitement image\n\nLe modèle RapidOCR par défaut lit très mal une CNI française (labels illisibles type\n« DATEDERANSSS ») → aucune extraction possible. On charge le modèle latin dédié\n(server/diaspora-ocr/ocr_models/, hors-versioning) et on ajoute un prétraitement :\nagrandissement systématique, puis 2e passe deskew Otsu + CLAHE si la 1re lit peu.\nRepli automatique sur le modèle par défaut si le modèle latin est absent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"010a07d541e5cf0e0b9312e91078abe3316784c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/010a07d541e5cf0e0b9312e91078abe3316784c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/7c4ada1b4e2547249e0f16fbbedfdc7e7a0d7d5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137675660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.