on-portal/commits/43d47ef4c8aa60e0c0adb8b0aeddc72e87e91e0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:18:35Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:18:35Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"message":"feat(diaspora-ocr): extraction consolidée haute-récupération (MRZ + libellés FR/EN)\n\nReprend les meilleures techniques du backend Python d''origine (document_auth_service),\nadaptées à notre contrat /extract recto/verso et aux clés du frontend :\n- MRZ TD1/TD3 (ICAO 9303) : la clé de contrôle devient un SIGNAL de confiance, on\n  n''abandonne plus un champ dont la clé échoue (cause du « rien n''est extrait » sur photo réelle) ;\n- extraction par libellé FR/EN : nom, prénom, date+lieu de naissance, date+lieu de\n  délivrance, n° de pièce (CNI/passeport), nationalité ;\n- dates en toutes lettres (''15 MARS 1990'') et numériques ;\n- nationalité mappée vers le code ISO-2 de la liste déroulante du formulaire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b27699e0b2202c4ff9bad9fffce300ed00c099a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/b27699e0b2202c4ff9bad9fffce300ed00c099a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/43d47ef4c8aa60e0c0adb8b0aeddc72e87e91e0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137675660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kholia-1","id":137675660,"login":"Kholia-1","node_id":"U_kgDOCDTDjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia