/api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/2f67832013054ff116af57e8368d061f3c322236/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T18:18:50Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T18:29:47Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"message":"chore(diaspora-otp): persistance SQLite des agences (listAgencies/replaceAgencies)\n\nComplète la persistance déjà en place pour dossiers/documents/OTP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13fa307d280533b1a0e277a6f96d83000f435dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/13fa307d280533b1a0e277a6f96d83000f435dfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/2f67832013054ff116af57e8368d061f3c322236","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137675660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kholia-1","id":137675660,"login":"Kholia-1","node_id":"U_kgDOCDTDjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Efraim0601/union-portal/commit/2f67832013054ff116af57e8368d061f3c322236","node_id":"C_kwDOTVbg99oAKDJmNjc4MzIwMTMwNTRmZjExNmFmNTdlODM2OGQwNjFmM2MzMjIyMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Efraim0601/union-portal/commit/b3931953968cfa6c10ac75e568c6319f59fd45f3","sha":"b3931953968cfa6c10ac75e568c6319f59fd45f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/b3931953968cfa6c10ac75e568c6319f59fd45f3"}],"sha":"2f67832013054ff116af57e8368d061f3c322236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/2f67832013054ff116af57e8368d061f3c322236"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137675660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kholia-1","id":137675660,"login":"Kholia-1","node_id":"U_kgDOCDTDjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kholia-1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/b3931953968cfa6c10ac75e568c6319f59fd45f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T18:04:52Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T18:29:46Z","email":"belloetienne@gmail.com","name":"Kholia-1"},"message":"feat(diaspora): persistance SQLite, recherche multi-critères, cadrage caméra live\n\n- server/diaspora-otp/db.js : base SQLite (node:sqlite, aucune dépendance) —\n  dossiers particulier/entreprise, documents uploadés (disque + DB), sessions OTP.\n  Chaque dossier soumis obtient une référence recherchable ; les documents se lient\n  automatiquement au dossier via pre_onboarding_session_id.\n- Contrat OTP/référentiels aligné sur le vrai backend FastAPI (cf. commit distant\n  3854a20) : routes /pre-onboarding/otp/{send,verify}, session_id fourni par le\n  client, réponse fallback_otp/whatsapp_delivered, référentiels au format\n  iso_code/name_fr/calling_code — mon backend Node sert ainsi de doublure locale\n  fonctionnelle avec exactement le même contrat que le vrai serveur.\n- Page « Suivre ma demande » : recherche par référence, e-mail ou numéro WhatsApp\n  (les endpoints existaient déjà côté API, il manquait l''interface).\n- Cadrage caméra live qui suit la pièce d''identité / le visage détecté (au lieu\n  d''un cadre statique) ; bascule automatique sur la caméra arrière pour les\n  documents (avant : caméra frontale par défaut, peu adapté à une pièce physique).\n- OCR : détection MRZ resserrée (longueur + densité de ''<'') pour ne plus confondre\n  du texte de recto avec la vraie zone MRZ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1addbfad7c77257348718514074d053bb038c8da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/1addbfad7c77257348718514074d053bb038c8da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/b3931953968cfa6c10ac75e568c6319f59fd45f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co