VXNlcjg2NTE5MDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/52ff3db5c76e92a38d1d225c89b853beed7dae7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:07:13Z","email":"djkachempire@gmail.com","name":"H-DJACK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:07:13Z","email":"djkachempire@gmail.com","name":"H-DJACK"},"message":"fix(promote): préfixe PROMOTE_BASE sur la nav du menu (NG04002 en fédération)\n\nLe menu (staff-sidebar), le dashboard et la home naviguaient avec des\nchemins absolus bruts (/admin, /dashboard, /paylogs…). En fédération,\npromote est monté sous /promote : ces URLs étaient résolues à la racine\ndu shell → NG04002 ''admin''/''dashboard''/''paylogs''.\n\nOn applique promoteUrl(base, path), comme le font déjà guards.ts et\nlogin.ts. Inchangé en standalone (base ''''), correct en fédération\n(base ''/promote'').\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c3eac1ada2f6f685fb79a0b96fa0475e0c96258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/7c3eac1ada2f6f685fb79a0b96fa0475e0c96258"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/52ff3db5c76e92a38d1d225c89b853beed7dae7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86519082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/followers"