users/H-DJACK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/77c7b4fb3b4dfd106bc28bf748246bd7aa92d106/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:09:52Z","email":"djkachempire@gmail.com","name":"H-DJACK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:09:52Z","email":"djkachempire@gmail.com","name":"H-DJACK"},"message":"fix(promote): attache le JWT en fédération (403 sur tout l''espace authentifié)\n\nEn fédération native, `Api`/`Auth` étaient `providedIn: ''root''` → liés à\nl''injecteur racine du shell, qui ne fournit pas le HttpClient porteur du\n`tokenInterceptor` (déclaré seulement dans les providers de la route promote).\nRésultat : aucun header `Authorization` → 403 sur /auth/me, /settings/*,\n/stats/admin, /users, /profiles… et UI figée sur « Chargement… ».\n\nCorrectif : retire `providedIn: ''root''` de Api et Auth, et les fournit au\nniveau de la route promote (remote.routes.ts) et de l''app standalone\n(app.config.ts), au même endroit que le HttpClient intercepté. Marche en\nfédération ET en standalone (:4201).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e766f2d3d0f2b3815ce6b58580ffa5449b808cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/e766f2d3d0f2b3815ce6b58580ffa5449b808cdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/77c7b4fb3b4dfd106bc28bf748246bd7aa92d106","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86519082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/fol