ub.com/users/H-DJACK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/commits/1666bd8cff1d8f29c50b249a88834a802aed9f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:42:34Z","email":"djkachempire@gmail.com","name":"H-DJACK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:42:34Z","email":"djkachempire@gmail.com","name":"H-DJACK"},"message":"docs(readme): setup dev & prod — prérequis, HTTPS/caméra, TrustPayWay, dépannage\n\n- Prérequis (Node 24, npm 11, Docker) + rappel des 2 backends\n- Correction du proxy dev promote (/promote-api -> :8390/api)\n- Section HTTPS & caméra (getUserMedia exige une origine sûre ; cert\n  auto-signé, UNION_SSL_PORT 6443/8443)\n- Section Paiement TrustPayWay (provider simulated|trustpayway au boot,\n  identifiants env ou UI Admin, webhook, vérif /payment/provider)\n- Section Dépannage (ERESOLVE package-lock, deploy.sh écrase, healthcheck\n  IPv6, mot de passe DB promote)\n- Ports HTTPS ajoutés aux exemples docker run / tableau serveur\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7177c291b14b360a152e660bd1cd0f4ada6893c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/trees/c7177c291b14b360a152e660bd1cd0f4ada6893c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efraim0601/union-portal/git/commits/1666bd8cff1d8f29c50b249a88834a802aed9f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86519082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H-DJACK/following{/ot