nts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T20:02:28Z","email":"20233tn087@utez.edu.mx","name":"RuuizOr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T20:02:28Z","email":"20233tn087@utez.edu.mx","name":"RuuizOr"},"message":"fix: candado de doble clic al guardar recinto y boton Cancelar en el canvas\n\n/venues no es idempotente: un doble clic en Registrar antes de que React\nalcance a deshabilitar el boton disparaba la cascada de creacion dos veces\ny dejaba recintos duplicados. Se agrega un candado sincrono (useRef, no\ndepende del render) ademas del estado que ya deshabilitaba el boton, y se\nmuestra un indicador de guardado (spinner en el boton + abajo a la derecha\ndel canvas) para que quede claro que esta trabajando.\n\nTambien se agrega un boton Cancelar en el canvas de crear/editar recinto\nque regresa a la lista de recintos, porque antes no habia forma de salir\ndel editor sin guardar.","tree":{"sha":"24c8ae58efe0be2588473a47f57c6e7be030120e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/24c8ae58efe0be2588473a47f57c6e7be030120e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/56df9ba4472fa4137dfe1794d29349c9b098a793","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168696154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RuuizOr","id":168696154,"login":"RuuizOr","node_id":"U_kgDOCg4ZWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuuizOr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur