elOcampoM"},"message":"[FIX]: pasar SMTP_SECURE al contenedor de auth\n\nEl código lo lee para decidir si negocia STARTTLS o abre TLS directo,\npero el compose no lo pasaba: dentro del contenedor quedaba undefined y\nnodemailer elegía por su cuenta. Con el puerto 587 hay que hacer\nSTARTTLS, así que un valor equivocado hace fallar el envío sin decir por\nqué. Se pasa explícito, con false por defecto.","tree":{"sha":"eee93cf080f536d0c52f063d7955405eaa02d7c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/eee93cf080f536d0c52f063d7955405eaa02d7c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/91f806664e89d274d615117533efd8858c8ccd50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/91f806664e89d274d615117533efd8858c8ccd50","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDkxZjgwNjY2NGU4OWQyNzRkNjE1MTE3NTMzZWZkODg1OGM4Y2NkNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.c