tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/2e77862097ce2ec3388978adc19c4d89b547e35c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:01:00Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:01:00Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"message":"[FIX]: nombres y respuestas dictables por voz\n\nProbando por voz salió que el flujo se rompía siempre en el mismo punto:\nel usuario no lograba nombrar un evento.\n\nCausa: los nombres sembrados eran ''DEV - Rock en Vivo: Noches\nEléctricas''. Alexa lee el prefijo letra por letra (''d. e. v.'') porque no\nes una palabra, y el subtítulo alarga el nombre. Encima la skill leía\nrecinto y fecha de los cuatro eventos, así que el usuario repetía la\nlista completa: una frase de veinte palabras que ningún slot puede\nemparejar, y caía en Fallback.\n\n- El sembrador ya no antepone ''DEV - '' ni usa subtítulos: ''Rock en Vivo''.\n- Con varios eventos se dicen solo los nombres; el recinto y la fecha se\n  reservan para cuando hay uno solo o se piden los detalles.\n- Los prompts del modelo llevan un ejemplo (''Di solo el nombre, por\n  ejemplo: Rock en Vivo''). Son los que usa Alexa al elicitar, no los de\n  la skill, así que es ahí donde hay que enseñar la forma de respuesta.\n- El catálogo estático de EventType se alinea con los nombres reales.","tree":{"sha":"bcaa3be907d64d81bbedc31696348f89e4050571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/bcaa3be907d64d81bbedc31696348f89e4050571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/2e77862097ce2ec3388978adc19c4d89b547e35c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/2e77862097ce2ec3388978adc19c4d89b547e35c","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDJlNzc4NjIwOTdjZTJlYzMzODg5NzhhZGMxOWM0ZDg5YjU0N2UzNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167","sha":"425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167"}],"sha":"2e77862097ce2ec3388978adc19c4d89b547e35c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/2e77862097ce2ec3388978adc19c4d89b547e35c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:09:19Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:09:19Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"message":"[DOCS]: documentar los tropiezos reales de puesta en marcha\n\nCosas que costaron tiempo al montarlo y que no estaban escritas:\nmigrate dev aborta sin TTY (va migrate deploy), el sembrador de eventos\nestá bajo prisma.seed y no en scripts (pnpm run seed y prisma db seed\nfallan, hay que llamar al ts-node local), venues-events-service necesita\npnpm install por las dependencias de subida de imágenes, y Save no es\nDeploy. Se actualizan también las frases de prueba a los eventos que\nsiembra el proyecto.","tree":{"sha":"6c49b118479f46b4201b01a360c952a6fdc4032e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/6c49b118479f46b4201b01a360c952a6fdc4032e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDQyNWI2ZTA4NjkyZWJmYTM1Yzc1ZmEyMDM2NWZmNjZlNWY2M2UxNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf","sha":"d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf"}],"sha":"425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/425b6e08692ebfa35c75fa20365ff66e5f63e167"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T06:00:40Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T06:00:40Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"message":"[FEAT]: listar eventos para cualquier rol y no dejar al usuario sin salida\n\nTres arreglos de flujo que salieron al probar en la consola:\n\n1. Un cliente no tenía forma de saber qué eventos existen: listar era\n   exclusivo del organizador, así que ''cuáles son los eventos'' se le\n   negaba y quedaba obligado a adivinar un nombre. Ahora el intent sirve\n   a los tres roles con distinto alcance: el organizador ve los suyos,\n   los demás ven el catálogo publicado.\n\n2. Los menús describían las consultas en abstracto (''puedes preguntarme\n   qué zonas tiene un evento'') y la gente los repetía literal, sin\n   nombrar ningún evento, cayendo en Fallback. Ahora dan frases que se\n   pueden decir tal cual.\n\n3. Al pedir un evento se preguntaba ''¿de qué evento?'' a secas. Quien no\n   conoce el catálogo contestaba cualquier cosa y volvía a la misma\n   pregunta, en bucle. askWhichEvent() siempre enumera los disponibles.\n\nSe añaden utterances de catálogo (''qué eventos hay'', ''cuáles son los\neventos'') que antes no existían en el modelo.","tree":{"sha":"49fdec8ebb5a687dbae50c3dcc0e7b40d5435ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/49fdec8ebb5a687dbae50c3dcc0e7b40d5435ba1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKGQ5ZmQ4MWZiYzk3Y2Q1ZGJjZWFiNTg4MGRhOGFkMzkyY2IxNDBkZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40","sha":"764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40"}],"sha":"d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/d9fd81fbc97cd5dbceab5880da8ad392cb140ddf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T05:47:02Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T05:47:02Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"message":"[FIX]: sinónimos de evento distintivos para las entidades dinámicas\n\nLos sinónimos se armaban tomando las dos primeras palabras del nombre a\nciegas. Con los nombres reales (''DEV - Rock en Vivo: Noches Eléctricas'')\neso daba ''DEV -'' y ''DEV'' para TODOS los eventos: idénticos entre sí y\nambiguos, así que no ayudaban a reconocer ninguno.\n\nAhora se quita el prefijo de entorno y el subtítulo tras los dos puntos,\ny se generan formas que la gente sí dice en voz alta: ''Rock en Vivo'',\n''Festival Sabor Norteño''. Se descartan los de menos de 4 caracteres para\nno provocar falsos positivos.","tree":{"sha":"94dffebd6ef468e24879073db7599c2dd5d898fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/94dffebd6ef468e24879073db7599c2dd5d898fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDc2NGQ2MDc2M2JjN2RiY2RlNDk3MTAxOGI2YmQ1NjBiMDI4MWFiNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294","sha":"9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294"}],"sha":"764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/764d60763bc7dbcde4971018b6bd560b0281ab40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T03:08:12Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T03:08:12Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"message":"[FIX]: capturar la palabra clave dicha sin frase portadora\n\nEl slot userInput era AMAZON.SearchQuery, que exige palabras alrededor:\nun sample que sea solo {userInput} no es válido para ese tipo. Al\nresponder ''jaguar morado'' a secas no coincidía con nada, caía en\nFallbackIntent y la skill parecía ignorar al usuario. Elicitar el slot\ntampoco lo resuelve: Alexa ni siquiera invoca la skill.\n\nSe cambia a un tipo personalizado SeedPhrase, que sí admite el sample\ndesnudo {userInput}. Sus 203 valores cubren todas las combinaciones que\ngenera el backend (10 adjetivos x 10 sustantivos, en ambos órdenes) más\nlas cuatro palabras de prueba, así que Alexa reconoce cualquiera que se\nemita. Si aun así no resolviera, se usa el texto tal cual se dictó.\n\nSe añade además askForSeed(), que elicita el slot en los 8 puntos donde\nse pide la palabra, para que Alexa espere una respuesta libre en vez de\nvolver a hacer coincidir contra el modelo completo.","tree":{"sha":"d96f46cbcadea2f03d4a426ce8b2b9bacfebdc29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/d96f46cbcadea2f03d4a426ce8b2b9bacfebdc29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDljZDNmOTA5NzliMTI2MjNiM2EzNzUyZGJiYzUxZDY0OWU1N2MyOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078","sha":"29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078"}],"sha":"9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/9cd3f90979b12623b3a3752dbbc51d649e57c294"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:23:05Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:23:05Z","email":"20233tn058@utez.edu.mx","name":"angelOcampoM"},"message":"[FEAT]: conectar la skill de Alexa a la API con login por palabra clave\n\nLa skill dejó de usar datos mock y ahora consume el backend real.\n\nauth-service\n  - columna alexaSeed (única) en User, con su migración\n  - POST /auth/alexa/seed: login con una sola palabra dictada por voz,\n    porque dictar correo y contraseña falla constantemente. La palabra se\n    normaliza (minúsculas, sin acentos ni espacios) en el backend y en la\n    skill, así \"COLIBRÍ BLANCO\" y \"colibri blanco\" resuelven igual.\n  - POST /auth/alexa/seed/generate: genera una palabra fácil de dictar\n    para el usuario autenticado.\n\npurchases-service\n  - GET /purchases/stats acepta ?from=&to= y devuelve el rango aplicado,\n    para que el consumidor distinga un total de periodo de un acumulado.\n  - byEventZone ahora incluye ticketsSold. Antes solo traía la\n    recaudación, así que no había forma de saber cuántos boletos se\n    vendieron por zona.\n  - las consultas con periodo no usan caché: cada rango da otro total y\n    la clave global habría devuelto el acumulado.\n  - con periodo, recentPurchasesCount cuenta las compras del periodo en\n    vez de las de las últimas 24 h.\n\napps/alexa-skill\n  - archivo único, que es lo que acepta el editor del Developer Console\n  - safeHandle() envuelve todos los handlers y reportError() concentra los\n    errores; el speak output explica POR QUÉ falló, no un mensaje genérico\n  - los handlers de negocio solo corren con dialogState COMPLETED; un\n    handler aparte delega el diálogo mientras faltan slots\n  - GetZonesIntent nuevo\n  - el token se guarda en DynamoDB para no pedir la palabra cada vez\n  - Dialog.UpdateDynamicEntities con los eventos reales, así Alexa\n    reconoce eventos nuevos sin volver a construir el modelo\n  - test/simulate.js corre 6 escenarios contra una API falsa con la forma\n    exacta del backend, sin necesitar AWS ni el backend levantado","tree":{"sha":"1f1221b4173364903575d286f553700d7e2b5b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/1f1221b4173364903575d286f553700d7e2b5b8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150630785?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelOcampoM","id":150630785,"login":"angelOcampoM","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpxgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelOcampoM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDI5ZmMzMjk3ZGNlNWMyNzExMDYzNzYyMjljNzQ2NWM0MGFjMDAwNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/4e79302ded39271ba967d4e0663c57a1264b04e4","sha":"4e79302ded39271ba967d4e0663c57a1264b04e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/4e79302ded39271ba967d4e0663c57a1264b04e4"}],"sha":"29fc3297dce5c271106376229c7465c40ac00078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/com