7d6d7a","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDM0NmFmMDU3YzYzMzYwNTJjMDJiZTQwNzgwNTY2YmRjYzg3ZDZkN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97","sha":"5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97"}],"sha":"346af057c6336052c02be40780566bdcc87d6d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/346af057c6336052c02be40780566bdcc87d6d7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168871364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astVVG","id":168871364,"login":"astVVG","node_id":"U_kgDOChDFxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T02:38:29Z","email":"20233tn158@utez.edu.mx","name":"astVVG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T02:38:29Z","email":"20233tn158@utez.edu.mx","name":"astVVG"},"message":"feat: conecta Eventos del Administrador y agrega resumen de ventas por evento\nReemplaza el mock data del listado de Eventos del Administrador por datos\nreales, y crea el resumen de ventas por evento (antes inexistente),\nenlazado desde el botón \"Ver ventas\" de cada card.\n\nBackend:\n- tickets-service: agrega GET /tickets/stats/by-event-zones (boletos\n  totales/vendidos/validados/sin validar/cancelados, agrupados por zona\n  del evento en una sola query).\n- purchases-service: agrega filtro eventId a GET /purchases y a\n  GET /purchases/stats, y agrega el desglose de ingresos por zona\n  (byEventZone) cuando se filtra por evento.\n- Agrega/extiende tests unitarios de ambos servicios.\n\nFrontend:\n- tickets-front: nueva vista EventSalesSummary (ruta /tickets/:eventId)\n  con métricas reales, tabla de compras recientes y distribución por\n  zona, usando useApi() y el mismo patrón de estados de loading/error/\n  vacío del resto del panel.\n- events-front: nuevo api.ts con los tipos reales de GET /events y el\n  mapper toAdminEvent; AdminEventsView ahora consume /events y\n  /tickets/stats en vez del mock; el botón de cada card cambia de\n  \"Ver detalles\" a \"Ver ventas\" y navega a /tickets/:eventId.\n- webshell: registra la ruta tickets/:eventId en el panel de admin.\n- Elimina apps/events-front/src/mocks/adminEvents.ts (sin más usos).","tree":{"sha":"03a854acac2abbae643dcb66b949ba4311f4ff7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/03a854acac2abbae643dcb66b949ba4311f4ff7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168871364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astVVG","id":168871364,"login":"astVVG","node_id":"U_kgDOChDFxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97","node_id":"C_kwDOTVwu1toAKDVlZjI2ZTA2YTFlMmIzNWM5ZDFmMTcwNGNhMDViMzliOTAzNzdhOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/7f75ee2bf83082802c284b931c041ee4f229712e","sha":"7f75ee2bf83082802c284b931c041ee4f229712e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/7f75ee2bf83082802c284b931c041ee4f229712e"}],"sha":"5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/5ef26e06a1e2b35c9d1f1704ca05b39b90377a97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168871364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astVVG","id":168871364,"login":"astVVG","node_id":"U_kgDOChDFxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/7f75ee2bf83082802c284b931c041ee4f229712e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T01:26:13Z","email":"20233tn158@utez.edu.mx","name":"astVVG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T01:26:13Z","email":"20233tn158@utez.edu.mx","name":"astVVG"},"message":"feat: conecta el Dashboard del Administrador al backend real\n\nReemplaza el mock data del Dashboard de Administrador por datos reales\nde los microservicios, reutilizando el cliente HTTP y los endpoints\nexistentes donde era posible.\n\nBackend:\n- venues-events-service: agrega GET /events/stats (total/activos/\n  próximos) y el filtro upcoming=true en GET /events.\n- tickets-service: agrega GET /tickets/stats (boletos vendidos totales\n  y por zona de evento).\n- purchases-service: agrega GET /purchases/stats (ingresos totales\n  confirmados y compras de las últimas 24h).\n- Cachea las 3 respuestas en Redis (TTL 30s) siguiendo el patrón ya\n  usado en el resto de los servicios, con invalidación en cada\n  escritura relevante.\n- Agrega/extiende tests unitarios de los 3 servicios afectados.\n\nFrontend:\n- Nuevo apps/webshell/src/types/dashboard.ts con los tipos Api*/UI y\n  los mappers hacia el backend real.\n- Nuevo hook useDashboardData que agrega las métricas, eventos\n  próximos, actividad reciente (compras + usuarios recientes) y\n  ocupación por evento usando useApi().\n- Dashboard.tsx maneja estados de loading, error (con reintento) y\n  vacío por sección.\n- SalesSummary ahora muestra ocupación real (%) en vez de valores\n  simulados de projected/revenue.\n- Elimina apps/webshell/src/mocks/dashboardMocks.ts (sin más usos).","tree":{"sha":"e90939586e651140d0271603a38917b6c7892329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/e90939586e651140d0271603a38917b6c7892329"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/7f75ee2bf83082802c284b931c041ee4f229712e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned"