WQ5YTRjYTk5MzZlYjgzMjY5MmI5MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amadorcdr/nextticket/commit/87639618169b6404f86d13ab6b0bf1c208446261","sha":"87639618169b6404f86d13ab6b0bf1c208446261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/87639618169b6404f86d13ab6b0bf1c208446261"}],"sha":"0386fcf1e4c1554855d9a4ca9936eb832692b922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/0386fcf1e4c1554855d9a4ca9936eb832692b922"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168871364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astVVG","id":168871364,"login":"astVVG","node_id":"U_kgDOChDFxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/commits/161141088c57c855b11dcb25f93347d54f4a1da9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:14:47Z","email":"20233tn158@utez.edu.mx","name":"astVVG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:14:47Z","email":"20233tn158@utez.edu.mx","name":"astVVG"},"message":"[FEAT] Implementa panel de Administrador (Dashboard, Usuarios, Eventos, Tickets, Recintos)\n\nCompleta las interfaces administrativas dentro de la arquitectura existente,\nreutilizando el shell de webshell/App.tsx y el design system de commons:\n\n- Dashboard: métricas generales, eventos próximos, actividad reciente y\n  resumen de ventas (webshell/src/Dashboard.tsx + components/dashboard/*).\n- Usuarios: tabla con filtros por rol/búsqueda y modal de ver/editar/crear\n  usuario (users-front).\n- Eventos: catálogo administrativo con filtros por estado y acciones hacia\n  detalle de cliente y ventas (events-front).\n- Tickets: nuevo AdminTicketsModule con resumen de ventas por evento y\n  detalle (boletos, compras recientes, distribución por zona), separado de\n  la vista \"Mis boletos\" del cliente que se mantiene intacta (tickets-front).\n- Recintos: se corrige el flujo \"Editar\" (navegaba por error a\n  /users/profile) y se agrega la vista /venues/:id/edit con formulario\n  seccionado, enlazando al editor de zonas existente (venues-front).\n\nSe ajusta la navegación del shell admin (App.tsx) quitando \"Compras\" y\nrenombrando \"Inicio\" a \"Dashboard\" para alinearla con los módulos del rol.\nSin cambios en Cliente, Validador, Organizador ni lógica de autenticación.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"890f9ba265a186f919cf498df322e41f89fda146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/trees/890f9ba265a186f919cf498df322e41f89fda146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amadorcdr/nextticket/git/commits/161141088c57c855b11dcb25f93347d54f4a1da9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168871364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astVVG","id":168871364,"login":"astVVG","node_id":"U_kgDOChDFxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astVVG/orgs","received_ev