authoredDate":"2026-08-31T02:05:07Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T02:05:07Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"cuongct924","providerType":"User"},"email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:05.669Z","repositoryId":1297954108,"sha":"df38ebc40b8851415b6dd25ff3228bf380a823a8"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:05.669Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dce7dba326c072a79f50bd2ee2b0e08e0b065be2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:19:14Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:19:14Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix(audit): attribute middleware events to the real actor; fix rollback mislabel and category enum mismatch\n\n- audit_middleware recorded every mutating golden-path request under the\n  generic \"orchestration-api\" service account, since the Bearer token on\n  Scaffolder-triggered calls is a service credential, not a delegated\n  end-user token. Read the X-Actor-Ref header the frontend now forwards\n  and attribute the event to that actor when present.\n- _audit_action checked \"/promote\" before \"/rollback\", so every rollback\n  (POST /models/{name}/promote-rollback, which contains \"/promote\") was\n  mislabeled \"model.promote\". Check the rollback path first.\n- security.py''s scan-gate event used category=\"security\", which isn''t in\n  the Audit Logs page''s closed category filter (management/authorization/\n  access) and was unfilterable there. Record it as \"authorization\" instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97e1ffbe26452a00da894e3ff638b0e14879593e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/97e1ffbe26452a00da894e3ff638b0e14879593e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/dce7dba326c072a79f50bd2ee2b0e08e0b065be2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/dce7dba326c072a79f50bd2ee2b0e08e0b065be2","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGRjZTdkYmEzMjZjMDcyYTc5ZjUwYmQyZWUyYjBlMDhlMGIwNjViZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4","sha":"0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4"}],"sha":"dce7dba326c072a79f50bd2ee2b0e08e0b065be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dce7dba326c072a79f50bd2ee2b0e08e0b065be2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:16:52Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:16:52Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(portal-assistant): DevEx overhaul — P0.1-P0.4, P1.1-P1.4, P2 partial\n\nBackend half of a full Portal Assistant chat DevEx pass, driven by 4\nmanually-repeated test scenarios throughout, now scripted\n(scripts/test-portal-assistant-scenarios.py, `make\ntest-portal-assistant-scenarios`).\n\nP0 (latency/token cost per round):\n- Condensed schema rendering (summarize_golden_path_schema) replaces the\n  raw JSON Schema injected into the prompt and returned by\n  get_golden_path_schema — ~58% fewer tokens on the largest template.\n- portal_assistant.py''s tool scope narrows from all 33 connected MCP\n  tools (~6.1k tok) to its own 10 read-only golden-path-guide-server\n  tools (~1.5k tok, 75% smaller) — destructive tools were never callable\n  from this read-only surface anyway; the prompt already tells the model\n  their names in plain text.\n- Short-TTL (30s) caching for the Prompt Registry read and per-template\n  schema summary — batches the repeated reads within one conversation''s\n  message burst.\n- ask_user_tool.py: a synthetic, non-MCP tool letting the model surface a\n  fixed-option clarifying question as structured data instead of prose —\n  tool_loop.py''s `local_tools` intercepts a call to it before ever\n  reaching the MCP registry.\n- training_presets.py mirrors the frontend''s own trainingPresets.ts (the\n  Scaffolder form''s auto-fill for known use cases) so the agent doesn''t\n  ask about, or guess differently than, fields the form would silently\n  fill in for the same use case.\n- Prompt rewrite: fills the draft progressively (call\n  propose_golden_path_draft as soon as any business-defining field is\n  known, not only once everything is settled) instead of one big draft\n  at the very end.\n\nP1:\n- tool_loop.py: LoopResult.exhausted flags a round-budget exhaustion\n  that happened mid-flow (model still calling tools, no final answer) —\n  portal_assistant.py now surfaces a clear message for it instead of\n  silence. max_rounds default 5 -> 8.\n- currentFormValues: routers/portal_assistant.py''s ChatScope gains a\n  field for the Scaffolder form''s own live values (frontend half in the\n  sibling commit), injected into the prompt as already-settled.\n- Follow-up suggestions: a separate, single-purpose chat_completion call\n  after a normal reply suggests 2-3 next questions — deliberately not\n  embedded as a trailer in the main reply, so the primary generation\n  stays focused and the suggestion format stays simple/reliable\n  regardless of reply length. Fail-quiet: any error just means no\n  suggestions.\n\nP2:\n- _MAX_HISTORY_MESSAGES caps what''s sent to the model per turn (20) —\n  the frontend resends the full conversation every turn, so this is the\n  backstop against unbounded per-turn cost as a conversation runs long.\n  Only trims the LLM-bound history; session_store still persists every\n  turn for reload/audit.\n\nExplicitly not done (see conversation): thumbs up/down feedback and a\nfull eval suite (no real users yet to generate signal worth analyzing —\nthe scripted scenarios above capture most of the value at a fraction of\nthe cost) and a conversation list (this is a task-completion assistant,\nnot a general chatbot — low value for how it''s actually used).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb762f7c49c699ccdb0c53acb1e278c566975566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/eb762f7c49c699ccdb0c53acb1e278c566975566"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDBhMDcwZGRiMmE3NWU0Y2EwZDAyYmQzOTgwMGE0Yzk0OTRkMDU2YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c","sha":"5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c"}],"sha":"0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/0a070ddb2a75e4ca0d02bd39800a4c9494d056a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:48:15Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:48:15Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"chore: push all","tree":{"sha":"3f65e2beab6b449bc91e899f48df28d70de7d850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/3f65e2beab6b449bc91e899f48df28d70de7d850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDVhMzhiZWZhYmNmZTNhNzFlYjc5NjlmNjM5OTQyMzY0YjdjMWExMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101","sha":"dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101"}],"sha":"5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/5a38befabcfe3a71eb7969f639942364b7c1a11c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:43:17Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:43:17Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(golden-path-guide-server): add registry-lookup tools for picker fields\n\nFor 5 of the 6 golden paths (all but train-track-register), fields like\nmodelName (picking an EXISTING model), collectionName, promptName, and\nhfTokenSecretRef/huggingFaceModelId must reference something that\nalready exists in a registry — not a freely-chosen string.\npropose_golden_path_draft only validates against the JSON schema\n(type/enum/required), so a plausible-looking but invented value still\ncomes back `ok: true, complete: true`; the user only discovers it was\nwrong when the run actually fails.\n\nAdds 5 thin, read-only MCP tools wrapping existing orchestration-api\nendpoints (list_registered_models -> GET /models, list_rag_collections\n-> GET /rag/collections, list_prompts -> GET /prompts, list_secrets ->\nGET /secrets, search_huggingface_models -> GET /llm-deploy/search-models)\n— no new backend query logic, these already back the manual form''s own\npicker dropdowns.\n\nUpdated the \"mlops\" persona prompt (routers/prompts.py) to require\ncalling the matching lookup tool before filling any of these fields, and\nto ask the user instead of guessing when nothing in the result is a\nreasonable match. Drafted as prompt version 5 on the local MLflow\nregistry (POST /prompts) — not yet activated, same as version 3/4\nearlier this session; activating writes to the live registry and is\nblocked by this session''s own permission policy as a \"production\ndeploy\":\n  curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8000/prompts/mlops/activate \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d ''{\"version\":\"5\",\"environment\":\"production\"}''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a148e3ab7fff15e900be90a190f41a1ad9f38b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/a148e3ab7fff15e900be90a190f41a1ad9f38b0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGRiYWNkNDhjZmQ3N2FjNDg3YzkzYTU0OWNjNjZlNGMxY2JiZGYxMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71","sha":"f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71"}],"sha":"dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dbacd48cfd77ac487c93a549cc66e4c1cbbdf101"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:42:30Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:42:30Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix(portal-assistant): stop tracking Golden Path drafts in the chat session store\n\nBackend half of the draft-store consolidation plan (frontend repo''s Node\nDraftService/DraftStore becomes the single source of truth). Python''s\nchat_session_store now persists message history only.\n\n- IChatSessionStore/ChatSession/ChatDraft (adapters/ai_platform/interfaces.py):\n  dropped the draft field and merge_draft method entirely.\n- chat_session_store.py: removed merge_draft(); get() no longer returns\n  draft. The draft_json SQL column is left in place unused rather than\n  migrated away — CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS means an existing DB file\n  just keeps an inert column.\n- portal_assistant.py: on_tool_call no longer merges form_data before\n  emitting the template_draft event — it forwards the tool''s raw,\n  current-turn-only result (accumulation across turns is the Node\n  DraftService''s job now). GET /sessions/{id} no longer returns a draft\n  key at all — that''s GET /drafts/by-session/{id} on the frontend''s Node\n  plugin, which the drawer already calls and treats as authoritative.\n- golden_paths.py: updated validate_golden_path_draft''s docstring —\n  session-restore revalidation was a second caller here, now moved to\n  the Node DraftService.\n\nVerified live: GET /sessions/{id} confirmed returning exactly\n{\"messages\": [...]} via curl against the running dev server.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03c2453e79a1a1f0ef7df8261ac8357a76fc0c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/03c2453e79a1a1f0ef7df8261ac8357a76fc0c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGY5NzM1MWNmZGFmMjFjMTFjMWRhYjEwNTNhYjI2MDk0ZTM2NmRlNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6","sha":"d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6"}],"sha":"f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/f97351cfdaf21c11c1dab1053ab26094e366de71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:41:40Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:41:40Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(llm-gateway): stream tool_loop''s model calls for live \"thinking\" progress\n\nAdds ILLMGatewayAdapter.chat_completion_stream (LiteLLMGatewayAdapter\nimplementation: an async SSE client against LiteLLM''s /chat/completions,\nthe first async httpx use in this adapter) and switches\ntool_loop.run_tool_loop to call it instead of the blocking\nchat_completion, with a new optional on_delta hook streaming\nreasoning/content fragments as the model produces them.\n\nWithout this, portal_assistant.py''s drawer had nothing to show but a\nstatic \"Thinking…\" for the 15-45s a reasoning model can take across\nseveral tool rounds — on_delta is what lets it stream live reasoning/\ncontent chunks instead. chat.py doesn''t pass on_delta and reads the same\nLoopResult.usage/cost_usd shape as before, so it needed no logic changes,\nonly its tests'' mocks (chat_completion → chat_completion_stream, via the\nnew tests/conftest.py `make_stream` helper both routers'' tests now share).\n\ncore/config.py: added Settings.portal_assistant_model (default\nclaude-sonnet-5) — the LiteLLM model_list entry portal_assistant.py''s\nchat loop calls, overridable to test the tool-calling flow without\nspending Anthropic credit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87cd6ac157a68ada58e843490c6c24345c0c6def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/87cd6ac157a68ada58e843490c6c24345c0c6def"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGQyYmFkNzdkYTgxMGYwODIxZjQwNzBiZjMwMGY5ZGYyOWNlZGVkYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c","sha":"7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c"}],"sha":"d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/d2bad77da810f0821f4070bf300f9df29cededa6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:24:40Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:24:40Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix(portal-assistant): stop the mlops persona from silently defaulting business-defining fields\n\nThe system prompt told the agent to fill every value it \"can infer\"\nfrom the conversation, which in practice meant copying a Golden Path\nschema''s own `default:` (e.g. \"telco-fraud-detection\") whenever the\nuser''s request was generic (\"run the train-track-register form for\nme\"). Since propose_golden_path_draft''s `missing` list only flags\nfields with no value at all, a silently-defaulted field never came\nback as missing, so the agent never asked — every generic request\nproduced the same telco-fraud-detection draft regardless of what the\nuser actually wanted to build.\n\nRewrites the \"mlops\" persona to split a template''s schema fields into\nbusiness-defining (business domain, use case, architecture, algorithm\nfamily, training mode, data source — anything that changes what gets\nbuilt) vs boilerplate (free-text labels, security/governance toggles).\nBoilerplate can still be defaulted freely; for business-defining\nfields, the agent must now ask the user to choose among the schema''s\noneOf/enum options (by title) whenever the conversation doesn''t\nspecify or clearly imply one, instead of drafting from whichever value\nthe schema happens to default to.\n\nCompanion to the frontend''s templates/*/template.yaml change removing\nthe schema-level `default:` from these same fields — that closes the\ngap structurally (no default left to copy); this prompt rewrite is the\nbehavioral half for templates that still carry one, or for a fresh\nMLflow seed that hasn''t picked up this commit''s default yet.\n\nDrafted as prompt version 3 on the local MLflow Prompt Registry\n(POST /prompts) but not yet activated — activating writes to the live\nregistry and was blocked by the session''s own permission policy as a\n\"production deploy\"; run\n  curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8000/prompts/mlops/activate \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d ''{\"version\":\"3\",\"environment\":\"production\"}''\nto make it live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"925cb76519f81c9239d755a9c7974a417b68f02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/925cb76519f81c9239d755a9c7974a417b68f02c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDdmN2VmMmI2MjNiNWQ5ODQ4YjRiODhmYjhiY2ZlMWU4MzhlMTE3MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/01be69f0143a6ffd6389caf3c1f99b00c45ba324","sha":"01be69f0143a6ffd6389caf3c1f99b00c45ba324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/01be69f0143a6ffd6389caf3c1f99b00c45ba324"}],"sha":"7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/7f7ef2b623b5d9848b4b88fb8bcfe1e838e1172c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/01be69f0143a6ffd6389caf3c1f99b00c45ba324/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:58:22Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:58:22Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(portal-assistant): agent fills Golden Path template drafts\n\nLet the Portal Assistant fill a Golden Path template''s form from a\nnatural-language request, so a non-technical user only reviews and\nsubmits.\n\n- catalog_client.get_golden_path_schema + GET /golden-paths/{name}/schema\n  expose the raw spec.parameters JSON schema (types/enums/branching),\n  which the flattened detail endpoint loses.\n- golden-path-guide-server gains get_golden_path_schema and\n  propose_golden_path_draft (validates values against the live schema).\n- tool_loop.run_tool_loop: shared bounded tool loop for chat.py and\n  portal_assistant.py (both were hard-capped at one tool call per turn).\n- portal_assistant streams a template_draft event per proposal and\n  persists message history + draft per session_id.\n- IChatSessionStore + SqliteChatSessionStore (24h TTL) back the session;\n  GET/DELETE /sessions/{id} restore/clear it.\n- releasebinding mounts a writable /app/.state volume so the SQLite state\n  survives a pod restart.\n\nAlso carries a pre-existing train.py fix (skops trusted types).","tree":{"sha":"3f5ab1e7fb4c13d8ae32869de136394357b8a7d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/3f5ab1e7fb4c13d8ae32869de136394357b8a7d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/01be69f0143a6ffd6389caf3c1f99b00c45ba324","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/