ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/33203ec7054591b50417564523f79834140a55ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:37:40Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:37:40Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor: trim comments per commenting-standards skill\n\nApplies the repo''s Why-over-What/≤1-sentence inline-comment rule across\nadapters/, services/orchestration-api/, agents/, and scripts/: cuts verbose\nmulti-sentence comments down to their one load-bearing clause, fixes stale\nreferences (capture-delivery-insights-runs.sh still pointed at the deleted\nrouters/mock_observer.py), and promotes two undocumented method behaviors\nin openchoreo_inference_adapter.py into proper docstrings instead of\nleaving them as inline prose. No logic changes — comment-only pass, most\nfiles needed no changes at all (already compliant).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed0bc3ad9749b53f182f50dd21cb959ecade1db3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/ed0bc3ad9749b53f182f50dd21cb959ecade1db3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/33203ec7054591b50417564523f79834140a55ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c