epos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dca134e90d573e3f788c28753476d92b8a1c76cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:50:09Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:50:09Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(delivery-insights): make query_deployments fully automatic via event-driven persistence\n\nquery_deployments read from a static JSON snapshot\n(mock_data/delivery_insights_runs.json) that a human had to regenerate by\nhand via scripts/capture-delivery-insights-runs.sh after triggering Golden\nPaths. Replace that for the real adapter with a new SqliteDeploymentEventStore,\nwritten at the 5 real completion/deploy points that already emit DORA\nPrometheus metrics: training completion (models.py''s get_training_status),\nmodel promote/rollback (models.py), and rag-index/prompt activate\n(rag.py/prompts.py). \"Setup Model Monitoring\" is excluded — it registers a\nperiodic CronWorkflow, not a discrete deploy event, and its real backend\nraises NotImplementedError today.\n\nMockDeliveryObserverAdapter is unchanged — it keeps reading the captured-JSON\nfile for offline demo data, a separate concern from making the *real* adapter\nneed no manual step.\n\nAlso fixes a latent correctness gap while adding the store: the previous\ndesign''s SQL range query would have compared naive vs UTC-aware ISO\ntimestamp strings lexicographically; list_events instead parses and filters\nin Python, reusing _captured_runs.py''s existing parse_iso helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a1e09abf23f7b751276443a1e0791fc23e494a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/5a1e09abf23f7b751276443a1e0791fc23e494a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/dca134e90d573e3f788c28753476d92b8a1c76cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/dca134e90d573e3f788c28753476d92b8a1c76cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGRjYTEzNGU5MGQ1NzNlM2Y3ODhjMjg3NTM0NzZkOTJiOGExYzc2Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/6d84a46fc8c81813e1109c986d50854ec2ab583e","sha":"6d84a46fc8c81813e1109c986d50854ec2ab583e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/6d84a46fc8c81813e1109c986d50854ec2ab583e"}],"sha":"dca134e90d573e3f788c28753476d92b8a1c76cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/dca134e90d573e3f788c28753476d92b8a1c76cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/6d84a46fc8c81813e1109c986d50854ec2ab583e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:32:57Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:32:57Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor(delivery-insights): replace embedded mock DORA logic with Adapter Pattern, add ML/LLM dimensions\n\nrouters/mock_observer.py hardcoded its synthetic/captured-JSON DORA\ngenerator directly in the router, violating this repo''s own Adapter\nPattern convention and leaving no seam for a real backend. Extract it\nbehind a new IDeliveryObserverAdapter interface (MockDeliveryObserverAdapter\nkeeps today''s behavior; PrometheusDeliveryObserverAdapter queries\nOpenChoreo''s real in-cluster Prometheus — already populated by\ndora_metrics.py from real gate checks, deploys, and drift-driven\nrecoveries in routers/models.py|rag.py|prompts.py — plus MLflow for\ncontinuous drift scores), selected via adapters/factory.py like every\nother adapter in this repo.\n\nAlso widens the DORA contract with ML/LLM dimensions (changeType,\nevalScore/driftScore, semanticType, recoveryStrategy, modelVersion, ...)\nper docs/plan-delivery-insgiths-dora-mlops.md, whose design is now\nimplemented in code, so the plan doc is removed.\n\nRouter renamed mock_observer.py -> delivery_insights.py to match; the\nAPI contract/URL the frontend calls is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4df29ac34eb97d2287f597251498f6d749c7b881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/4df29ac34eb97d2287f597251498f6d749c7b881"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/6d84a46fc8c81813e1109c986d50854ec2ab583e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delive