ifests it did before\n(now at their new paths), just reordered so infra/bootstrap/''s ClusterRole\nand platform-shared/''s ClusterComponentType apply before the namespaced\nproject resources that depend on them — it does NOT switch to a blanket\n`apply -R -f infra/openchoreo/platform-shared/`, since that would start\napplying manifests (e.g. clustercomponenttype-inference-service.yaml, the\ntelco-fraud-detection project) that this repeatable script never touched;\nthose remain one-time steps in README.md''s manual bootstrap section.\n\nVerified every moved manifest still reconciles identically against the\nlive k3d cluster (`kubectl apply --dry-run=server -R`), and `make check`\npasses (472 tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"891bbda3aa2d4bafd8a7729a20ef17133d0ea39a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/891bbda3aa2d4bafd8a7729a20ef17133d0ea39a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/30f2e1f07aff8353c1b5d20e45e5c5ec3d03e8af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_