_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/4a970a88923e4e92098001578cc75dcb25d4514d","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDRhOTcwYTg4OTIzZTRlOTIwOTgwMDE1NzhjYzc1ZGNiMjVkNDUxNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/b4cad56ee0ea89a19961639a613fb77d4f45cc99","sha":"b4cad56ee0ea89a19961639a613fb77d4f45cc99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/b4cad56ee0ea89a19961639a613fb77d4f45cc99"}],"sha":"4a970a88923e4e92098001578cc75dcb25d4514d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/4a970a88923e4e92098001578cc75dcb25d4514d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/b4cad56ee0ea89a19961639a613fb77d4f45cc99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:23:24Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:23:24Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: redesign container topology onto a real 3-node k3d cluster\n\nReplaces docker-compose with a 3-node k3d cluster matching the target\narchitecture diagram: master runs OpenChoreo''s control plane (unchanged),\nworker1 (\"data plane portal\") runs orchestration-api + adapters + the MCP\nservers as pinned OpenChoreo Components, and worker2 hosts both the\nworkflow plane (Argo training pods) and the AI Platform zone\n(MLflow/Qdrant/MinIO/LiteLLM/Feast) as plain k8s manifests outside\nOpenChoreo. Node placement is enforced via node labels/taints plus a new\n`pinned-service` ClusterComponentType (the built-in \"service\" type has no\nnodeSelector/tolerations field) and each Component''s\nReleaseBinding.componentTypeEnvironmentConfigs — Component.spec.parameters\nlooked like the right place but is never actually read at render time,\nconfirmed empirically against the live cluster.\n\nMinIO''s storage is the repo''s own ./data directory (docker cp''d onto\nworker2), so every dataset folder shows up as a browsable bucket instead of\nstarting empty. orchestration-api/kserve adapters now try\nload_incluster_config() before falling back to a local kubeconfig, since\nthey run as real in-cluster pods now instead of an external docker-compose\ncontainer reaching in via host.docker.internal.\n\nVerified with a full live Golden Path #1 run (train -> track -> register)\nagainst the new topology, plus make check (472 tests).\n\nscripts/setup-3node-infra.sh is the one idempotent entry point that stands\nthe whole thing up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53766441a2cd28fc1d69e432c6b252a733dd1a8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/53766441a2cd28fc1d69e432c6b252a733dd1a8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-del