_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/4a3b860cb23dc4d3fe27663a394e638575a95ede/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:08:12Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:08:12Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: LLM serving pre-flight validation, GPU sizing, and RBAC guardrails\n\nBackend P0 slice of the \"Serve LLM (Self-hosted)\" wizard redesign — the\nfail-fast-at-form-time pieces the plan''s section 5 calls out, built on top\nof the existing routers/llm_serving.py golden path:\n\n- GET /llm-deploy/validate-model — HuggingFace Hub model existence/gated/\n  architecture lookup (new IHuggingFaceHubAdapter, real httpx-based\n  adapter + mock, USE_MOCK_HUGGINGFACE-gated like every other adapter).\n- GET /llm-deploy/gpu-recommendation — VRAM estimator (weights + KV cache)\n  and cheapest-fitting gpuType/gpuCount suggestion\n  (llm_serving/gpu_sizing.py), reusable standalone by the wizard''s\n  Compute & Runtime step.\n- GET /llm-deploy/rollout-eligibility — whether a prior deploy exists for\n  a model_name, so the wizard can disable canary/ab/blue-green before\n  submit instead of failing at POST /llm-deploy/prepare (which already\n  enforced this, just too late for the form to react to).\n- POST /llm-deploy/prepare gains `environment` (dev/staging/prod) and\n  `hf_token_secret_ref` (a K8s Secret name, never a plaintext token — see\n  PrepareLlmDeployRequest''s docstring). Two guardrails enforced\n  server-side, not just hidden in the UI: release_strategy=\"instant\" now\n  requires the \"llm-ops-admin\" role (auth.thunder.user_has_role) and is\n  rejected outright for any environment other than \"dev\" — neither real\n  backend this repo has today (KServeAdapter''s hardcoded \"-dev-\"\n  namespace, OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter''s deploy_llm_model\n  NotImplementedError) can actually honor an instant deploy to\n  staging/prod, so that combination fails at form-time instead of\n  silently deploying to the wrong place.\n- hf_token_secret_ref threads through to both the rendered manifest\n  (templates/llm_inference_service.yaml.j2) and the real instant-deploy\n  path (KServeAdapter.deploy_llm_model, now injecting a secretKeyRef env\n  var) — the token itself never passes through this API or a PR diff.\n\nDeferred (P1+ in the redesign plan, not in this slice): estimate-gpu-cost,\nsmoke-test-llm, catalog:register, autoscaling fields, RepoUrlPicker (a\nBackstage-side field, no backend action needed). All are frontend-facing\nScaffolder work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cd44d1ac2d11d6554bc80ac0cb03417a7ffdf0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/3cd44d1ac2d11d6554bc80ac0cb03417a7ffdf0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/4a3b860cb23dc4d3fe27663a394e638575a95ede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/4a3b860cb23dc4d3fe27663a394e638575a95ede","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDRhM2I4NjBjYjIzZGM0ZDNmZTI3NjYzYTM5NGU2Mzg1NzVhOTVlZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c","sha":"c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c"}],"sha":"4a3b860cb23dc4d3fe27663a394e638575a95ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/4a3b860cb23dc4d3fe27663a394e638575a95ede"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:45:18Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:45:18Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: add prompt/RAG/LLM-model name+version picker endpoints\n\nAdds the 5 GET endpoints the Portal''s LLMOps golden path templates need\nfor their pickers (promptNamePicker, promptVersionPicker,\nragCollectionPicker, ragIndexVersionPicker, llmModelPicker):\n\n- GET /prompts, /prompts/{name}/versions\n- GET /rag/collections, /rag/collections/{name}/versions\n- GET /llm-models\n\nGET /prompts previously returned the full active-prompt-detail list\n(consumed only by observability-server''s get_active_prompt_version); that\nconsumer now calls a dedicated GET /prompts/{name}/active instead, freeing\nup the bare path for the {names: [...]} contract the frontend already\nexpects. routers/rag.py''s new /rag/collections routes are declared ahead\nof the existing /{collection} catch-all to avoid FastAPI matching the\nstatic path to the dynamic one first.\n\nAlso fixes a real bug in MlflowPromptRegistryAdapter.list_versions: it\nassumed get_prompt_version always returns None for a missing version, but\nMLflow raises MlflowException instead when the prompt name itself was\nnever registered, which crashed the new versions endpoint for any\nnot-yet-drafted persona.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dd0ef4ee653779721a6a1e63ebfbcc87e24c369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/2dd0ef4ee653779721a6a1e63ebfbcc87e24c369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGM4N2Q3YTUyZTBmNTc5MWJhMGZmYTU3NjkyYTFjZWJlZjlmY2Q2MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f","sha":"34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f"}],"sha":"c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/c87d7a52e0f5791ba0ffa57692a1cebef9fcd61c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:44:16Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:44:16Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: OpenChoreo promotion pipeline, prediction logging, real MLflow artifact URIs\n\n- IPromotionAdapter/OpenChoreoPromotionAdapter (+ MockPromotionAdapter):\n  staging/prod promotion via OpenChoreo''s DeploymentPipeline/\n  ProjectReleaseBinding, replacing the never-installed Kargo pipeline.\n  observability-server''s get_promotion_status is real now instead of\n  mock data, calling orchestration-api''s new GET\n  /models/{name}/promotion-status.\n- IPredictionLogAdapter/SqlitePredictionLogAdapter: logs individual\n  predict-time (input, output) pairs for the future data-drift-monitoring\n  Golden Path, exposed via POST /models/{name}/predictions/log.\n- IModelRegistryAdapter.get_model_artifact_uri: resolves a real s3://\n  artifact URI KServe''s storage-initializer can read directly. Needed\n  because mlflow-artifacts now lands in real MinIO storage\n  (docker-compose.yml''s mlflow service, --no-serve-artifacts +\n  --default-artifact-root) instead of MLflow''s local-filesystem default,\n  which InstantStrategy''s deploy path couldn''t hand to KServe at all.\n- scripts/watch-and-apply-workload.sh + workload.yaml.j2: polls for and\n  applies rendered PR-gated deploy manifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee487290b5ec32b9039fecc0896b8d9446b1f896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/ee487290b5ec32b9039fecc0896b8d9446b1f896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDM0YjZiZDZiOGEzMDRjZmM0NWI0MDgzNDM3NDBjYmEwZTA0YmZjN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff","sha":"da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff"}],"sha":"34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/34b6bd6b8a304cfc45b408343740cba0e04bfc7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:17:12Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:17:12Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix: two real KServe RawDeployment DNS/label-length bugs blocking the serving InferenceService\n\nBoth found and fixed live on the k3d cluster while investigating why\ntelco-fraud-detection''s InferenceService stayed Ready=False after the\nrename:\n\n1. inferenceservice-config''s ingress.domainTemplate defaulted to\n   \"{{ .Name }}-{{ .Namespace }}.{{ .IngressDomain }}\" — hyphenating Name\n   and Namespace into a single DNS label instead of separating them with\n   a dot. Combined with OpenChoreo''s long auto-generated dataplane\n   namespace (dp-default-<project>-<environment>-<hash>), this exceeded\n   the 63-character RFC 1035 label cap regardless of naming — the fixed\n   structural overhead alone already exceeds 63 for \"development\".\n   Real, reproduced error: \"failed creating host name: ... must be no\n   more than 63 characters\". Fixed by patching the template to\n   \"{{ .Name }}.{{ .Namespace }}.{{ .IngressDomain }}\" (kubectl patch +\n   controller-manager restart) — this is a cluster-wide KServe config fix,\n   not specific to this Project, so it unblocks every future\n   OpenChoreo-managed InferenceService in \"development\", not just this one.\n2. With that fixed, a second, different 63-*byte* limit surfaced: the raw\n   Deployment mode predictor Service''s `isvc.<name>-predictor` label value\n   (a Kubernetes label value limit, not a DNS hostname one) still\n   overflowed with the `telco-fraud-detection-serving` Component name.\n   This one *is* naming-sensitive — renamed the Component (and its sibling\n   `telco-fraud-detection-training`) to bare `serving`/`training`: the\n   Project already carries the full \"telco-fraud-detection\" name, and only\n   `<component>-<environment>-<hash>` participates in that label, not the\n   project name. Applied for real (new Component/Workload, deleted the\n   old, longer-named ones — cascade-cleaned their old\n   dataplane-namespace resources).\n\nConfirmed both are actually fixed, not just silenced: the new\n`serving-development-<hash>` InferenceService''s predictor pod now reaches\nInit (previously failed before ever creating a Deployment/Service at all)\nand fails at exactly one place — the already-documented, unrelated\n`models:/<name>/<version>` storage-initializer gap (OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter''s\nown module docstring). Updated that docstring, the adapter''s real\n`component` default (\"serving\", not \"telco-fraud-detection-serving\" — a\nfunctional change, this is what the adapter targets at runtime), and\nadapters/factory.py''s comment to match. Not yet reflected in any\nHelm-templated config source — these are direct kubectl patches against\nthe live cluster, same caveat as this session''s other live-cluster fixes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9f3175845afa63ef768ca1143ae5c95ab682da8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/e9f3175845afa63ef768ca1143ae5c95ab682da8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGRhNTJlN2MzNTA1MjI1MWVmYzcxOGYzZWMzMDUwYTRkMWZlM2U2ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49","sha":"9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49"}],"sha":"da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/da52e7c35052251efc718f3ec3050a4d1fe3e6ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:02:37Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:02:37Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor: apply fraud-detection -> telco-fraud-detection identifier rename\n\nFollow-up to 0ad5c47 — that commit only captured the directory rename\n(git mv), not the actual identifier edits inside the renamed files (a\nmistake in how I staged it: an invalid pathspec in the same `git add`\ninvocation aborted before it reached these files). This commit has the\nreal content: every Project/Component/Workload name, label, and owner\nreference changed from fraud-detection to telco-fraud-detection inside\ninfra/openchoreo/telco-fraud-detection/, plus the functional\nOpenChoreoInferenceAdapter default parameters and every other stale\nfraud-detection identifier/path reference described in 0ad5c47''s message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14385591c99170501ac42db78aebcafa55cb2af3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/14385591c99170501ac42db78aebcafa55cb2af3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDkzODI3ODdkMWJkMWIyNjMzNWY0MDU0YTRhODZlZjkzZmI3N2ZjNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc","sha":"0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc"}],"sha":"9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9382787d1bd1b26335f4054a4a86ef93fb77fc49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:01:47Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:01:47Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor: rename OpenChoreo demo project fraud-detection -> telco-fraud-detection\n\nRenamed at the user''s request: infra/openchoreo/fraud-detection/ ->\ninfra/openchoreo/telco-fraud-detection/, and every Project/Component/\nWorkload identifier inside it (Project \"fraud-detection\" ->\n\"telco-fraud-detection\", Components/Workloads/ProjectReleaseBinding\nlikewise). Deliberately out of scope, per explicit decision: the MLflow\nmodel name (\"fraud-detection-demo\") and the dataset directory\n(data/classification-telco-fraud-detection/) — both stay as-is.\n\nApplied for real on the k3d cluster: new Project + ProjectReleaseBinding\n(same reconciler-bug workaround as \"platform\"), new Component/Workload\npair for both training and serving, confirmed the reconciler picked them\nup (ReleaseBinding Ready=True, a new InferenceService rendered in a fresh\ndataplane namespace) — then deleted the old \"fraud-detection\" Project,\nwhich cascaded and cleaned up its Component/Workload/ReleaseBinding/\ndataplane namespace/InferenceService automatically.\n\nUpdated OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter''s defaults (project/component names —\nthis is the functional part, not just a comment: the adapter would have\npointed at a Component that no longer exists otherwise) and every stale\nfraud-detection path/identifier reference in adapters/factory.py,\nadapters/openchoreo_workflow_adapter.py, and\ntests/test_openchoreo_inference_adapter.py.\n\nFound a second real gap while renaming, unrelated to and not caused by\nthis rename: KServe derives the predictor''s hostname as a single DNS\nlabel combining `<isvc-name>-predictor-<dataplane-namespace>`, capped at\n63 characters — the longer name pushes this over the limit\n(ReconcileFailed: \"must be no more than 63 characters\"). Not fixed here:\nserving was already non-functional before this rename (the models:/ URI\nscheme gap documented in OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter''s module docstring),\nso this doesn''t change what works today, only how it fails. Documented\nin the adapter''s class docstring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6690d78df3b2a4d1552007f33e829ab34cab4132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/6690d78df3b2a4d1552007f33e829ab34cab4132"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDBhZDVjNDc0OWUxMzI1YTA2YmI1MTBkNGY3M2Q4MGY4ZDIzOWE0ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538","sha":"c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538"}],"sha":"0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/0ad5c4749e1325a06bb510d4f73d80f8d239a4fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:57:13Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:57:13Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: OpenChoreo migration Phase 4 — ClusterComponentType for InferenceService + OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter\n\nImplements the \"openchoreo\" branch of factory.py''s get_kserve_adapter()\n(previously NotImplementedError). New ClusterComponentType\n\"proxy/inference-service\" (modeled on the real \"service\" ComponentType,\n`kubectl get clustercomponenttype service -o yaml`) renders a real\nserving.kserve.io/v1beta1 InferenceService; OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter\npatches the pre-existing fraud-detection-serving Workload''s container.image\n(repurposed as the model''s storageUri) via CustomObjectsApi, letting\nOpenChoreo''s own reconciler generate/apply the InferenceService — same\n\"patch, don''t create the CR directly\" shape the migration doc asked for.\n\nVerified for real against the k3d cluster, not just written and assumed:\n\n- workloadType had to be \"proxy\", not \"deployment\" — the CRD schema\n  requires resources[].id to match workloadType for every other value\n  (confirmed via a real rejected `kubectl apply --dry-run=server`);\n  \"proxy\" is the one documented exception, exactly for a primary resource\n  that isn''t literally a Deployment/StatefulSet/CronJob/Job.\n- Applying component-serving.yaml/workload-serving.yaml needed the same\n  Project→ProjectReleaseBinding workaround Phase 1 needed for \"platform\" —\n  a real, reproduced instance of the reconciler bug the migration doc\n  already documents, not a new one. New:\n  infra/openchoreo/fraud-detection/projectreleasebinding-development.yaml.\n- The rendered InferenceService then failed to apply at all: OpenChoreo''s\n  dataplane reconciler agent (system:serviceaccount:openchoreo-data-plane:\n  cluster-agent-dataplane) had zero RBAC for serving.kserve.io — unsurprising\n  in hindsight (its ClusterRole predates Phase 3''s KServe install by this\n  same session) but a real blocker, not a hypothetical one. Fixed via a\n  separate ClusterRole/ClusterRoleBinding (not a patch to the Helm-managed\n  one, so a future `helm upgrade` doesn''t silently drop it):\n  infra/openchoreo/platform/clusterrole-dataplane-kserve.yaml.\n- With RBAC fixed, the InferenceService got created by the reconciler for\n  real (`fraud-detection-serving-development-a1dd8967`, confirmed via\n  `kubectl get inferenceservice -n\n  dp-default-fraud-detecti-development-d0e7d311` — note the dataplane\n  namespace name doesn''t match any guessable pattern, confirming the\n  migration doc''s explicit warning not to hardcode it;\n  OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter.get_inference_status() finds it by label\n  selector instead).\n- KServe then rejected the InferenceService''s runtime twice more before\n  matching one, both fixed by trial against the real cluster rather than\n  guessed: modelFormat needed an explicit version (\"2\", matching\n  kserve-mlserver''s supportedModelFormats), and protocolVersion needed to\n  be \"v2\" explicitly (kserve-mlserver only implements v2).\n\n**Real, unresolved gap surfaced by this verification, documented in\nOpenChoreoInferenceAdapter''s module docstring, not fixed here**: KServe''s\nstorage-initializer has no support for the \"models:/<name>/<version>\" URI\nscheme this repo''s storage_uri convention has always used\n(adapters/kserve_adapter.py, adapters/deploy_strategies.py,\nrouters/models.py) — confirmed via a raw, non-OpenChoreo InferenceService\nwith the identical storageUri: \"Cannot recognize storage type for\nmodels:/...\". This predates and is independent of the OpenChoreo\nmigration; it just had no real KServe control-plane to surface against\nuntil this session''s Phase 3. Fixing it means deciding how MLflow''s\nartifact store becomes reachable by KServe (e.g. pointing MLflow''s\n--artifacts-destination at the existing MinIO service) — a real decision\noutside this adapter''s scope, not made tonight.\n\ndeploy_llm_model() raises NotImplementedError (GPU/vLLM explicitly out of\nthis phase''s real-verification scope per the migration doc) — added only\nso the OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter | KServeAdapter | MockInferenceAdapter\nunion routers/llm_serving.py depends on stays structurally valid\n(pyright caught this as a real error before it shipped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d2d9566e0f018792bb10e7b48642de8f0acce7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/1d2d9566e0f018792bb10e7b48642de8f0acce7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGMyYjg5OWYyMWMwNjk3NTYwZmU0NTE0YWJjZmZkMjA5ODdlNmE1Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f","sha":"89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f"}],"sha":"c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/c2b899f21c0697560fe4514abcffd20987e6a538"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:39:29Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:39:29Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: OpenChoreo migration Phase 3 — install real KServe control-plane (CPU-only)\n\nInstalled for real on the k3d cluster (k3d-openchoreo-quick-start),\nverified end to end — not just \"should work\":\n\nkubectl apply --server-side -f kserve-crds.yaml   # CRDs first, own step:\n                                                    # kubectl apply (non\n                                                    # server-side) on the\n                                                    # combined kserve.yaml\n                                                    # hits a real 262144-byte\n                                                    # last-applied-config\n                                                    # annotation limit on 3\n                                                    # of the CRDs\nkubectl create namespace kserve\nkubectl apply --server-side -f kserve.yaml         # controller/RBAC/webhooks\nkubectl apply --server-side -f kserve-cluster-resources.yaml  # ClusterServingRuntimes\nkubectl patch configmap inferenceservice-config -n kserve --type merge \\\n  -p ''{\"data\":{\"deploy\":\"{\\n  \\\"defaultDeploymentMode\\\": \\\"Standard\\\"\\n}\\n\"}}''\nkubectl rollout restart deployment/kserve-controller-manager -n kserve\n\nAll 3 manifests are the official v0.20.0 release assets\n(github.com/kserve/kserve/releases/tag/v0.20.0) — no local copy kept in\nthis repo, same as this repo doesn''t vendor Argo/Thunder/OpenChoreo''s own\ninstall manifests either.\n\n\"Standard\" (KServe''s current name for what used to be called\nRawDeployment) was the only viable mode — this cluster has cert-manager\nbut no istio/knative-serving, matching the migration doc''s own\ninstruction. Confirmed the ConfigMap change actually took effect, not just\nassumed it: infra/kserve/test-inferenceservice-cpu.yaml (a plain\nsklearn-iris InferenceService, KServe''s own getting-started example model)\nreconciled into a real Deployment/pod (not a Knative Service, which would\nerror immediately — no Knative CRDs installed), reached Ready=True, and a\nreal predict call through it returned {\"predictions\":[1,1]}. No GPU\nresource requested anywhere, per the migration doc''s explicit \"không test\nGPU\" instruction.\n\nLeft running as the standing verification artifact (100m/256Mi request,\nnegligible).\n\nNot done, deliberately (Phase 0 restoring infra/openchoreo/README.md was\nexplicitly descoped by the user for this pass): the install commands above\nhave nowhere else to live in-repo, so they''re recorded here instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6701cac8f866237d77518bd440f0e30e10c44890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/6701cac8f866237d77518bd440f0e30e10c44890"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDg5YzEyNjUyNDhkOTA0YzYwYjAzYzYyZjJjNWExODA1NDczOTQwMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25","sha":"3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25"}],"sha":"89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/89c1265248d904c60b03c62f2c5a18054739400f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:26:43Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:26:43Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: OpenChoreo migration Phase 2 — OpenChoreoWorkflowAdapter for Golden Path #1\n\nImplements the \"openchoreo\" branch of factory.py''s get_workflow_adapter()\n(previously NotImplementedError). REST shape confirmed against\nopenchoreo-workflows-backend''s GenericWorkflowService.ts and verified with a\nreal end-to-end trigger on the k3d cluster: POST /workflowruns -> real Argo\nWorkflow in an auto-created workflows-<namespace> execution namespace ->\nreal train.py run -> real MLflow registration (fraud-detection-phase2-test,\ncleaned up after verifying).\n\nInfra prerequisites this actually needed, discovered by using the real\ncluster instead of assuming:\n- openchoreo-api-config''s jwks_url pointed at the external-only\n  thunder.openchoreo.localhost gateway hostname, unreachable from inside\n  the cluster (CoreDNS has no route for it) — every bearer-token call was\n  failing 401 with \"Failed to refresh JWKS cache\" in openchoreo-api''s own\n  logs, for any caller, not just this adapter. Repointed jwks_url at\n  thunder-service.thunder.svc.cluster.local:8090 (issuer left alone — it\n  must keep matching tokens'' real iss claim).\n- New ClusterAuthzRole/ClusterAuthzRoleBinding (workflow-trigger) granting\n  the pre-existing \"openchoreo-system-app\" service client (Thunder''s\n  /applications admin API is still unreachable this session, so a\n  dedicated client couldn''t be registered) the narrow action set this\n  adapter needs: namespace:view, workflow:view, clusterworkflow:view,\n  workflowrun:view/create.\n- Argo''s workflowTemplateRef can''t resolve a namespace-scoped\n  WorkflowTemplate (train-register-template.yaml, \"legacy\" mode) from the\n  workflows-<namespace> execution namespace OpenChoreo runs every\n  WorkflowRun in — only a cluster-scoped ClusterWorkflowTemplate. Duplicated\n  as train-register-cluster-template.yaml for \"openchoreo\" mode only;\n  \"legacy\" mode''s file is untouched. Also swapped its serviceAccountName\n  from train-register-workflow (only exists in \"default\") to workflow-sa\n  (auto-provisioned by the workflow-plane controller in every execution\n  namespace, confirmed via `kubectl get sa,role -n workflows-default`).\n\nAlso verified, and fixed on the way, two claims this repo''s own comments\nmade that turned out false when actually checked against the cluster:\n- component-training.yaml''s componentType.name was previously \"guessed\n  fixed\" to a value that fails validation; the compound\n  \"<workloadType>/<name>\" form (cronjob/scheduled-task) is the one the\n  CRD''s schema actually accepts.\n- Neither that Component nor a fraud-detection Project has ever actually\n  been applied — \"the live cluster''s CronJob runs *_/3 * * * *\" was never\n  true. create_cron_workflow() stays NotImplementedError; its docstring now\n  explains the real blocker (environmentConfigs.schedule needs a\n  ReleaseBinding, which needs its own real Project first — out of scope\n  here) instead of the previous guess.\n\nStatus mapping (Pending/Running/Succeeded/Failed) mirrors\nGenericWorkflowService.ts''s deriveWorkflowRunStatus() condition-priority\norder, translated to ArgoAdapter''s phase vocabulary so\nrouters/models.py''s `phase in (\"Succeeded\", \"Failed\")` check needs no\nchanges. ClusterWorkflow parameter names are camelCase (CEL identifiers\ncan''t contain hyphens); trigger_workflow() translates the hyphenated\nargument names every caller already builds, so IWorkflowAdapter callers\nare unaffected.\n\nNot done (real, separate infra work, not part of this pass): Golden Path\n#3''s ClusterWorkflow (routers/recommendations.py''s\nrec-train-register-golden-path template) — trigger_workflow() already\nsupports it generically, only its ClusterWorkflow object is missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74bcea6cffab7fce5a279a32981890def07d5382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/74bcea6cffab7fce5a279a32981890def07d5382"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDNmMjA4MmE0NTEyYjQyMTBjZWM4MzA1ODM1YTQ3ZTk1ZmQ2NDNiMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd","sha":"2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd"}],"sha":"3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/3f2082a4512b4210cec8305835a47e95fd643b25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:27:46Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:27:46Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: OpenChoreo migration Phase 1 — wrap MLflow/Qdrant/LiteLLM as ClusterResourceType\n\nVerified live against the real cluster (per the plan''s own instruction —\nread kubectl get clustercomponenttype service -o yaml first, not guessed):\nClusterResourceType.spec.resources requires >=1 entry (minItems: 1\nconfirmed via the CRD schema), so a pure-metadata type still needs one\nharmless K8s object — a ConfigMap recording the url, which nothing reads;\noutputs.url computes straight from parameters.url via CEL, independent of\nthat ConfigMap.\n\nAlso discovered while doing this: infra/openchoreo/platform/*.yaml\n(project.yaml et al.) had never actually been applied to this cluster\ndespite the migration doc''s \"confirmed real, not guessed\" claim —\n`kubectl get projects.openchoreo.dev -A` only showed the pre-existing\n`default` Project, zero Components/Workloads anywhere. Applied\nproject.yaml for real first (a genuine Phase 1 prerequisite): its\nProjectRelease auto-generated with hash 6d675ddbf6 — matching the\nalready-committed projectreleasebinding-development.yaml exactly (the\nhash turned out to be a deterministic content-hash of the shared\nClusterProjectType/DeploymentPipeline spec, not random, so the\nalready-written file was correct once a real Project existed to test it\nagainst) — applied that too. No controller-manager restart needed this\ntime (the known reconciler bug the doc flagged didn''t reproduce for this\nparticular Project).\n\nSkipped Feast (the plan''s 4th target): verified adapters/feature_store_adapter.py\nuses FeastAdapter(repo_path=...) reading a local file-based repo directly\nvia the feast Python library — no docker-compose service, no network\nport, nothing that fits \"external-service with a url\" at all.\n\nKiểm chứng: `kubectl get resource -n default` shows mlflow/qdrant/litellm,\nall `Ready: True` (\"ResourceRelease <name>-<hash> in place\") — matches the\nplan''s own stated verification step exactly. No changes to\nadapters/mlflow_adapter.py, vector_db_adapter.py, or llm_gateway_adapter.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1419aa2cadf36ca8cbd009d5f51c9db92f26332f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/1419aa2cadf36ca8cbd009d5f51c9db92f26332f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDIyMDJmMTA4NDg1Y2M4MjMyMjVlZmM5MGJlZGExYmQwOWNlZjE5Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184","sha":"5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184"}],"sha":"2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/2202f108485cc823225efc90beda1bd09cef19cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:15:19Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:15:19Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"docs: remove dead infra/kargo references (removed early on, never installed)\n\ninfra/kargo/ was deleted at commit ef533e4, long before any of these 7\nfiles'' Kargo descriptions were written to look current — they still\npresented it as the live staging/prod promotion mechanism and pointed\nreaders at infra/kargo/README.md and specific warehouse-*.yaml/stage-*.yaml\nfiles, none of which exist. Confirmed via a live user question: OpenChoreo\nfully replacing Kargo was never in doubt design-wise\n(infra/openchoreo/deployment-pipeline.yaml''s own top comment already says\n\"Replaces infra/kargo/*''s Warehouse/Stage/PromotionTask promotion role\")\nbut that DeploymentPipeline mechanism isn''t wired yet either (Phase 3/4 of\ndocs/openchoreo-migration-next-steps.md) — get_promotion_status is\ncorrectly mock, its docstring just cited a promotion mechanism that was\nnever real. Reworded all 7 to state plainly: Kargo was removed early on\nand never installed; the intended replacement is OpenChoreo''s\nDeploymentPipeline, not yet wired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d134f18556fdac6a893cfa46ec5d046b740ce8a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/d134f18556fdac6a893cfa46ec5d046b740ce8a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDVmNTUxYjczZWI3YzJkNGZlMDQzMjBjOGNhZDllOTc0NDlkMmYxODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6","sha":"293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6"}],"sha":"5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/5f551b73eb7c2d4fe04320c8cad9e97449d2f184"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T16:44:23Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T16:44:23Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix: MinioObjectStorageAdapter used the raw S3 key as the dataset''s name/uri\n\ndvc push uploads content-addressed (.../files/md5/<hash[:2]>/<hash[2:]>),\nnot under the dataset''s real filename — the adapter was building both\n`name` and `uri` straight from the S3 key''s basename, which is just a hash\nfragment. Every \"S3 / Object storage\" dataset picker entry would therefore\nshow a meaningless hash as its name, and its uri\n(file:///mnt/data/<hash>) 404s: no such flat file exists at the training\npod''s hostPath mount, only data/<use-case>/<real-file> does.\n\nWent undiscovered until now because the mlops-datasets MinIO bucket never\nactually existed on this machine (0 buckets, confirmed via boto3) — so the\nS3 source was always empty and the frontend \"Data source\" dropdown never\nhad anything to show. Created the bucket and ran `dvc push` (backfilling 3\nfiles whose local dvc cache had gone stale) to populate it, which is what\nsurfaced this.\n\nFix: recover the dataset''s real relative path from its local .dvc pointer\nfile (same files/tree LocalFileObjectStorageAdapter already reads),\nkeyed by md5 hash — matches the exact name/uri LocalFileObjectStorageAdapter\nalready produces for the same dataset. An object whose hash has no local\n.dvc pointer, or isn''t shaped like a DVC content address, is skipped\nrather than surfaced as a picker entry that would 404.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b5bc75588b0beb0f7e65e15d6feef288f2d433a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/1b5bc75588b0beb0f7e65e15d6feef288f2d433a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDI5M2VjNzc1ODEwNzkxYWU2NGQyN2MzM2MxYjJhNWVjYzU3NDFjZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/e493264712fd0cdc01fe4d2ede3ece09d29ac17a","sha":"e493264712fd0cdc01fe4d2ede3ece09d29ac17a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/e493264712fd0cdc01fe4d2ede3ece09d29ac17a"}],"sha":"293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/293ec775810791ae64d27c33c1b2a5ecc5741cd6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/e493264712fd0cdc01fe4d2ede3ece09d29ac17a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:55:43Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:55:43Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor: rename golden-paths-server to llmops-golden-paths-server, add mlops-golden-paths-server\n\nRenamed for domain-naming symmetry now that there are two Golden Path MCP\nservers: llmops-golden-paths-server (prompt/RAG — draft_prompt,\nevaluate_prompt, activate_prompt, rag_ingest, rag_evaluate, rag_activate)\nand the new mlops-golden-paths-server (validate_dataset, trigger_training,\nregister_model, prepare_deploy, prepare_llm_deploy — thin HTTP clients into\norchestration-api''s /datasets, /trigger-training, /models, /deploy-model,\n/llm-deploy, mirroring routers/models.py''s and llm_serving.py''s request\nmodels field-for-field).\n\nKept as a genuinely separate server rather than folded into one, per the\nexisting repo convention of one MCP server per clean domain: each gets its\nown Thunder client identity (llmops-golden-paths-agent /\nmlops-golden-paths-agent) and its own mutate scope\n(llmops-golden-paths:mutate / mlops-golden-paths:mutate) — a compromised\nor over-broadly-granted identity in one domain can''t reach the other.\norchestration-api''s mcp_auth_client.py requests both scopes on its one\nshared outbound token.\n\nRenamed every reference across Makefile/docker-compose.yml/ci.yml/\npyproject.toml/scripts/docs — grepped repo-wide for both the hyphenated\nand underscored (logger name) forms to avoid missing any, careful not to\ntouch unrelated \"/golden-paths\" REST endpoint mentions\n(golden-path-guide-server) or golden-path-guide-server itself (different\nservice, name only overlaps by substring).\n\nAlso fixed a real test-isolation bug found while adding the second\nserver: both servers have identically-named server.py/token_verifier.py/\nthunder_client.py, so putting both directories on pytest''s global\npythonpath (as the original golden-paths-server was) makes a bare `import\nserver` ambiguous — whichever loads first in the session wins for every\ntest after it. Replaced with tests/conftest.py''s load_mcp_server/\nload_module_from_path (load each server''s files by explicit file path\nunder a unique sys.modules alias, restoring — not deleting — whatever was\npreviously cached under the bare names) and removed both directories from\npyproject.toml''s pythonpath/extraPaths entirely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8db5e38d0658bd59e5bb257cb1fd58467a372b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/8db5e38d0658bd59e5bb257cb1fd58467a372b8d"},"url":"https://api.g