 as-is\n(directory not renamed locally, CLAUDE.md notes this explicitly).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37b3ca6659965c6687e1d23c9961f470ff08ce36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/37b3ca6659965c6687e1d23c9961f470ff08ce36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/1e59c3977625c18af3b7b1cda746690eebb01c77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/1e59c3977625c18af3b7b1cda746690eebb01c77","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDFlNTljMzk3NzYyNWMxOGFmM2I3YjFjZGE3NDY2OTBlZWJiMDFjNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0","sha":"9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0"}],"sha":"1e59c3977625c18af3b7b1cda746690eebb01c77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/1e59c3977625c18af3b7b1cda746690eebb01c77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:44:14Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:44:14Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix: correct Thunder audience/scope handling in MCP auth after live verification\n\nRegistered a test client''s real token against a live Thunder instance\n(k3d openchoreo-quick-start) and found the original design''s core\nassumptions were wrong:\n\n- Thunder''s client_credentials tokens carry aud == the caller''s own\n  client_id, never a separate fixed resource string — so\n  token_verifier.py''s THUNDER_AUDIENCE check would have rejected every\n  real caller forever. Replaced with ALLOWED_CLIENT_IDS, an allowlist\n  checked by membership (default: orchestration-api-agent).\n- Thunder grants whatever scope a client_credentials request explicitly\n  asks for (no per-app scope restriction observed) rather than issuing\n  configured scopes automatically — mcp_auth_client.py now requests\n  golden-paths:mutate explicitly on every token fetch.\n\nVerified live end-to-end against the running server with a real\nThunder-issued token: no token -> rejected at the transport; valid token +\nconfirm=False -> \"confirmation required\"; valid token + confirm=True + no\nscope -> \"token missing required scope\"; valid token + confirm=True +\ncorrect scope -> passes the gate entirely. golden-paths-agent/\norchestration-api-agent themselves still aren''t registered in Thunder —\nattempted via 3 different paths (unauthenticated, an existing app''s own\ntoken, kubectl exec into the pod) and all returned 401/403; Thunder''s\none-time bootstrap window has already closed and needs real admin access\nthis session doesn''t have. Documented exactly what''s needed in\ngolden-paths-server/README.md for whoever has that access.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49966a9bdd8b93a676464e1f17da3c15bd2cc40e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/49966a9bdd8b93a676464e1f17da3c15bd2cc40e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDlhOGM4MjJlYWYyZDI0MWQ5NWI2MGJiODdkODNhNTA5ZGIwZjhjYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/7f4d7d39a0d01ce21a0bc61219a4f8d58700d433","sha":"7f4d7d39a0d01ce21a0bc61219a4f8d58700d433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/7f4d7d39a0d01ce21a0bc61219a4f8d58700d433"}],"sha":"9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9a8c822eaf2d241d95b60bb87d83a509db0f8cc0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/7f4d7d39a0d01ce21a0bc61219a4f8d58700d433/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:31:54Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:31:54Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor: clean up OpenChoreo-superseded infra, harden MCP auth, prep factory.py for OpenChoreo adapters\n\n- adapters/factory.py: _use_mock -> 3-way _backend_mode (mock/legacy/openchoreo)\n  for get_workflow_adapter/get_kserve_adapter, ready for\n  OpenChoreoWorkflowAdapter/OpenChoreoInferenceAdapter without spaghetti\n- golden-paths-server: server-side Thunder token verification\n  (token_verifier.py) closes the confused-deputy gap where a caller could\n  bypass chat.py''s confirmation by hitting /mcp directly; activate_prompt/\n  rag_activate now also require confirm=True + golden-paths:mutate scope\n- orchestration-api: persona-scoped MCP tool list (persona_tool_scope.py,\n  deny-by-default) plus a real confirmed_tool_call resubmission flow in\n  chat.py instead of a dead-end pending_confirmation message\n- mcp_auth_client.py: orchestration-api''s own Thunder identity when\n  connecting out to an MCP server\n- remove infra/helm-charts/{orchestration-api,portal} and their\n  environments/*/values.yaml — superseded by\n  infra/openchoreo/platform/*.yaml, verified zero *.py references before\n  deleting; infra/environments/*/inference-services/ left untouched (still\n  live, GP#2''s current deploy mechanism)\n- fix stale docs: dead infra/openchoreo/README.md reference, wrong\n  examples/templates/ paths (real path is templates/<name>/template.yaml),\n  keycloak_client.py -> thunder_client.py rename, \"2 golden path\" ->\n  3 (GP#3 recommend-train-register exists)\n- tests: test_token_verifier.py, test_persona_tool_scope.py,\n  test_golden_paths_server.py (new); test_chat_router.py/test_mcp_client.py\n  updated for the new confirm/persona-filter behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4c2fb370d3b9bbb0108ed8141ee0eb11344889f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/f4c2fb370d3b9bbb0108ed8141ee0eb11344889f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/7f4d7d39a0d01ce21a0bc61219a4f8d58700d433","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/7f4d7d39a0d01ce21a0bc61219a4f8d58700d433","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDdmNGQ3ZDM5YTBkMDFjZTIxYTBiYzYxMjE5YTRmOGQ1ODcwMGQ0MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct92