owers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9e2a470ca75ca6bde1315522ec1c42394582bc5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:37:49Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:37:49Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: RQ1 DORA metrics + fix LiteLLM ollama tool-calling (RQ3)\n\nRQ1 (Lead Time/Deployment Frequency): extend WorkflowStatus with Argo\nnode timestamps, compute Golden Path lead-time/step-duration/completion\nPrometheus metrics in-process (no cross-cluster Prometheus bridge needed),\nadd a Grafana DORA dashboard.\n\nAlso fixes a real, previously-unnoticed bug found along the way: feast\nsets PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR on import, which silently made\norchestration-api''s /metrics endpoint return an empty body for every\nmetric (including the pre-existing Request rate/latency dashboard) —\nunset it before exposing /metrics.\n\nRQ3 (dev chat): bump LiteLLM main-v1.66.0-stable -> 1.99.1. Verified fix\nfor BerriAI/litellm#19742 (ollama_chat/ tool_calls dropped to raw JSON\ntext) via BerriAI/litellm#40611 — confirmed both llama3.1-local and\nqwen2.5-local now return structured tool_calls, end-to-end through\nrouters/chat.py''s tool loop.\n\nAlso completes a small pre-existing loose end that was blocking every\ncommit''s pre-commit typecheck: IFeatureStoreAdapter.list_available_features\nhad a call site (routers/models.py''s /features route, already committed)\nbut no interface declaration or FeastAdapter implementation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fc8ec4d86efef79385d0dcd9e85510059a5bea0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/1fc8ec4d86efef79385d0dcd9e85510059a5bea0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/9e2a470ca75ca6bde1315522ec1c42394582bc5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9e2a470ca75ca6bde1315522ec1c42394582bc5b","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDllMmE0NzBjYTc1Y2E2YmRlMTMxNTUyMmVjMWM0MjM5NDU4MmJjNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/34d2a7e9266786ddaecb6d0f1b53b62fab237ee0","sha":"34d2a7e9266786ddaecb6d0f1b53b62fab237ee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/34d2a7e9266786ddaecb6d0f1b53b62fab237ee0"}],"sha":"9e2a470ca75ca6bde1315522ec1c42394582bc5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9e2a470ca75ca6bde1315522ec1c42394582bc5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/34d2a7e9266786ddaecb6d0f1b53b62fab237ee0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T23:21:21Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T23:21:21Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: add golden-path-guide-server MCP server for \"how do I run X\" lookup\n\nRead-only MCP server (list_golden_paths, get_golden_path_guide) that lets\nthe Portal Assistant chat answer \"how do I run Golden Path X\" — reads live\nBackstage Catalog Template entities via 2 new orchestration-api endpoints\n(GET /golden-paths, GET /golden-paths/{name}), never a RAG index, so it''s\nalways in sync with the real template.yaml and needs no re-ingest step.\n\nAlso fixes BACKSTAGE_BASE_URL never being overridden for the\norchestration-api container — it silently fell back to core/config.py''s\nlocalhost:7007 default (itself inside the container), breaking both this\nnew lookup and the pre-existing MCP-server discovery from day one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b7638bcfa174772fc4974bbf352839f3da3d8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/7b7638bcfa174772fc4974bbf352839f3da3d8d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/34d2a7e9266786ddaecb6d0f1b53b62fab237ee0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github