s://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/6c76083210341329ce1bd4b45baec1187956c853/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:43:55Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:43:55Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat: OpenChoreo Phase 2, sub-steps 2.1-2.2\n\n- fraud-detection/: spike proving Component (cronjob/scheduled-task) +\n  Environment + DeploymentPipeline replace Argo CronWorkflow/ArgoCD/Kargo\n  as the scheduling/promotion layer, with no change to the real MLOps\n  logic in adapters/ or services/orchestration-api.\n- platform/: orchestration-api deployed as a real Component\n  (ClusterComponentType \"service\") — confirmed end to end (200 from its\n  real FastAPI app via OpenChoreo''s own gateway URL). portal declared\n  (ClusterComponentType \"web-application\") but not yet built+deployed —\n  separate pass.\n- 2.2: Environment + DeploymentPipeline needed no new work (already\n  proven by the fraud-detection spike); infra/argocd/, infra/kargo/,\n  infra/kubara/ and the ArgoCD-only scripts/setup-kserve-argocd-local.sh\n  deleted, docs updated to point at this directory instead.\n- 2.3-notes.md: scoping findings for the next sub-step — KServe isn''t\n  installed on this cluster (no CRDs), so an InferenceService\n  ComponentType has nothing to wrap yet; the Keycloak realm export has no\n  real users/roles to migrate to Thunder, only 1 OAuth client.\n- README.md also documents a real OpenChoreo control-plane reconciler bug\n  hit live in this session (DeploymentPipeline/ReleaseBinding getting\n  stuck on a new Project or a Component parameter change).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GaHgYywcfxQKwFQfHtyF6H","tree":{"sha":"1d06e5ca84783f5042c35853bbdf2a1d136ec2f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/1d06e5ca84783f5042c35853bbdf2a1d136ec2f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/6c76083210341329ce1bd4b45baec1187956c853","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/6c76083210341329ce1bd4b45baec1187956c853","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDZjNzYwODMyMTAzNDEzMjljZTFiZDRiNDViYWVjMTE4Nzk1NmM4NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021","sha":"9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021"}],"sha":"6c76083210341329ce1bd4b45baec1187956c853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/6c76083210341329ce1bd4b45baec1187956c853"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:42:45Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:42:45Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix: 3 real Dockerfile bugs + MLflow''s DNS-rebinding host check\n\nThis image apparently had never actually been built+run before — building\nit for real (to deploy orchestration-api as an OpenChoreo Component,\ninfra/openchoreo/platform/) surfaced:\n- uv''s installed uvicorn console-script landed at\n  site-packages/bin/uvicorn, off $PATH.\n- adapters/ is vendored into this image but its own\n  requirements.lock.txt was never installed — now resolved together with\n  orchestration-api''s own lock file in one `uv pip install` call, which\n  surfaced 9 real version conflicts between the two independently-locked\n  files (container-overrides.txt + uv''s --overrides).\n- FeastAdapter() (constructed eagerly at routers/models.py''s module scope)\n  needs infra/feature-store/, never copied into the image.\n\nSeparately, MLflow 3.x''s DNS-rebinding protection 403s any request whose\nHost header isn''t localhost — rejecting every in-cluster caller reaching\nit via host.docker.internal. Fixed via MLFLOW_SERVER_ALLOWED_HOSTS\n(server config, not a client-side bug).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GaHgYywcfxQKwFQfHtyF6H","tree":{"sha":"07c340e1f868d80beb1e64271dc9750b019d3571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/07c340e1f868d80beb1e64271dc9750b019d3571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKDljMjdmNzNmMGJkNDM0OGRhZmJlMDEwMDU5YTk5YWQ5Yzk2MjIwMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/4b957e564c27dc7f620d01a4fbfd3dee4c6d7dd8","sha":"4b957e564c27dc7f620d01a4fbfd3dee4c6d7dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/4b957e564c27dc7f620d01a4fbfd3dee4c6d7dd8"}],"sha":"9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/9c27f73f0bd4348dafbe010059a99ad9c9622021"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/4b957e564c27dc7f620d01a4fbfd3dee4c6d7dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:42:04Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:42:04Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"fix: strip whitespace from dataset_uri before treating it as a path\n\nA dataset_uri with a trailing space (easy to pick up via copy-paste) made\nPath(...) point one character past the real file, 500ing with\nFileNotFoundError on /datasets/validate instead of a normal validation\nresult — and would have 500ed again later in /trigger-training for the\nsame reason. Also updates a stale doc-comment pointer from the now-deleted\ninfra/kargo/README.md to infra/openchoreo/deployment-pipeline.yaml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GaHgYywcfxQKwFQfHtyF6H","tree":{"sha":"bf7f644c0247b353d0be2017132dbf59278b5502","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/bf7f644c0247b353d0be2017132dbf59278b5502"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/4b957e564c27dc7f620d01a4fbfd3dee4c6d7dd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct92