YzNTA2MzBkMTdlN2Q0NWZlMmU5ZDlkOGQ1NzQ2MTY4MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/f3bdaf45481e46acc627bbbf66b12f135f7282bd","sha":"f3bdaf45481e46acc627bbbf66b12f135f7282bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/f3bdaf45481e46acc627bbbf66b12f135f7282bd"}],"sha":"a285bc6350630d17e7d45fe2e9d9d8d574616818","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/a285bc6350630d17e7d45fe2e9d9d8d574616818"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/f3bdaf45481e46acc627bbbf66b12f135f7282bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:17:56Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:17:56Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(mcp): add 3 read-only LLMOps observability tools\n\nget_llm_spend (real — LiteLLM''s GET /global/spend/report, new\nILLMGatewayAdapter.get_spend_report), get_active_prompt_version /\nget_active_rag_version (real — HTTP calls to orchestration-api''s\nGET /prompts and the new GET /rag/{collection}, added because no read\nendpoint existed for RAG''s active version before; deliberately not a\nshared-file read across containers — every other real integration here is\nalready an HTTP call to another service), and get_eval_score_trend (mock\n— evaluations/llm_judge.py''s judge_response() scores each call but\nnothing persists results anywhere yet, so there''s no real trend to read).\n\nThese mirror MLOps'' existing tools (list_experiments/check_model_latency)\nbut for what''s actually worth observing on the LLMOps side — cost, which\nprompt/RAG version is live (LLMOps releases are Instant-only, no Git/\nArgoCD trail), and eval quality. Added to the existing observability-server\nrather than a new llmops-observability-server, per the previous commit''s\nreasoning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QT3ax7PuVQpqbEXEicBrqm","tree":{"sha":"9469386e60b2af7f37c31ed6bce42385a145fd78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/9469386e60b2af7f37c31ed6bce42385a145fd78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/f3bdaf45481e46acc627bbbf66b12f135f7282bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organization