iptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/ffa8a9cf7f1fdada8a77d7d6e8c5dac0ff8473c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:17:07Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:17:07Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"refactor(mcp): rename mlops-observability-server to observability-server\n\nIts own docstring already said it \"merges what used to be 3 separate\nservers\" and covers \"system/model health\" broadly — the mlops- prefix was\ninaccurate even before this session''s LLMOps tooling, and doesn''t need a\nsibling llmops-observability-server (see the session''s reasoning on why\nthat would be tool pileup, not this repo''s existing merge-into-one\nprecedent). Pure rename — directory, service/container name, Catalog\nComponent/API ids, image tags, all path references across\nMakefile/docker-compose/CI/docs. No behavior change; the actual new\nLLMOps tools land in the next commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QT3ax7PuVQpqbEXEicBrqm","tree":{"sha":"4e58aa035db0cf3d95ded5be7cdc4f1086026053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/4e58aa035db0cf3d95ded5be7cdc4f1086026053"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/commits/ffa8a9cf7f1fdada8a77d7d6e8c5dac0ff8473c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/ffa8a9cf7f1fdada8a77d7d6e8c5dac0ff8473c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTV01PNoAKGZmYThhOWNmN2YxZmRhZGE4YTc3ZDdkNmU4YzVkYWMwZmY4NDczYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commit/eb694e79e4fec90b1ec42953b212b583ea9f98bf","sha":"eb694e79e4fec90b1ec42953b212b583ea9f98bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/eb694e79e4fec90b1ec42953b212b583ea9f98bf"}],"sha":"ffa8a9cf7f1fdada8a77d7d6e8c5dac0ff8473c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/ffa8a9cf7f1fdada8a77d7d6e8c5dac0ff8473c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111407982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cuongct924","id":111407982,"login":"cuongct924","node_id":"U_kgDOBqPzbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuongct924","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/commits/eb694e79e4fec90b1ec42953b212b583ea9f98bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:05:39Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:05:39Z","email":"cuongct0902@gmail.com","name":"Cuongit1-hust"},"message":"feat(gitops): add Kargo manifests for per-tenant dev->staging->prod promotion\n\ninfra/kargo/ — Project + ProjectConfig (staging auto-promotes, prod has no\nmatching promotionPolicy so it requires manual approval, per tenant,\nindependently), 2 Warehouses and 4 Stages (mlops-team/llmops-team x\nstaging/prod), and a shared PromotionTask. This is the OSS, non-lock-in\nreplacement for ConfigHub''s release/approval role (akuity/kargo, Apache\n2.0, built by the Argo CD team) — see the session''s research on why\nConfigHub itself was rejected.\n\nkargo isn''t installed in this environment; field-level schema was\nconfirmed against docs.kargo.io examples where fetched (Project,\nProjectConfig.promotionPolicies, Stage.requestedFreight/promotionTemplate)\nbut 2 specifics are best-effort reconstructions, flagged in each file''s\ncomments and infra/kargo/README.md: the Warehouse git-subscription\nnesting, and the copy promotion step''s inPath/outPath field names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QT3ax7PuVQpqbEXEicBrqm","tree":{"sha":"0c40dd3c057302431437c24b9d32d55dac1ed38b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cuongct924/AI-delivery-portal-backend/git/trees/0c40dd3c057302431437c24b9d32d55dac1ed38b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/