thub.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commit/e70fcd74070c598c071d4135a09bd78c160cac53","node_id":"C_kwDOTV93CdoAKGU3MGZjZDc0MDcwYzU5OGMwNzFkNDEzNWEwOWJkNzhjMTYwY2FjNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commit/c9b1d8ff9351d90d20c0cf1e3d051d0ee100541d","sha":"c9b1d8ff9351d90d20c0cf1e3d051d0ee100541d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/c9b1d8ff9351d90d20c0cf1e3d051d0ee100541d"}],"sha":"e70fcd74070c598c071d4135a09bd78c160cac53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/e70fcd74070c598c071d4135a09bd78c160cac53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66273559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jpsingaraju","id":66273559,"login":"jpsingaraju","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MjczNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpsingaraju","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/c9b1d8ff9351d90d20c0cf1e3d051d0ee100541d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T19:18:42Z","email":"pran.singaraju@gmail.com","name":"Jathin Pranav Singaraju"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T19:18:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[marketplace] fix skill shadowed by command + discover-first routing (#107)\n\n* feat(marketplace): discover-first commerce routing + provisioning guidance\n\nMake the model reliably reach for the Marketplace when an app needs an\nexternal service, instead of hardcoding a provider from memory.\n\n- knowledge-update (always-injected at session start): add a discover-first\n  directive — load the `marketplace` skill, then discover + provision a real\n  integration BEFORE planning/writing code/asking.\n- marketplace SKILL.md: broaden the description (commerce/payments/etc. as the\n  catch-all for capabilities without a dedicated skill); restructure into\n  discover -> install -> build with an anti-mock/anti-punt rule; add a\n  Recommendations section keyed on the product-catalog test (commerce vs\n  payments), with no hardcoded providers (discover names them).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(marketplace): remove command that shadowed the skill; tighten routing\n\nThe `marketplace` skill and `/marketplace` command shared a name, so the\ncommand shadowed the skill — Skill(vercel:marketplace) loaded the command''s\nrunbook instead, and the skill''s routing guidance never reached the model.\n\nRemove the command (marketplace is skill-only, like the other capabilities)\nso the skill loads, and tighten routing: discover-first flow, a preferred-\nprovider table (commerce -> Shopify, payments -> Stripe), and a slimmer\nknowledge-update that points at the skill.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(release): patch-bump plugin manifests to 0.45.1\n\nBackwards-compatible fix (marketplace skill routing); bump the version in\nall three shipped manifests (.claude-plugin, .cursor-plugin, .plugin).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e39327de2865b18ee3f7eadf3aff6b4a9473556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/trees/6e39327de2865b18ee3f7eadf3aff6b4a9473556"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/commits/c9b1d8ff9351d90d20c0cf1e3d051d0ee100541d","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e39327de2865b18ee3f7eadf3aff6b4a9473556\nparent 5325c6567f64e3b3df1ceb25a5a371c55a47f797\nauthor Jathin Pranav Singaraju <pran.singaraju@gmail.com> 1782933522 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782933522 -0700\n\n[marketplace] fix skill shadowed by command + discover-first routing (#107)\n\n* feat(marketplace): discover-first commerce routing + provisioning guidance\n\nMake the model reliably reach for the Marketplace when an app needs an\nexternal service, instead of hardcoding a provider from memory.\n\n- knowledge-update (always-injected at session start): add a discover-first\n  directive — load the `marketplace` skill, then discover + provision a real\n  integration BEFORE planning/writing code/asking.\n- marketplace SKILL.md: broaden the description (commerce/payments/etc. as the\n  catch-all for capabilities without a dedicated skill); restructure into\n  discover -> install -> build with an anti-mock/anti-punt rule; add a\n  Recommendations section keyed on the product-catalog test (commerce vs\n  payments), with no hardcoded providers (discover names them).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(marketplace): remove command that shadowed the skill; tighten routing\n\nThe `marketplace` skill and `/marketplace` command shared a name, so the\ncommand shadowed the skill — Skill(vercel:marketplace) loaded the command''s\nrunbook instead, and the skill''s routing guidance never reached the model.\n\nRemove the command (marketplace is skill-only, like the other capabilities)\nso the skill loads, and tighten routing: discover-first flow, a preferred-\nprovider table (commerce -> Shopify, payments -> Stripe), and a slimmer\nknowledge-update that points at the skill.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(release): patch-bump plugin manifests to 0.45.1\n\nBackwards-compatible fix (marketplace skill routing); bump the version in\nall three shipped manifests (.claude-plugin, .cursor-plugin, .plugin).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRWgSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACZwQACQO0+VfoJcLuuV33jUAw199\nvM0QqELCCli0nMJZ23vMdbbsulrN4nK4Jkx8su6fZOuv4djGPJRCKwvosCw6SeUs\nJoFZBKBERb6ZxhigTbibkd5kb4mvcSL6pKHOAgg4VtZNORRb4VdIOwqAKCJrA0bt\npfnQE5c/ClINTSks+ReoXFZAHfz9WUXznTwM2Sdi3Z//OUTDoa8DdIJ/HJP3KU36\njaXJHh+XWX15mW1f5BsKlgiblMnYecl3fCWghbsX/hKpkitmDIveaaofarDZCBrZ\nw/OJTWcWenJg1tfW1M8pwUxsFge3HG9u0ONH9izxXgXMBhQ8Hns0Tu6onM7Z/TF3\nOCAhIoVnYgteVkalPkv62R9V/AqFNNQBJaHMkNM/e6gJ150gbomOGk5dMCjUr0G9\nvP6ncbKz/uANGXnS1bQrpDydX+6zpqkduuO4QALdtX24jdfXXHmjHl7R6S7NGisI\nYMS+TQ7W7HAdlV9qmI8DQ39xMBDIVsRnRyOYaFdWiRiYomuYeG+Q6gmfcRjHGY+a\nLGLBbYs4NqlWoYyBApxu409dvrmaJ1u6nDojKQL+dVVQNHT9QKV2453brMviQYwM\n9Zs04kZ3+UDC2JgS6xEgN+1DhJ0GPI4vHdDJhP0jkfcImcExGulv8K3uS+H8bQFF\nlivvTICaNKlK1yIjtBnj\n=86ep\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T08:13:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"ht