b.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/commits/a0eb37746f6b426a5649525c3fc65917e6ddd9bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 12fa5c480f362b52142bd8058edfdf5b01421334\nparent 375ea4c515ae7a026684faf9d9a7fe20a3f6f2d1\nauthor MelkeyDev <53410236+Melkeydev@users.noreply.github.com> 1782822417 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782822417 -0700\n\nUpdating Knowledge graph for new ship features (#106)\n\n* knowledge-update: add 5GB package size + 100MB request body Functions limits\n\nAdd two new platform corrections to the knowledge-update skill:\n- Functions now support up to 5 GB package size on Fluid Compute (was 250 MB)\n- Functions now accept request bodies up to 100 MB (was 4.5 MB)\n\nAlso fix the now-stale bundle-size troubleshooting line in vercel-functions\nand bump the knowledge-update header date.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* adding knowledge update for functions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQ7YRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAurYQAHuUiQwleV4kFk/0bID5j7hi\nCaOeNGH/HgMSNALkDydYn9akgEkIOiJrWg77jXY0G+5c8X+W4H/c6vblOscgsoHu\nBCXrF3kYIBkSmYDsO3Ma8MxIkJqWm+FQMed4TK+KJgM1bHyXMK9KaK5JqYPcYkOI\nq4I9RtUOIDz7Ozt3P10s/C4EtrAJehEap6YvHGXFIdYWifm7//Ti4R+6g6rBtPpo\n9j5PxIG4+AExoGD6ob6eBAJRah9X7UsYkfxDYW/ZVa+r9mtr9WoOUpak4NiW4HHL\n2pdXnX1NQSoiBBNfwXrW2z5uSnNmwUBC4uS67DFWhpPbTw3Kd1ppRQ0JUXhPI8HI\nAhthOJh7Rn2RYWsd22OthOEriHktpnnEsuR5H5XZ8XWlEarWQrt1zHsme+gm15Ok\nJa00pCZg4WS63qVCxLSvuzNWEbxc75GUrz7vNwMHqMI3zt05yOilCzz+HyNWIxHx\nBeox2FasSQ197Gm4f4zzAcOy3/IcUpGaxl4rnxgszevl8LwjNHTurDLtjJ2YECUb\nkb5VZ/RF48IurUho4ndvaerUQzAs1NclFxOpYiG9Zuk2erboXpThtTyQrpxHmUNY\nVZqWXaxXyjVIGwqrqYa7nXrgwNFPtFuBthdpus6MDLR4RQ5F389Ix8qxfX83oxGr\nKaEYYDr5PYsHCGPNj39N\n=Ieva\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T08:13:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.