thub.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/b73bc95636c4f4d749ea242b669e0f78f5e72751/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:21:42Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tim White"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:21:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add microfrontends skill (#97)\n\n* feat: add microfrontends skill\n\nAdds the `microfrontends` skill (SKILL.md + 6 reference docs covering\nconfiguration, path-routing, local development, management, security,\nand troubleshooting) for building, configuring, and deploying\nmicrofrontends on Vercel.\n\nTriggering covers the common entry points:\n- pathPatterns: microfrontends.json / apps/*/microfrontends.json\n- bashPatterns: `vercel microfrontends` / `vercel mf`, and\n  npm/pnpm/bun/yarn install of @vercel/microfrontends\n- importPatterns: @vercel/microfrontends\n\nRegenerates generated/skill-manifest.json and generated/skill-catalog.md\n(now 27 skills) and updates the vercel.md ecosystem graph.\n\nRebased onto current main as a single signed commit (supersedes #35).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(microfrontends): trim reference boilerplate\n\nLowest-risk size reduction with no loss of factual content:\n- Remove Table-of-Contents blocks from local-development, managing-\n  microfrontends, and troubleshooting references. No other skill''s\n  reference files use a ToC (0 of 51 repo-wide) — these were the only\n  outliers; removal aligns with house convention. Section anchors are\n  unaffected, so in-doc links still resolve.\n- Tighten security.md: dedupe repeated \"verified only by…\" prose and\n  collapse repeated full URLs. All 13 original links preserved.\n\nNet: -64 lines across 4 reference files. References are loaded on demand\n(grep), not part of the injected SKILL.md budget, so this is a read-cost\nand maintainability win, not an injection-size change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version for all providers; bump to 0.44.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: update telemetry version assertions to 0.44.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aaebf8c467e4bdff22dccc2e9f6f67530088a76b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/trees/aaebf8c467e4bdff22dccc2e9f6f67530088a76b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/commits/b73bc95636c4f4d749ea242b669e0f78f5e72751","verification":{"payload":"tree aaebf8c467e4bdff22dccc2e9f6f67530088a76b\nparent 6e51924cb249e2941de005d59f1ac6f768477b98\nauthor Tim White <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1780989702 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780989702 +0100\n\nfeat: add microfrontends skill (#97)\n\n* feat: add microfrontends skill\n\nAdds the `microfrontends` skill (SKILL.md + 6 reference docs covering\nconfiguration, path-routing, local development, management, security,\nand troubleshooting) for building, configuring, and deploying\nmicrofrontends on Vercel.\n\nTriggering covers the common entry points:\n- pathPatterns: microfrontends.json / apps/*/microfrontends.json\n- bashPatterns: `vercel microfrontends` / `vercel mf`, and\n  npm/pnpm/bun/yarn install of @vercel/microfrontends\n- importPatterns: @vercel/microfrontends\n\nRegenerates generated/skill-manifest.json and generated/skill-catalog.md\n(now 27 skills) and updates the vercel.md ecosystem graph.\n\nRebased onto current main as a single signed commit (supersedes #35).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(microfrontends): trim reference boilerplate\n\nLowest-risk size reduction with no loss of factual content:\n- Remove Table-of-Contents blocks from local-development, managing-\n  microfrontends, and troubleshooting references. No other skill''s\n  reference files use a ToC (0 of 51 repo-wide) — these were the only\n  outliers; removal aligns with house convention. Section anchors are\n  unaffected, so in-doc links still resolve.\n- Tighten security.md: dedupe repeated \"verified only by…\" prose and\n  collapse repeated full URLs. All 13 original links preserved.\n\nNet: -64 lines across 4 reference files. References are loaded on demand\n(grep), not part of the injected SKILL.md budget, so this is a read-cost\nand maintainability win, not an injection-size change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version for all providers; bump to 0.44.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: update telemetry version assertions to 0.44.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQ