327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/011001af81692399f14056614554b95136ab4327"}],"sha":"8db97f0ce51120ac056a4e557f627a9428db4d74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/8db97f0ce51120ac056a4e557f627a9428db4d74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/977413?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dorelljames","id":977413,"login":"dorelljames","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NzQxMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/commits/011001af81692399f14056614554b95136ab4327/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T02:15:30Z","email":"galangdj@gmail.com","name":"Dorell James"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T02:15:30Z","email":"galangdj@gmail.com","name":"Dorell James"},"message":"fix(ai-gateway): anchor model-slug regex to prevent false positives\n\nThe validator rule in skills/ai-gateway/SKILL.md used `\\d+-\\d+[)''\"]`,\nwhich matched any digit-hyphen-digit followed by a closing bracket,\nquote, or apostrophe — much broader than the intended error class\n(hyphenated model version slugs like \"claude-sonnet-4-5\").\n\nFalse positives seen in real usage:\n  - `(line 13-21):` — matches `13-21)` in markdown line-range references\n  - `\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\"` — matches `0-0\"` in UUIDs\n  - `\"192.168.1.1-2\"` — matches `1-2\"` in IP ranges\n  - `\"1-2\"` — matches `1-2\"` in semver pairs\n\nFix: anchor the pattern on known model-family keywords with `\\b` word\nboundaries, matching the convention used by other patterns in the same\nfile (e.g., line 15: `\\bvercel\\s+env\\s+pull\\b`).\n\n    \\b(claude|gpt|gemini|llama|mistral|qwen|deepseek)[a-z0-9-]*-\\d+-\\d+[a-z0-9-]*\\b\n\nStill catches the intended case (\"claude-sonnet-4-5\",\n\"openai/gpt-5-4\", \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5-20250514\") while\nleaving line ranges, UUIDs, IP ranges, and other incidental\ndigit-hyphen-digit patterns alone.\n\ngenerated/skill-manifest.json regenerated via `bun run build:manifest`.","tree":{"sha":"4f7ec371241a6412b4ed9a12691fbd5c257dce82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/trees/4f7ec371241a6412b4ed9a12691fbd5c257dce82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RUSHYOP/mirror-vercel-vercel-plugin/git/commits/011001af81692399f14056614554b95136ab4327","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f7ec371241a6412b4ed9a12691fbd5c257dce82\nparent 3d9d9cd0fe5d1bdaedb891135a5c45f19190b83f\nauthor Dorell James <galangdj@gmail.com> 1776132930 +0800\ncommitter Dorell James <galangdj@gmail.com> 1776132930 +0800\n\nfix(ai-gateway): anchor model-slug regex to prevent false positives\n\nThe validator rule in skills/ai-gateway/SKILL.md used `\\d+-\\d+[)''\"]`,\nwhich matched any digit-hyphen-digit followed by a closing bracket,\nquote, or apostrophe — much broader than the intended error class\n(hyphenated model version slugs like \"claude-sonnet-4-5\").\n\nFalse positives seen in real usage:\n  - `(line 13-21):` — matches `13-21)` in markdown line-range references\n  - `\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\"` — matches `0-0\"` in UUIDs\n  - `\"192.168.1.1-2\"` — matches `1-2\"` in IP ranges\n  - `\"1-2\"` — matches `1-2\"` in semver pairs\n\nFix: anchor the pattern on known model-family keywords with `\\b` word\nboundaries, matching the convention used by other patterns in the same\nfile (e.g., line 15: `\\bvercel\\s+env\\s+pull\\b`).\n\n    \\b(claude|gpt|gemini|llama|mistral|qwen|deepseek)[a-z0-9-]*-\\d+-\\d+[a-z0-9-]*\\b\n\nStill catches the intended case (\"claude-sonnet-4-5\",\n\"openai/gpt-5-4\", \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5-20250514\") while\nleaving line ranges, UUIDs, IP ranges, and other incidental\ndigit-hyphen-digit patterns alone.\n\ngenerated/skill-manifest.json regenerated via `bun run build:manifest`.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg7MGMwnHqX8iwMmdiKva0fMZQiF\nFuaMfXllk4cnx8LqYAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJhCTde7gLfiRMGMueSZRG9CMYJaHHj70LpgYktx0GmtQv9hdiFd3UAHjnxfN0zCiV\nta8zYSO4pjiyuRjDW3wg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T08:13:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/977413?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dorelljames","id":977413,"login":"dorelljames","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NzQxMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dorelljames","user_vie