llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/552a9a0ffe09c8b4a0f9a7c4e92c89ed4cd2e8f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDU1MmE5YTBmZmUwOWM4YjRhMGY5YTdjNGU5MmM4OWVkNGNkMmU4ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f","sha":"6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f"}],"sha":"552a9a0ffe09c8b4a0f9a7c4e92c89ed4cd2e8f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/552a9a0ffe09c8b4a0f9a7c4e92c89ed4cd2e8f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:35:30Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:35:30Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Implement agent-harness: the actual aib agent driving loop\n\nNew crates/agent: an 11-tool surface (navigate/snapshot/click/type/\npress/wait_for/assert/screenshot/list_pages/switch_page/run_yaml,\nplus task_complete/task_failed) executed directly against\nengine::Session. Recoverable engine errors (stale ref, wait timeout,\nfailed assertion, unknown page/key) and malformed tool-call JSON\ncome back to the model as tool-result text and the loop continues --\nonly a missing session or a genuinely unknown tool name aborts the\nrun. Context pruning elides all but the most recent snapshot-shaped\ntool results before each driver call. Screenshot routing follows the\ndriver role''s own vision capability flag: inline image for a\nvision-capable driver, routed to a configured vision role for text\ninterpretation otherwise, a clear error if neither applies. Skills\nare Markdown files resolved project-local, then per-user, then any\nconfigured extra directories, attached to the system prompt.\n\ncrates/llm/src/config.rs gains resolve_provider_model, a thin\nsibling of resolve_role that resolves a provider/model pair\ndirectly, bypassing the [roles.*] table -- backs the CLI''s\n--driver/--vision <provider>/<model> overrides. New\nLlmError::UnknownProviderDirect keeps its error message specific\neven with no role involved.\n\nNew aib agent <task> CLI (src/agent_cmd.rs): resolves config, roles,\nand skills, launches the browser, runs the task with live step\nprogress (human-readable or --json), and exits 0/1/2 for pass/fail/\nconfig-error.\n\nVerified with 19 new tests (11 unit + 5 agent_loop + 3\nvision_routing) against a real Chrome session and a new hand-rolled\nOpenAI-compatible stub server, plus a manual end-to-end CLI smoke\ntest against a real separate-process stub and real headless Chrome.\nSuite green on host and in the Docker container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cb12bc673b3c7336760f6c323a9fc689106e554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/4cb12bc673b3c7336760f6c323a9fc689106e554"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDZlYjYwZjIzMzJjNzU2OGUxNWFiY2MxYWYyYTdjMjljZGMyODZkNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193","sha":"076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193"}],"sha":"6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/6eb60f2332c7568e15abcc1af2a7c29cdc286d5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:35:09Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:35:09Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Propose agent-harness: the actual aib agent driving loop\n\nThird of four agent-harness changes: crates/agent runs a configured\nLLM driver role in a tool-calling loop against engine::Session,\ndirectly (not through MCP''s #[tool] wrappers), with recoverable\nper-action failures fed back to the model instead of aborting the\nrun, context pruning, capability-flag vision routing, and skills.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f77039b0abe7956345baee738c2f54d9f4cf30dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/f77039b0abe7956345baee738c2f54d9f4cf30dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDA3NmRkOTdhZDk4NWRmYTRjNWU2Nzk5MmUxYTVhZGIzYTliODExOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0","sha":"450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0"}],"sha":"076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/076dd97ad985dfa4c5e67992e1a5adb3a9b81193"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:20:22Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:20:22Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Sync oauth-subscription-auth spec into main tree and archive the change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9de7a4de598c191f079a087cad85ac1543be89c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/c9de7a4de598c191f079a087cad85ac1543be89c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDQ1MGYyOWZjZDA5YzAzOTMzYTllODk0ZjMxMDIyMjE4ZmQ5NjA0ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4","sha":"a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4"}],"sha":"450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/450f29fcd09c03933a9e894f31022218fd9604d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:19:06Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:19:06Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Implement oauth-subscription-auth: PKCE login for ChatGPT subscriptions\n\ncrates/llm/src/auth/ (was a single file, now a directory): PKCE\nverifier/S256 challenge generation, a hand-rolled one-shot local\ncallback listener, login orchestration with best-effort system-browser\nlaunch, form-encoded code exchange / JSON-encoded refresh (a real\nasymmetry confirmed against openai/codex''s own source), a JSON token\nstore (chmod 600 on Unix), and CredentialSource::OAuth with transparent\nrefresh within 60s of expiry. New client_responses.rs: a ResponsesClient\nfor the OpenAI Responses API shape ChatGPT-subscription usage requires,\naggregating its SSE-only backend into the same non-streaming\nChatResponse every other client returns. ProviderKind::OpenAiResponses,\nleft as a placeholder in llm-providers, is now fully wired. New `aib\nauth login/status/logout` CLI commands.\n\nEvery OpenAI endpoint/header/client-id constant was verified directly\nagainst openai/codex''s own source, not third-party writeups. Every\nHTTP-shaped piece is verified against a real local server or socket:\nform-vs-JSON exchange/refresh with real JWT account-id/expiry\nextraction, a real callback listener accepting a real HTTP GET\n(including denied-consent), and ResponsesClient aggregating a genuine\ntext/event-stream byte stream for both text and tool-call replies with\nthe account-id header confirmed on a real outgoing request. The real\nauth.openai.com/chatgpt.com endpoints are explicitly not exercised here\n-- that needs a human logging into a real ChatGPT subscription, left as\na deferred, user-assisted verification step.\n\nA real design bug was found and fixed before shipping: stored tokens\nwere looked up by the config''s provider name while login/refresh saved\nthem keyed by the flow''s own id -- silently broken whenever they\ndiffer. Every test up to that point coincidentally used matching names;\ncaught by deliberately writing one with mismatched names. Fixed by\nkeying storage consistently by flow_id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf2443e654b3689c3abff4b4331f41a1f6ea441c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/cf2443e654b3689c3abff4b4331f41a1f6ea441c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKGE2NzgyNGFkM2M5OTQyYzZkMDI1NDlhMDBlZWNhNzczNDQ3OTYxYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d","sha":"8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d"}],"sha":"a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/a67824ad3c9942c6d02549a00eeca773447961a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:17:25Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:17:25Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Propose oauth-subscription-auth: PKCE login for ChatGPT subscriptions\n\nSecond of four sequential changes building aib''s own LLM agent harness.\nAdds subscription-based OAuth auth alongside llm-providers'' key-based\nauth -- OpenAI''s ChatGPT Plus/Pro/Team/Enterprise subscription via the\nsame PKCE flow and Responses-API backend OpenAI''s own Codex CLI uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a599c774b291e1100c2d8eb5cac4e1e41a94b703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/a599c774b291e1100c2d8eb5cac4e1e41a94b703"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDhiMjgwOTkxMTJlMmUwZjA5NDgwNjhlYTIyMGIyMTk0MWVjNWZlMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc","sha":"620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc"}],"sha":"8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/8b28099112e2e0f0948068ea220b21941ec5fe0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:37:53Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:37:53Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Sync llm-providers spec into main tree and archive the change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efcdff45c0773c65e73968adaa1ca805c4ce8a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/efcdff45c0773c65e73968adaa1ca805c4ce8a00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDYyMGNmNmYyOGViZTcyYzNjODAzMzQzOGIwYmIwMDgzNTEzYzBmY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08","sha":"5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08"}],"sha":"620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/620cf6f28ebe72c3c8033438b0bb0083513c0fcc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:36:53Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:36:53Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Implement llm-providers: provider-agnostic LLM client + config\n\nNew crates/llm: wire-neutral chat types (Message/Part/ToolCall/ToolDef/\nChatRequest/ChatResponse) with zero provider-specific serde shape,\nCompatClient for the OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions wire shape\nDeepSeek/MiniMax/GLM/Grok/OpenAI all speak (text+image content,\nfunction-calling tools, 429/5xx retry with backoff), and\n<data-dir>/aib/config.toml loading (four-way path resolution, a missing\nfile is a valid empty config so browser-only tools never break).\nCredentialSource resolves a literal/env-var key now, structured so a\nlater OAuth variant needs zero call-site changes. New `aib llm ping\n<role>` CLI probe.\n\nLive-verified against a real local HTTP server (not just serialized-shape\nassertions): real socket round trip, Authorization header, 5xx-then-\nsuccess retry, non-retryable 4xx surfaces immediately. Plus a manual\nend-to-end check of `aib llm ping` against a real local stub, confirming\nthe full CLI path works.\n\nA real bug was found and fixed via this module''s own unit tests, not\nassumed correct: #[serde(rename_all = \"kebab-case\")] on ProviderKind\nproduced \"open-ai-compat\" instead of \"openai-compat\" (serde splits\n\"OpenAi\" at each capital letter) -- fixed with explicit per-variant\n#[serde(rename)].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7afe1c2e73815814b824ceb747f9ce06a235641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/a7afe1c2e73815814b824ceb747f9ce06a235641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDU5NTFjYzQ2MDJmOTFmYTJjNWJhNTQ5NjQyMmIwMjEwNzYwZjRkMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea","sha":"a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea"}],"sha":"5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/5951cc4602f91fa2c5ba5496422b0210760f4d08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:35:51Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:35:51Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Propose llm-providers: provider-agnostic LLM client + config\n\nFirst of four sequential changes building aib''s own LLM agent harness\n(multi-provider driving loop over its own browser session). This change\nis the client + config foundation alone: a provider-agnostic\nOpenAI-compatible chat-completions client and role-based config, with no\nagent loop yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58bdbafb2aba4e13759ca76ab710a0e47fc499ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/58bdbafb2aba4e13759ca76ab710a0e47fc499ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKGEzNzI1MmI3NDI1N2I2Nzc5YTU0NmNmMDE1YzU0Yzk3OWExMTdmZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/569d8b86592cdbf33d49ee509424a4613ac8c476","sha":"569d8b86592cdbf33d49ee509424a4613ac8c476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/569d8b86592cdbf33d49ee509424a4613ac8c476"}],"sha":"a37252b74257b6779a546cf015c54c979a117fea","url":"https://api.github.c