ble 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27bb737175ea9d1c07e5bdaa06b5af99f4124be4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/27bb737175ea9d1c07e5bdaa06b5af99f4124be4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/32872a0c428eebb85f636dba32d15206968f5154","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/32872a0c428eebb85f636dba32d15206968f5154","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDMyODcyYTBjNDI4ZWViYjg1ZjYzNmRiYTMyZDE1MjA2OTY4ZjUxNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/e7208b48ebb362a6d6cd2c69f1cb901fe942c95d","sha":"e7208b48ebb362a6d6cd2c69f1cb901fe942c95d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/e7208b48ebb362a6d6cd2c69f1cb901fe942c95d"}],"sha":"32872a0c428eebb85f636dba32d15206968f5154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/32872a0c428eebb85f636dba32d15206968f5154"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/e7208b48ebb362a6d6cd2c69f1cb901fe942c95d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T07:28:52Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T07:28:52Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Implement screencast-capture: CDP screencast, GIF assembly, MCP recording tools\n\nAdds Page.startScreencast/screencastFrame/screencastFrameAck/stopScreencast\nto the CDP layer; engine::Recording runs a background frame collector on\nthe existing bounded event-stream infrastructure and assembles a GIF\n(real per-frame timestamps, not a fixed rate) plus a JSON manifest on\nstop; browser_record_start/browser_record_stop expose it over MCP, capped\nat 30s so a forgotten recording can''t grow unbounded.\n\nTwo real bugs found via the first live integration test run (not by\nwriting code that compiles): awaiting Page.screencastFrameAck inline\ninside the collector''s select! loop meant one slow ack blocked the loop\nfrom ever checking the stop/deadline signals, causing a genuine multi-\nminute hang -- fixed by making acks fire-and-forget. Separately, running\nGIF assembly (JPEG decode + color quantization) directly on the async\nexecutor looked like a second hang in an unoptimized debug build (38.9s);\nmoved it to spawn_blocking (correct regardless of speed) and reduced\ndefault capture to 480x360 / every 3rd frame, bringing release-mode\nrecording down to 5.66s total. Documented in design.md''s addendum.\n\nVerified: 59-frame GIF recorded from a real animated fixture, watched\nlive in a headed browser window and opened afterward\n(manual-headed-recording-verification.txt, sample-recording.gif); 18\ntests pass on Windows and in the Docker container\n(container-test-summary.txt).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3f76cad0b7ae9db5b4dd9b26d3905ca196eaa2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/f3f76cad0b7ae9db5b4dd9b26d3905ca196eaa2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/e7208b48ebb362a6d6cd2c69f1cb901fe942c95d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu