"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:39:21Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Sync phase-0-cdp-spike specs into main tree and archive the change\n\nPromotes the three delta specs (browser-attach, cdp-client, doctor-cli)\ninto openspec/specs/ as the living spec baseline, and moves the completed\nchange to openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-10-phase-0-cdp-spike.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"327e57dbfd1229d2962e8eb3842e8e6aa5d151a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/327e57dbfd1229d2962e8eb3842e8e6aa5d151a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/832d4df98ed3b59cf28abfdd4d2942f8334fd02a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/832d4df98ed3b59cf28abfdd4d2942f8334fd02a","node_id":"C_kwDOTWAagNoAKDgzMmQ0ZGY5OGVkM2I1OWNmMjhhYmZkZDRkMjk0MmY4MzM0ZmQwMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr/truewright/commit/b2fa9ac04800373232fb3d9492c7a2b49b722363","sha":"b2fa9ac04800373232fb3d9492c7a2b49b722363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/b2fa9ac04800373232fb3d9492c7a2b49b722363"}],"sha":"832d4df98ed3b59cf28abfdd4d2942f8334fd02a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/832d4df98ed3b59cf28abfdd4d2942f8334fd02a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/commits/b2fa9ac04800373232fb3d9492c7a2b49b722363/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:36:25Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:36:25Z","email":"ljradicals@gmail.com","name":"Leon Janse van Rensburg"},"message":"Implement Phase 0 CDP spike: minimal CDP client, browser attach, aib doctor\n\nHand-rolled CDP client (crates/cdp) over tokio-tungstenite: flatten-session\ndemux, typed command/event structs for the Browser/Target/Page/Runtime\nsubset, bounded broadcast event streams, and a raw JSON escape hatch.\nBrowser discovery (registry + well-known paths) and launch with an isolated\nprofile directory, never the live default profile.\n\naib doctor runs the full attach->context->page->navigate->evaluate->\nscreenshot->teardown cycle against every installed Chromium browser and\nreports per-step pass/fail plus command round-trip latency (--json for CI).\n\nVerified on this machine: both Chrome and Edge pass all steps, p50 latency\nwell under the 5ms target (Chrome 0.53-1.11ms, Edge 1.27-1.31ms depending\non run) -- see openspec/changes/phase-0-cdp-spike/doctor-evidence.json.\n\nAll 21 tasks in the phase-0-cdp-spike change complete; openspec validate\npasses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b4e5ca580b746d9c3db2c5116c1af7aff201a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/trees/7b4e5ca580b746d9c3db2c5116c1af7aff201a5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonjvr/truewright/git/commits/b2fa9ac04800373232fb3d9492c7a2b49b722363","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leonjvr","id":2134382,"login":"leonjvr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQzODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leonjvr","user_view_ty