","sha":"4ab36a630bbe3a1a2d2ff58d7b15cfbc3bc7737a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresMarulanda10/odelza-platform/commits/4ab36a630bbe3a1a2d2ff58d7b15cfbc3bc7737a"}],"sha":"05afc49ea64c874e0ea296b5d5d4b49bb82c6d6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresMarulanda10/odelza-platform/commits/05afc49ea64c874e0ea296b5d5d4b49bb82c6d6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81605929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abdulrahmancodes","id":81605929,"login":"abdulrahmancodes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNjA1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresMarulanda10/odelza-platform/commits/4ab36a630bbe3a1a2d2ff58d7b15cfbc3bc7737a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T10:44:13Z","email":"81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdul Rahman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T10:44:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"remove nestjs-query from app-token and drop unused createOneAppToken mutation (#22765)\n\n## What\n\nMigrates `app-token` off `@ptc-org/nestjs-query` and removes the\nauto-generated `createOneAppToken` mutation, which was unused dead API\nsurface.\n\n## Why\n\nThe `createOneAppToken` mutation was reachable only from the schema — no\nfrontend query, SDK caller, or test used it. It was also non-functional\n(its input couldn''t set the token `value`), a leftover from\nnestjs-query''s default `create.one` being left enabled. Real app tokens\n(refresh, password-reset, email-verification, invitation, OAuth,\nenterprise) are all created directly via the repository in ~14 services,\nnone of which touched this mutation.\n\n## Notes\n\n- ⚠️ This removes `AppToken`, `createOneAppToken`,\n`CreateAppTokenInput`, and `CreateOneAppTokenInput` from the `/metadata`\nschema, so the **api-breaking-changes check will flag it**\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22765?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Weiko <corentin@twenty.com>","tree":{"sha":"11b9c6c5646478fb962ce71eae5c8f638d48f20f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresMarulanda10/odelza-platform/git/trees/11b9c6c5646478fb962ce71eae5c8f638d48f20f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresMarulanda10/odelza-platform/git/commits/4ab36a630bbe3a1a2d2ff58d7b15cfbc3bc7737a","verification":{"payload":"tree 11b9c6c5646478fb962ce71eae5c8f638d48f20f\nparent 9e20e2222a6b867567f49ddc2c16ea07db54cca7\nauthor Abdul Rahman <81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com> 1783680253 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783680253 +0530\n\nremove nestjs-query from app-token and drop unused createOneAppToken mutation (#22765)\n\n## What\n\nMigrates `app-token` off `@ptc-org/nestjs-query` and removes the\nauto-generated `createOneAppToken` mutation, which was unused dead API\nsurface.\n\n## Why\n\nThe `createOneAppToken` mutation was reachable only from the schema — no\nfrontend query, SDK caller, or test used it. It was also non-functional\n(its input couldn''t set the token `value`), a leftover from\nnestjs-query''s default `create.one` being left enabled. Real app tokens\n(refresh, password-reset, email-verification, invitation, OAuth,\nenterprise) are all created directly via the repository in ~14 services,\nnone of which touched this mutation.\n\n## Notes\n\n- ⚠️ This removes `AppToken`, `createOneAppToken`,\n`CreateAppTokenInput`, and `CreateOneAppTokenInput` from the `/metadata`\nschema, so the **api-breaking-changes check will flag it**\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22765?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Weiko <corentin@twenty.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUMz9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX5wQAEa+snqdWpvFIJEmtdMnVfpU\n8sfDsP2fEmuMUk2pFiV+xAYl6DwF0S0XujJHc5RovJ98oNvhGcatdgwwdOollHAV\nM9qMiV06Zg3mXDJOz0bgpdtPPh9vnyKu3cuuDT8DoBFu2L1HoDEaJsvcl/k8sob2\ntls9MLcdBORzWci/FR0BqhYdiBbJHxCv6qxYOEIYP3IIbCJijtAIE2C1EfbPOlvb\nUuGRR7AMWCq3Vg6BHT9p7KiGDLF9OhMqdJJKTyJmAmWMgelHbiLNWbqH6F3bfIQD\nE/nRWAPH/RkAxY5LG4thfVhs6CHVdIH3uqxnTeYcZonQy1KmAO8k5XIsDqiq2NdH\nDecEoL